<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- In Unicode and with spelling updated from June 2003 version. Spelling and wording updated in 2014-2015.</book>
  <para style="h">Arrusul</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ȓx</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ȓexḏayem</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ȓexḏayem n Arrusul</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ȓexḏayem n Arrusul</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmasiḥ itgaƹƹaḏ ɣar ujenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1-2" />A si Tawfilus, lkitab amezwaru iy uriɣ nec ḏayes marra min igga Ƹisa ḏ min iseȓmaḏ aȓ nhar nni wami itwarfeƹ. Netta qbeȓ <char style="it">ma aḏ itwarfeƹ</char>, iweṣṣa s Arruḥ iqeddsen arrusul iy tuɣa ixḍar inna-asen min ɣa ggen. <verse eid="ACT 1:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Wami iƹḏu ȓaƹḏab n ȓmewṯ nnes, itmeḍhar-asen-d x yijjen n arbeƹin yum isefham-iṯen mebȓa ccekk netta aqa iddar. Itas-d ɣarsen issawaȓ akiḏsen x ȓmulk n Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Wami tuɣa akiḏsen itett, iweṣṣa-aṯen inna-asen: "War teffɣem ca zi ṯendint n Lquds. Rajam aȓ d ɣa yas min iwƹeḏ Baba iy xef ḏawem tuɣa ssiwȓeɣ. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Iƹni Yaḥya iṭehhar i yiwḏan s waman, kenniw war ḏawem iqqim ca aḏ twaṭehharem s Arruḥ iqeddsen."<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Wami munen <char style="it">arrusul</char> ak Ƹisa nnan-as: "A Siḏi, ma ḏeg wussan-a iy d ɣa ṯarreḏ ȓeḥkam ɣar Ayṯ-Israʼil?"<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "War ḏawem itwasmeḥ ca aḏ tessnem lʼawqat niɣ ḏ ttawarix tuɣa igga Baba s ssulṭa nnes. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Walakin axmi xawem d ɣa ihwa Arruḥ iqeddsen, aɣarwem yiȓi jjheḏ. Axafi ṯcehḏem ḏi ṯendint n Lquds ḏ marra ṯimura n Yahuḏiya ḏ Samarya aȓ ṭṭarf uneggaru n ddunect-a."<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Ɣir ikemmeȓ Ƹisa awaȓ nnes, itwarfeƹ ɣar ujenna. Qqimen txezzaren ḏayes uca iweddar-asen ḏeg useynu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aseynu netta ḏ asegnu.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Qqimen txezzaren mliḥ wami yuȓi ɣar ujenna, ƹlaɣafla ufin akiḏsen ṯnayen n iṯarrasen bedden, ɣarsen arruḍ ḏ acemȓaȓ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iṯarrasen-a niṯni ḏ lmalaʼikaṯ, ɣarsen ṣṣifeṯ n bnaḏem.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Nnan-asen: "Ay iryazen n ṯmurṯ n Ljalil, mayemmi ƹaḏ ṯbeddem ḏanita txezzarem ḏeg ujenna? Qa Ƹisa-ya wanita iy ḏawem itwarfƹen ɣar ujenna, mammec ṯ ṯeẓrim igaƹƹeḏ ɣar ujenna amenni iy d ɣa iḏweȓ."<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tixḍaren wenni ɣa yiȓin ḏeg umcan n Yahuḏa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Ssenni ḏewȓen-d arrusul zeg Uḏrar n Zzitun ɣar ṯendint n Lquds ig iggwjen s yijjen n kilumit. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Wami uwḍen, gaƹƹḏen ɣar ṯɣurfat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯɣurfat nettaṯ ḏ ijjen n uxxam x ṯeddarṯ ḏeg ujenna.</char></note> mani tiȓin: Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna ḏ Yaƹqub ḏ Andrus, ḏ Filippas ḏ Tuma ḏ Bartulumay ḏ Matta, ḏ Yaƹqub mmis n Ḥalfa ḏ Simƹan Lmunaḍil, ḏ Yahuḏa mmis n Yaƹqub. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Yina kuȓ nhar tmunen marra s yijjen n lfikra tẓaǧan, akiḏsen can n ṯemɣarin ḏ Maryam yemmas n Ƹisa ḏ ayṯmas.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Ḏeg wussan nni ikkar Buṭrus ibedd ḏi ȓwesṭ n ȓmuminin (ḏinni can miyya u ƹicrin iḏsen) inna-asen: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />"Ay ayṯma, tuɣa itxeṣṣa aḏ ikemmeȓ wawaȓ n Arruḥ iqeddsen iy d yusin x yiȓes n nnabi Dawed ḏeg yijjen n zman wami issiweȓ x Yahuḏa iƹni wenni izenzen Ƹisa isbeyyen-asen abriḏ yuwi yinni iy ṯ iṭṭfen. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yahuḏa-ya tuɣa itwaḥsab zzayneɣ, yuḏef akiḏneɣ ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ n Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />S tmenyaṯ nnes ig iṭṭef n lḥaram, iruḥ isɣa zzaysent ijjen n ṯmurṯ. Ḏinni iy iwḍa s jjheḏ x wuḏem nnes, idduqqez-as uƹeddis menḍaren-as-d marra waḏan nnes. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Arrin-as-d ȓexbar marra ayṯbab n Lquds. X manayenni semman-as i ṯmurṯ nni s wawaȓ nsen &lt;Ḥaqel Damma&gt; iƹni &lt;Iyar n iḏammen.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Netta ḏ igar n ddem. Iƹni ḏ isem n yij umarjeƹ.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Iqqar Lkitab n Zzabur: Arebbi aḏ ixȓa ṯaddarṯ n wenni war ḏayes izeddeɣ ḥadd. Iqqar ƹaweḏ: Ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes at iṭṭef ijjen nneɣni.<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Iḏen, itxeṣṣa a nexḍar ijjen n uryaz zeg yinni tuɣa iǧan akiḏneɣ marra ȓweqṯ nni wami Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itaḏef iteffeɣ xaneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />Iƹni zeg wami iy ṯ iṭehhar Yaḥya s waman aȓ wami iy itwarfeƹ xaneɣ ɣar ujenna. Aryaz-a itxeṣṣa akiḏneɣ icheḏ qa <char style="it">Ƹisa</char> ikkar-d zi ȓmewṯ."<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Kkaren qeddmen ṯnayen n yiwḏan: ijjen qqaren-as Matyas ijjen qqaren-as Yusef. Yusef nni ƹaweḏ qqaren-as Barsaba niɣ Yustus. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Ttaren-as i Arebbi nnan-as: "A Siḏi Arebbi qa cek ṯessneḏ min iǧan ḏeg wuȓawen n yiwḏan marra. Seḍhar-aneɣ-d wenni iy ṯixḍareḏ zi ṯnayen-a. <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />Akiḏneɣ yiȓi ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ-a, aḏ iḏweȓ ḏ arrasul ḏeg umcan n Yahuḏa wenni ig isemḥen ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ-a iruḥ ɣar umcan nnes <char style="it">aƹeffan</char>." <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Uca ggin lqurƹa, lqurƹa nni ṯusa-d ḏi Matyas, arnin-ṯ-iḏ ɣar ḥiṭac nni n arrusul.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Arruḥ iqeddsen ihewwa-d x ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Wami d yuweḍ Ȓƹiḏ n nhar wis xemsin,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ȓƹiḏ n nhar wis xemsin ḏ ijjen n ȓƹiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil itas-asen-d xemsin yum menbaƹd i Ȓƹiḏ ameqqran nsen.</char></note> munen marra <char style="it">ȓmuminin</char> ḏeg yijjen n umcan. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ƹlaɣafla ihwa-d ijjen n ȓḥess zeg ujenna am arriḥ iy itṣuḍen s jjheḏ, yuḏef ḏi mkuȓ jjiheṯ n ṯeddarṯ mani qqimen. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Ẓrin iȓesawen am iṣfeḍawen n ṯmessi iruḥ kuȓ yiȓes waḥḏes imars ij ij x kuȓ ijjen zzaysen. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Ccuren s Arruḥ iqeddsen marra iḏsen, bḏan ssawaȓen s lluɣaṯ war iǧin bu nsen amecnaw mammec ḏasen yuca Arruḥ aḏ ssiwȓen.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ḏinni can iryazen zi Ayṯ-Israʼil teggwḏen Arebbi tzuran ɣar Lquds, niṯni zi marra ṯimura n ddunect-a. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Iryazen nni wami sȓan i ȓḥess nni usin-d munen ḏinni qqimen tƹejjben, mkuȓ ijjen itsȓa i lluɣa nnes. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Ḏehhcen tƹejjben nnan jarasen: "Marra iwḏan-a iy ssawaȓen lʼaṣel nsen zi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil niɣ lla? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Mammec mkuȓ ijjen zzayneɣ itsȓa i lluɣa n ṯmurṯ nnes? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Iƹni ṯamurṯ n Bardaya ḏ Madya ḏ Ƹilam, ḏ imezḏaɣ n Misibuṭamya <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Awaȓ-a qqaren-as s ṯespanyut </char><char style="it">Mesopotamia</char> u s ṯefransist qqaren-as <char style="it">Mésopotamie</char>.</note> ḏ Yahuḏiya ḏ Kapdukya, ḏ Punṭus ḏ Asya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />ḏ Frijya ḏ Pamfilya, ḏ Miṣra ḏ jwayeh n Lqurina ḏi Libya, ḏ yinni itzuran zi ṯendint n Ruma. <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Ḏ Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ yinni iseȓmen ḏi ddin n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ḏ Ayṯ-Krit ḏ waƹraben. Neccin marra netsȓa-yasen ssawaȓen s lluɣaṯ nneɣ x ṯmesȓayin ṯimeqqranin n Arebbi."<verse eid="ACT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Ḏehcen ccekken, bḏan ssawaȓen jarasen nnan: "Min ixes aḏ yini manaya?" <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ȓebƹaḍ ḍeḥcen xasen nnan qa swin aṭṭas n waman uḍiȓ.<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxuṭba ṯamezwarut n arrasul Buṭrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Buṭrus aqaṯ ak ḥiṭac nni n arrusul, ikkar issiweȓ s jjheḏ inna-asen: "Ay iryazen n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ marra imezḏaɣ n Lquds, itxeṣṣa aḏ tessnem aḏ tṣennṭem mliḥ i wawaȓen inu. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Iwḏan-a war swin ca war ɣellan ca s ccreb amecnaw mammec ṯḥessbem minzi ṯsaƹƹat-a ƹaḏ ḏ tesƹa n ṣbaḥ waha! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Lla, issiweȓ nnabi Waʼil x manaya ḏeg yijjen n zman wami inna:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Arebbi inna: Ḏeg wussan ineggura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">aḏ farɣeɣ Arruḥ inu x marra iwḏan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Ṯarwa nwem ḏ yissiṯwem aḏ ssiwȓen s min ƹeȓmen zi Arebbi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Iḥenjiren nwem aḏ ẓren lwaḥi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">iwessura nwem aḏ arjan ṯirja.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ḏeg wussan nni aḏ farɣeɣ Arruḥ inu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">x lƹibad inu iryazen ḏ ṯemɣarin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">aḏ ssiwȓen s min ƹeȓmen zi Arebbi.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Aḏ ggeɣ ȓaƹjayeb ḏeg ujenna ḏ lƹalamaṯ ḏi ṯmurṯ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">aḏ iȓin iḏammen ḏ ṯmessi ḏ waṭṭas n ddexxan.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Ṯfuct aḏ teḏweȓ ḏ ṯaǧest, ṯaziri aḏ teḏweȓ ḏ iḏammen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">qbeȓ iy d ɣa yas Nhar nni ameqqran lƹaḍim n Siḏi Arebbi.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Ssenni marra wenni iy ɣa iȓaɣan s yisem n Siḏi Arebbi ataf aḏ injem.<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Ay iryazen n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ṣennṭeṯ i min ḏawem ɣa iniɣ. Ƹisa-ya zi Naṣira min iƹna netta? Netta ḏ ijjen n uryaz itwaḍhar-d zi Arebbi i kenniw s lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ lburhanaṯ ḏ lƹalamaṯ ig igga Arebbi x ufus n Ƹisa jarawem mammec ṯessnem. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Y kenniw min ḏas ṯeggim? Wami itwasellem ƹlaḥsab mammec ixes Arebbi ḏ mammec tuɣa issen netta, kenniw tṣellbem-ṯ ṯenɣim-ṯ s ifassen n lkuffar. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Walakin Arebbi netta isekkar-iṯ-iḏ iḍȓeq-as zi ȓeḥriq nni n ȓmewṯ xmi tarew, aqa ȓmewṯ war ḏas ṯzemmar. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Liʼanna issiweȓ xas <char style="it">nnabi</char> Dawed ḏeg yijjen n zman wami inna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Qa twaȓiɣ Siḏi Arebbi zzaṯi i ȓebda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">aqaṯ x ufusi inu bac war terjijiɣ.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />X manaya ifarreḥ wuȓ inu, izehhu yiȓes inu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">Ddat inu aḏ tƹic ḏi lʼamal.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />War ṯsemmḥeḏ ca ḏi ȓaƹmar inu ḏi Lʼaxira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">war tejjiḏ ca Lƹaḍim nnec aḏ ikiccew.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Ṯseḍhareḏ-ayi-d ibriḏen n ṯuḏarṯ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">aḏayi ṯesfarḥeḏ s waṭṭas xmi ɣa ẓreɣ aɣembub nnec.<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Ay ayṯma, aḏawem iniɣ ṣarraḥa: Dawed zi ssalaf ṣṣaliḥin, netta immuṯ itwanḍeȓ. Anḍeȓ nnes aqaṯ akiḏneɣ aȓ nhara. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" /><char style="it">Azeǧiḏ</char> Dawed tuɣa ḏ nnabi iƹni issen belli iwƹeḏ-iṯ Arebbi inna-as aqa aḏ sɣimeɣ ijjen zi ddurriṯ nnec x lƹarc nnec. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Dawed iƹȓem zi Arebbi min ɣa iweqƹen, issiweȓ x lqiyama n Lmasiḥ belli war ḏayes isemmeḥ ca ḏi Lʼaxira, war tkicciw ca ddat nnes. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Ƹisa-ya wanita isekkar-iṯ-iḏ Arebbi zi ȓmewṯ, aqa neccin marra ncehheḏ x manaya. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Wami itwarfeƹ ɣar ufusi n Arebbi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manaya ixes aḏ yini ijjen n umcan ɣares ccan ḏ ameqqran.</char></note> iysi zi Babas Arruḥ iqeddsen iy zi ṯ iwƹeḏ, isfareɣ-d <char style="it">Ƹisa</char> manaya iy twaȓam ȓexxu ḏ manaya iy ṯesȓam. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Qa Dawed war itwarfeƹ ca ɣar ujenna, netta s yixef nnes iy innan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Siḏi Arebbi inna-as i Siḏi: Qqim-d x ufusi inu,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />aȓ d ɣa ggeɣ ȓƹaḏyan nnec swadday iḍaren nnec.<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Iwa kenniw itxeṣṣa aḏ tessnem marra Ayṯ-Israʼil mebȓa ccekk, qa Ƹisa-ya wanita iy ṯṣellbem iggi-ṯ Arebbi ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ ḏ Lmasiḥ."<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Iwḏan nni wami sȓin i wawaȓ-a, uȓawen nsen cemḍen. Kkaren nnan-as i Buṭrus ḏ arrusul nneɣni: "Ay ayṯma, min ɣa negg?"<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Inna-asen Buṭrus: "Tubeṯ, twaṭehhareṯ s waman kuȓ ijjen zzaywem ƹlaḥsab isem n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ḥima aḏ twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nwem, ataf aḏawem immuc Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏ lhadiya. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Liʼanna yuca-awem ȓƹaheḏ i kenniw ḏ ṯarwa nwem ḏ marra yinni iggwjen, iƹni i marra yinni iy xef d ɣa iȓaɣa Siḏi Arebbi." <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Iƹȓem-asen Buṭrus aṭṭas iweṣṣa-aṯen inna-asen: "Snejmeṯ ixef nwem zeg yiwḏan n ȓqewṯ-a ḏi ǧan ixarwiḍen." <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Ssenni yinni iqebȓen awaȓ nnes ruḥen twaṭehharen s waman. Nhar nni marnin can ṯeȓtaȓaf iḏsen ɣar ȓmuminin.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mammec tƹicen ȓmuminin imezwura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />
    <char style="it">Ȓmuminin</char> ȓebda tesȓan i ttaƹlim n arrusul, tmunen ag wayawya am wawmaṯen, tetten aɣrum ag wayawya, tẓaǧan. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Arrusul teggen aṭṭas n lmuƹajizaṯ ḏ lburhanaṯ, yiwḏan tƹejjben zzaysen marra. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Tmunen marra ȓmuminin carrcen marra ag wayawya. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Znuzan agȓa nsen ḏ ȓeḥwayej nsen, ferrqen x mkuȓ ijjen min iḥḏaj. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Tmunen marra iḏsen mkuȓ nhar ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Ayṯ-Israʼil. Tetten aɣrum marra ḏi ṯuḏrin nsen, tetten mecca s ȓefraḥeṯ ḏ ȓxaḍar nsen. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Ḥemmḏen Arebbi, reṭṭan xasen yiwḏan marra. Kuȓ nhar yarenni-yasen Siḏi Arebbi ḏi lƹadad n yinni inejjmen.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Buṭrus isgenfa ijjen n unecruf</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />
    <char style="it">Ijjen n nhar</char> ɣar ṯȓaṯa uƹecci ḏi ȓweqṯ n ṯẓaǧiṯ, Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna gaƹƹḏen ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Ufin ḏinni ijjen n uryaz ḏ anecruf ixȓeq-d amenni. Tawin-ṯ-iḏ yiwḏan ɣar ṯewwarṯ n ṯemziḏa umi qqaren &lt;Ṯawwarṯ ṯaṣebḥant&gt;, srusan-ṯ ḏinni mkuȓ nhar aḏ ittar ɣar yinni itaḏfen ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Wami iẓra unecruf nni Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna taḏfen ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant, ibḏa itettar-asen ṣṣaḏaqa. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna xezzaren ḏayes mliḥ, inna-as Buṭrus: "Xzar-d ɣarneɣ!" <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Ixzar ɣarsen, itɣiȓ-as aḏas ucen can ȓḥajeṯ. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Indeq-d Buṭrus inna-as: "Nec war ɣari nnuqarṯ niɣ ḏ ddheb. Walakin zi min ɣari nec aḏac ṯ uceɣ. Inna-as: Ƹlaḥsab isem n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ zi Naṣira, kkar uyur!" <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Yuca-as fus iṭṭef-iṯ zeg ufus nnes afusi isgaƹƹeḏ-iṯ, ȓexddenni ṯicƹebin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯicƹebṯ nettaṯ ḏ ṯaḵƹebṯ uḍar.</char></note> nnes ḏ iḍaren nnes genfan. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Inexḍef ibedd x iḍaren nnes ibḏa iggur. Yuḏef akiḏsen ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant iggur ineṭṭew iḥemmeḏ Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Wami ṯ ẓrin marra iwḏan iggur iḥemmeḏ Arebbi, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />ƹeqȓen-ṯ nnan ḏ wanita tuɣa itɣiman itettar zzaṯ i Ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant ɣar ṯewwarṯ umi qqaren &lt;Ṯawwarṯ ṯaṣebḥant.&gt; Qqimen tƹejjben aṭṭas, ḏehhcen zi min ḏas iweqƹen.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxuṭba wis ṯnayen n arrasul Buṭrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />
    <char style="it">Aryaz nni igenfan</char> iṭṭef ḏi Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna. Marra iwḏan nni qqimen ḏehhcen, ruḥen ɣarsen tazzȓen ɣar umcan umi qqaren &lt;Asqif n Suliman.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Wami ṯen iẓra Buṭrus inna-asen: "Ay iryazen n Ayṯ-Israʼil, mayemmi ṯetƹejjbem x manaya? Mayemmi ḏayneɣ txezzarem ammu? Ma tfekkarem s jjheḏ nneɣ niɣ s ṭṭaƹa nneɣ iy zi narra aryaz-a iggur? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Lla, ḏ Arebbi n ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ iƹni Arebbi n Brahim ḏ Arebbi n Isḥaq ḏ Arebbi n Yaƹqub. Liʼanna ḏ netta iy d isbeyynen lƹaḍama nnes ḏeg uxeddam nnes Ƹisa. Walakin ḏ kenniw iy ṯ isellmen i lḥukkam ṯenkarem-ṯ zzaṯ i Bilaṭus wami tuɣa irezzu aḏas iḍȓeq. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Wenni iǧan ƹaḍim ḏ ṣṣaliḥ ṯenkarem-ṯ, wenni iǧan ḏ ameḥbus ḏ lmujrim ṯettarem xas <char style="it">i Bilaṭus</char> aḏawem d itwaḍȓeq.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xzar Matta 27:15-26 ḏ Marqus 15:7-15 ḏ Luqa 23:13-25 ḏ Yuḥanna 18:38-40.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Ṯenɣim wenni iǧan ḏ lʼaṣel n ṯuḏarṯ, walakin Arebbi isekkar-iṯ-iḏ zi ȓmewṯ, neccin necheḏ xas. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Ḏeg yisem n Ƹisa iƹni ḏ lʼiman s yisem nnes, aqa aryaz-a iy twaȓam iy ṯessnem iḏweȓ ijheḏ. S lʼiman nnes ḏi Ƹisa iy zi igenfa qaƹ mammec twaȓam marra kenniw.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Ȓexxu ssneɣ ay ayṯma belli ṯeggim manayenni i Ƹisa s ȓeqfaȓeṯ nwem kenniw ḏ arruyas nwem. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ammu ikemmeȓ wawaȓ nnes iy inna Arebbi i marra lʼanbiya zi qbeȓ, iƹni itxeṣṣa Lmasiḥ nnes aḏ itwaƹeddeb. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19-20" />S manaya tubeṯ, ḏewȓeṯ ɣar Arebbi ḥima aḏ twakksent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nwem. Ḥima aḏ d tas ṯsaƹƹat n lfaraj zi Siḏi Arebbi, aḏ d issekk Lmasiḥ iy tuɣa ḏawem itwaxḍaren zi qbeȓ iƹni Ƹisa. <verse eid="ACT 3:19-20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Itxeṣṣa netta aḏ iqqim ḏeg ujenna aȓ ȓweqṯ iy ḏi ɣa itwaƹḏeȓ kuȓci ƹlaḥsab awaȓen n lʼanbiya ṣṣaliḥin iy ḏasen inna Arebbi ḏeg yijjen n zman. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Aqa inna Musa: Aḏawem d yuc Siḏi Arebbi nwem ijjen n nnabi zeg ayṯmaṯwem am nec. Itxeṣṣa aḏ tṣennṭem i marra min ḏawem ɣa yini. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Qa marra wenni war ḏas itṣenniṭen ca ɣar nnabi nni aḏ itwakkes zi ȓqum aḏ inehḏem.<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Aqa nnabi Ṣamwil ḏ marra lʼanbiya iy ṯiḏ iḏfaren xebbaren x wussan-a yina iy ḏi neǧa. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Kenniw ḏ ddurriṯ n lʼanbiya. Kenniw ḏ ṯarwa n ȓƹaheḏ nni ig igga Arebbi ak ȓejḏuḏ nwem. Inna-as Arebbi i Brahim: Zi ddurriṯ nnec iy zi ɣa barkeɣ marra ȓegnus n ṯmurṯ-a. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Wami ḏawem d yuca Arebbi axeddam nnes <char style="it">Ƹisa</char>, ḏ amezwaru issekk-awem-ṯ-iḏ i kenniw bac akenniw ibarek, iƹni aḏ isbeƹƹeḏ mkuȓ ijjen zzaywem x ccarr nnes."<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna zzaṯ i Lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Usin-d ȓḥizeb n iṣadduqiyen ḏ ȓfuqaha ḏ umeqqran n iƹessasen n ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ufin Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna ssawaȓen ak yiwḏan. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />War ḏasen iƹjib bu ȓḥaȓ qaƹ wami ufin Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna seȓmaḏen tḥeddaṯen i yiwḏan x Ƹisa qqaren belli iwḏan aḏ d kkaren zi ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Kkaren ṭṭfen Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna siḏfen-ṯen ḏi ȓeḥbes jjin-ṯen ḏinni aȓ ṯiwecca minzi iƹḏu ȓḥaȓ. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Aṭṭas n yiwḏan iy isȓin i wawaȓ nsen umnen. Iryazen nni iy yumnen <char style="it">ȓexxu</char> uwḍen ɣar yijjen xemsaȓaf iḏsen.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Ṯiwecca nnes munen ḏi Lquds imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ arruyas nsen ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Tuɣa ḏinni Ḥanin ig iǧan ḏ arrayes n ȓfuqaha ḏ Qiyafa ḏ Yuḥanna ḏ Iskandar ḏ yinni iǧan zi ȓeḥbab n arrayes n ȓfuqaha. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Uwin-d Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna sbedden-ṯen ḏi ȓwesṭ nsen nnan-asen: "Man jjheḏ niɣ ḏ yisem iy zi teggem manaya?"<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Buṭrus iccur-d s Arruḥ iqeddsen ȓexddenni inna-asen: "A lḥukkam ay imeqqranen n ccaƹb! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Ma teggem-aneɣ lʼistijwab nhara ƹlaḥsab ijjen n ȓxir iy negga ḏeg unecruf-a ƹlaḥsab mammec igenfa? <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Iwa itxeṣṣa aḏ tessnem kenniw ḏ marra Ayṯ-Israʼil belli aryaz-a iy ḏa ibedden zzaṯwem igenfa s yisem n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ zi Naṣira. Kenniw ṯṣellbem-ṯ, walakin Arebbi isekkar-iṯ-iḏ zi ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Ƹisa-ya netta ḏ azru nni iy ṯƹiffem kenniw ibennayen. Ȓexxu iḏweȓ ḏ azru aṣebḥan aqaṯ ḏi ṯɣemmarṯ n dsas. <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />War izemmar ḥadd aḏ injem bȓa zzayes netta. Liʼanna war ḏinni uȓa ḏ ijjen n yisem nneɣni jar i iryazen ḏi ddunect-a azzayes netwasenjem illa netta."<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Xzaren lḥukkam nni ḏi zƹameṯ n Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna ufin-ṯen war ɣrin ca niṯni ḏ iwḏan ƹadi. Qqimen tƹejjben, ƹeqȓen-ṯen tuɣaṯen ak Ƹisa. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ƹaweḏ twaȓan aryaz nni igenfa ibedd ḏinni akiḏsen, war ufin min ɣa inin. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Lḥukkam nni umaren Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna aḏ ffɣen barra aḏ jjen Jmaƹeṯ nni n lḥukkam aḏ mcawaren waḥeḏsen. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Nnan: "Min ɣa negg i ṯnayen-a n iryazen? War nzemmar ca a nenkar lmuƹjiza-ya iy ggin aqa ṯmeḍhar-asen-d i marra imezḏaɣ n Lquds. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Walakin labud aḏasen neƹȓem bac ssa aȓ tsawent war ssiwiȓen ɣar ḥadd ƹlaḥsab isem n Ƹisa bac war itentacar ca useȓmeḏ-a ḏi ccaƹb." <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Siḏfen-ṯen-d, umaren-ṯen nnan-asen war ssawaȓeṯ war seȓmaḏeṯ ḥadd ƹlaḥsab isem n Ƹisa.<verse eid="ACT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Indeq-d Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna nnan-asen: "Ḥekmeṯ kenniw, ma mliḥ zzaṯ i Arebbi a nṭaƹ i wawaȓ nnes niɣ i wawaȓ nwem? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />War nzemmar ca a nejj x min neẓra niɣ x min nesȓa."<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Arnin siggwḏen-ṯen, ȓexddenni ḍeȓqen-asen. War ufin mammec ḏasen ɣa ggen aṯen ƹaqben minzi marra iwḏan ḥemmḏen Arebbi x min iweqƹen. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Aryaz-a igenfan s lmuƹjiza nni ɣares ktar zi arbeƹin iseggwusa.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmuminin tettaren zƹameṯ zi Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Ɣir ḍeȓqen-asen-d i Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna, ruḥen ɣar imeddukaȓ nsen ƹawḏen-asen marra min ḏasen nnan arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Wami sȓin i manaya, ttaren i Arebbi ḏi ṯẓaǧiṯ marra iḏsen nnan-as: "Ya Mawlana ḏ cek ixeȓqen ajenna ḏ ṯmurṯ ḏ ȓebḥar ḏ marra min ḏaysen. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Ḏ cek iy innan s Arruḥ iqeddsen s yiȓes n jeddiṯneɣ Dawed ȓƹabḏ nnec wami inna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">Mayemmi ȓegnus ɣeḍben aṭṭas?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Mayemmi iwḏan tciṭinen ḏi ȓxawi?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Sewjaḏen izeǧiḏen n ṯmurṯ ixef nsen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">munen arruyas ak wayawya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">bac aḏ ƹarrḍen i Siḏi Arebbi ḏ Lmasiḥ nnes.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Li'anna ḏ ṣṣaḥ <char style="it">azeǧiḏ</char> Hirudus ḏ <char style="it">lḥakem</char> Bunṭyus Bilaṭus munen ak Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi ṯendint-a. Tafqen ḍed i uxeddam nnec iqeddsen Ƹisa iy ṯixḍareḏ. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ggin qaƹ min tuɣa ṯzemmmeḏ aḏ iwqeƹ s ufus ḏ ȓxaḍar nnec. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />A Siḏi, ȓexxu xzar mammec ḏaneɣ theddaḏen, uc-aneɣ i neccin lƹibad nnec a nessiweȓ s wawaȓ nnec s zƹameṯ. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Sarreḥ fus nnec bac aḏ tesgenfiḏ aḏ tesbeyyneḏ lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ lburhanaṯ ƹlaḥsab isem n Ƹisa axeddam nnec iqeddsen."<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Wami kemmȓen ṯẓaǧiṯ nni inhezz umcan nni mani munen, ccuren niṯni marra s Arruḥ iqeddsen ssawaȓen s wawaȓ n Arebbi s yijjen n zƹameṯ.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmuminin carrcen marra jarasen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Jmaƹeṯ nni n ȓmuminin ɣarsen uȓ nsen ḏ ȓaƹqeȓ nsen kif-kif. Uȓa ḏ ijjen zzaysen war iḥesseb min ɣares nnes waḥḏes, carrcen marra ṯimesȓayin jarasen. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Cehhḏen arrusul s yijjen n jjheḏ ḏ ameqqran x lqiyama iy igga Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa wami ikkar zi ȓmewṯ. Arebbi igga xasen marra ijjen n lbaraka ṯemɣar.<verse eid="ACT 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />War iǧi uȓa ḏ ijjen zzaysen ma iḥḏaj. Li'anna yinni iy ɣar iǧa ṯimura ḏ ṯuḏrin traḥen znuzan-ṯent tawin-d tmenyaṯ nni, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />srusan-ṯent ɣar iḍaren n arrusul tferraqen-ṯent ƹlaḥsab mkuȓ ijjen min iḥḏaj. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Ḏinni ijjen qqaren-as Yusef, ƹaweḏ semman-ṯ arrusul s Barnaba iƹni &lt;wenni itcejjaƹen.&gt; Netta zi ccurfa n Ayṯ-Lawi ḏ mmis n ṯendint n Qubruṣ. <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Ikkar izzenz ijjen n ṯmurṯ iy ɣares, yuwi-d tmenyaṯ nni isers-iṯent ɣar iḍaren n arrusul.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Anas ḏ ṯemɣarṯ nnes Safura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Ikkar ijjen n uryaz qqaren-as Anas ṯamɣarṯ nnes qqaren-as Safura, iruḥ izzenz ijjen n ṯmurṯ nnes. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Yuwi-d tmenyaṯ, ca isnuffar-iṯent ɣares, ca yuwi-ṯent isers-iṯent ɣar iḍaren n arrusul. Ṯamɣarṯ nnes ṯargeb qaƹ x manayenni.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Inna-as Buṭrus: "Ay Anas, mayemmi ṯejjiḏ Cciṭan ac iɣarr yuḏef ḏeg wuȓ nnec ṯesxerrqeḏ x Arruḥ iqeddsen ṯesnuffareḏ can n tmenyaṯ i yixef nnec zi tmenyaṯ n ṯmurṯ nni? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Ṯamurṯ nni tuɣa ṯeǧa nnec marra qbeȓ iy t ɣa ṯezzenzeḏ. Wami ṯezzenzeḏ ṯamurṯ nni, tmenyaṯ nni marra ǧant nnec kulci." Inna-as: "Mayemmi ṯenwiḏ ḏeg wuȓ nnec manaya? Qa war iǧi ṯesxerrqeḏ x yiwḏan, qa ṯesxerrqeḏ x Arebbi."<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Wami isȓa Anas i wawaȓ nni, iwḍa ɣar ṯmurṯ immuṯ ḏinni. Iwḏan marra iy d yarrin ȓexbar-a ggwḏen aṭṭas. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Usin-d ccabab keffnen Anas s ȓecfen uwin-ṯ neḍȓen-ṯ.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Ƹḏunt can ṯȓaṯa n ṯsaƹƹaṯin ṯusa-d ṯemɣarṯ n Anas war d ṯarri bu ȓexbar x min iweqƹen. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Indeq-d Buṭrus inna-as: "In-ayi, ma anictuya waha iy zi ṯezzenzem ṯamurṯ nni?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Ṯenna-as nettaṯ: "Wah, anictuya wah."<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Inna-as Buṭrus: "Mayemmi ṯtafqem aḏ tzaƹmem aḏ teẓrem Arruḥ n Siḏi Arebbi min ɣa igg?" Inna-as: "Yinni inḍȓen aryaz nnem ḏewȓen-d aqaṯen ɣar ṯewwarṯ, acem ysin uȓa ḏ cem." <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Ṣafi ṯewḍa ȓexddenni, ṯemmuṯ ḏinni ɣar iḍaren n Buṭrus. Uḏfen ccabab nni ufin-t ṯemmuṯ, ysin-t neḍȓen-t ag uɣezḏis n uryaz nnes. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Marra jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḏ marra yinni isȓin x manaya ggwḏen aṭṭas.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrusul sgenfan aṭṭas n yiwḏan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Arrusul teggen aṭṭas n lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ lburhanaṯ jar yiwḏan, tmunen marra ḏeg Useqqif n Suliman <char style="it">ḏi Ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant</char>. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Zeg yiwḏan nni iy war yuminen ca war izƹim ḥadd akiḏsen yiȓi ak ȓmuminin walakin waxxa amenni teḥtaramen-ṯen aṭṭas. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Marnin-d aṭṭas n yiwḏan iy yumnen zi Siḏiṯneɣ, zzaysen ijjen n lƹadad n iryazen uȓa ḏ ṯemɣarin.<verse eid="ACT 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Iwḏan sufuɣen-d imehȓac nsen ɣar znaqi, srusan-ṯen x ṯassuṯ ḏ ijarṯiȓen ḥima axmi ssenni d ɣa iƹḏu Buṭrus, imken aḏ iȓqef ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen s ṯiȓi nnes. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Tasen-d aṭṭas n yiwḏan zi ȓeḏcuraṯ iy yuḏsen ɣar Lquds, tawin-d imehȓac nsen ḏ yinni itƹeddaben jnun iƹeffanen niṯni tgenfan marra.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayṯ-Israʼil tƹeddaben arrusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Ikkar arrayes n ȓfuqaha ḏ marra yinni kis iǧan niṯni zi ȓḥizeb n iṣadduqiyen, ḥesḏen arrusul aṭṭas. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Ṭṭfen-ṯen ggin-ṯen ḏi ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Walakin s ǧiȓeṯ ijjen n lmalaʼika n Siḏi Arebbi ṯerzem-asen ṯiwwura n ȓeḥbes, ṯsufeɣ-iṯen ṯenna-asen: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />"Ruḥem beddeṯ ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant, ḥeddṯem i yiwḏan s marra awaȓen n ṯuḏarṯ-a <char style="it">n jḏiḏ</char>." <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Ḏ manayenni iy ggin, uḏfen ɣar ȓefjar ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant bḏan seȓmaḏen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Menbaƹd iruḥ arrayes n ȓfuqaha ḏ marra yinni kis iǧan smunen-d Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil iƹni marra imeqqranen nsen, ssenni ssekken <char style="it">iƹessasen n ṯemziḏa</char> aḏ d awin arrusul zi ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Wami uwḍen iƹessasen nni ɣar ȓeḥbes war ṯen ufin ca ḏinni. Ḏewȓen-d ssiwḍen ȓexbar, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />nnan-asen: "Nufa ṯiwwura n ȓeḥbes bellƹent mliḥ, ḏ iƹessasen n ȓeḥbes bedden zzaṯ i ṯewwura nni. Neccin wami nuḏef ɣar ḏaxeȓ war ḏinni nufi ḥadd." <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Wami sȓin i wawaȓ-a arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ umeqqran n iƹessasen n ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant ismeḍ-asen ȓaƹjeb ḏeg wuȓ fekkaren mani ɣa yaweḍ manaya?<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Yusa-d ɣarsen ijjen inna-asen: "Iryazen nni iy ṯeggim ḏi ȓeḥbes aqaṯen ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant seȓmaḏen iwḏan!" <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Ȓexddenni iruḥ umeqqran nni n iƹessasen ak imxazniyen nnes uwin-d arrusul bȓa lƹunf minzi ggwḏen zi ccaƹb aṯen rejmen s uzru.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Wami d siḏfen arrusul, sbedden-ṯen zzaṯ i Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil. Inna-asen arrayes n ȓfuqaha: <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />"Neccin numar-ikenniw war ṯseȓmaḏem ca ƹlaḥsab isem nni <char style="it">n Ƹisa</char>. Walakin kenniw ṯƹemmarem Lquds s ttaƹlim nwem. Ṯexsem aḏ teggem ȓmewṯ n uryaz-a x yiri nneɣ."<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Indeq-d arrasul Buṭrus ḏ arrusul nneɣni nnan-asen: "Itxeṣṣa-yaneɣ a nṭaƹ i Arebbi maci i yiwḏan! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Arebbi n ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ isekkar-d Ƹisa wenni iy ṯenɣim kenniw ṯrefƹem-ṯ x ṯeḥnact. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Irfeƹ-iṯ Arebbi aɣares iggi-ṯ x ufusi nnes bac aḏ iḥkem aḏ isenjem, aḏ yuc ttuba i Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏ iɣfar ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />X ṯmesȓayin-a ncehheḏ xasent neccin ḏ Arruḥ iqeddsen, Arruḥ-a yuci-ṯ Arebbi i yinni ḏas itṭaƹan."<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Wami sȓin i wawaȓ-a xeyyqen ɣeḍben rezzun aṯen nɣen. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ikkar-d ijjen n ufarrisi, netta ḏ amseȓmaḏ n ccariƹa qqaren-as Gamlil iteḥtaram-iṯ ccaƹb marra. Ibedd ḏi ȓwesṭ n Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ittar-asen aḏ sufɣen arrusul cwayt n ȓweqṯ ɣar barra. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Inna-asen: "Ay iryazen n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ḥḍam ixef nwem zi min ṯexsem aḏ teggem i yiwḏan-a! <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Qbeȓ i wussan-a, ikkar-d ijjen n uryaz qqaren-as Aṯuddas. Yarra ixef nnes ḏ ameqqran, ḏfaren-ṯ can arbeƹa miyya n iryazen. Walakin nɣin-ṯ, marra yinni iy ṯ iḏfaren msefraqen ḏewȓen ḏ walu. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Menbaƹd i uryaz-a <char style="it">Aṯuddas</char>, ikkar-d ijjen nneɣni qqaren-as Yahuḏa zi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil ḏi ȓiyyam n lʼiḥṣaʼ n imezḏaɣ n Ayṯ-Israʼil. Ijmeƹ akiḏes ijjen n lƹadad n yiwḏan, walakin nɣin-ṯ uȓa ḏ netta, yinni iy ṯ iḏfaren kuȓ ijjen manis ikka. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Ȓexxu akenniw neṣḥeɣ aḏ tbeƹƹḏem i yiwḏan-a, aṯen ṯejjem. Min newwan niɣ ḏ min xeddmen, meȓa zzaysen waha aḏ iqḍa. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Meȓa manaya zi Arebbi war ṯzemmarem ca axasen ṯeqḍam. Ɣarwem aḏ tafem ixef nwem tmenɣam ak Arebbi!"<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Sȓin yiwḏan nni ɣar Gamlil. Uwin-d arrusul ƹannen-asen aƹmuḏ nnan-asen: "Qa ƹemmarṣ aḏ tƹawḏem aḏ tessiwȓem ƹlaḥsab isem n Ƹisa." Ȓexddenni ḍeȓqen-asen.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Farḥen arrusul wami ffɣen zi Jmaƹeṯ nni n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ḥessben belli ɣarsen lhimma x lʼihana nni iy ḏasen iweqƹen x yisem n Ƹisa. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Qqimen mkuȓ nhar traḥen ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant, traḥen zi ṯeddarṯ aȓ ṯeddarṯ seȓmaḏen tbeccaren s Ƹisa belli netta ḏ Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Arrusul tixḍaren sebƹa n ṣṣaḥaba ḏi ṯendint n Lquds</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Ḏeg wussan nni lƹadad n imeḥḍaren imarni. Ȓmuminin iy ssawaȓen s lluɣa ṯayunaniṯ tceṯcan zeg yinni issawaȓen lƹibriya, qqaren qa neccin ṯajjaȓin nneɣ war ḏasent ticcen bu ȓḥaqq nsent xmi ferrqen lmuƹawana mkuȓ nhar. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Kkaren ṯenƹac nni n arrusul smunen marra imeḥḍaren nnan-asen: "Neccin arrusul maci maƹqul a nesmeḥ ḏeg wawaȓ n Arebbi bac a nefreq lmuƹawana. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ay ayṯma, kkarem awim-d sebƹa n iryazen zzaywem aḏ tiȓi ṯessnem-ṯen aqaṯen mliḥ, aḏ iȓin ccuren s Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏ ȓefhameṯ. Neccin aṯen nkellef s lmuhimma-ya <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />bac neccin <char style="it">arrusul</char> a nuc ȓweqṯ nneɣ i ṯẓaǧiṯ ḏ uḥeddeṯ."<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Iƹjeb-asen ȓḥaȓ i marra jmaƹeṯ. Kkaren ixḍaren ijjen n uryaz qqaren-as Stifan, netta iccur s lʼiman ḏ Arruḥ iqeddsen. Ixḍaren Filippas ḏ Brukurus ḏ Nikanur ḏ Timun ḏ Parminas ḏ Nikulas zeg Wanṭakya, tuɣa isȓem netta ḏi ddin n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" /><char style="it">Sebƹa-ya n ṣṣaḥaba</char> qeddmen-ṯen ɣar arrusul, ẓẓuǧen xasen sersen xasen ifassen nsen <char style="it">baraken-ṯen</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xmi ȓmuminin tẓaǧan x can yijjen x can ssabab srusan xas ifassen, iƹni ṯa ḏ ijjen n lƹalama belli aḏas ucen jjheḏ ḏ lbaraka.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Intacar wawaȓ n Arebbi, marnin-d aṭṭas n imeḥḍaren ḏi Lquds, umnen aṭṭas n ȓfuqaha n Ayṯ-Israʼil <char style="it">zi Lʼinjil</char>.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Teṭṭfen Stifan zi sebƹa nni n ṣṣaḥaba ixḍaren arrusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Stifan nni netta iccur s lbaraka n Arebbi ḏ jjheḏ, ixeddem jar yiwḏan lburhanaṯ ḏ lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ ṯimeqqranin. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Kkaren ȓebƹaḍ zi temziḏa umi qqaren &lt;Lbartinun.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iwḏan qqaren belli Lbartinun niṯni ḏ can n israʼiliyen iy tuɣa ḥebsen-ṯen arrumanus uwin-ṯen ɣar ṯendint n Ruma. Menbaƹd ḍeȓqen-asen-d sufɣen-ṯen zi Ruma. Ƹeqben-d ɣar Israʼil ḏ imucan nneɣni.</char></note> Niṯni ḏ israʼiliyen n ṯendint n Lqurina ḏ ṯendint n Iskandariya ḏ inneɣni zi lʼiqlim n Kilikya ḏ lʼiqlim n Asya. Bḏan temnaqaren ak Stifan, <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />walakin war zemmaren aḏ qawwmen ȓefhameṯ ḏ Arruḥ iy zi issawaȓ.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Kkaren ucin arrecweṯ i can iryazen bac aḏ inin qa neccin nesȓa i Stifan netta iqqar awaȓ war iḥȓin x Musa ḏ Arebbi! <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Wami sƹeṣṣben iwḏan uȓa ḏ imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa, ṭṭfen Stifan uwin-ṯ ɣar Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Uwin-d iwḏan axas cehḏen ẓẓur qqaren "Qa bnaḏem-a iqqar awaȓ war iḥȓin x umcan-a amqeddes ḏ Ccariƹa n Musa! <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Nesȓa-yas iqqar belli Ƹisa zi Naṣira aḏ ihḏem amcan-a aḏ ibeddeȓ lƹadaṯ nni iy ḏaneɣ d ijja Musa." <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Xezzaren ḏayes ḏi Stifan marra yinni iy ḏinni iǧan ḏi Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ufin aɣembub nnes am uɣembub n lmalaʼika.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Stifan itwajah Jmaƹeṯ n Lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Ikkar arrayes n ȓfuqaha inna-as i Stifan: "Ma ḏ ṣṣaḥ manaya?"<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Inna-asen Stifan: "Ay ayṯma! A yinni imɣaren! Ṣennṭeṯ ɣari. Wami tuɣa iǧa jeddiṯneɣ Brahim ḏi ṯmurṯ nni n Misubuṭamya qbeȓ ma aḏ izḏeɣ ḏi ṯendint n Ḥaran, imeḍhar-as-d Arebbi Lƹaḍim <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />inna-as: Kkar, ffeɣ cek ssa zi ṯmurṯ-a nnec, ejj ȓeḥbab nnec ruḥ ɣar ṯmurṯ nni iy ḏac d ɣa seḍhareɣ.<verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Ikkar Brahim yuyur zi ṯmurṯ nni n ikaldaniyen, <char style="it">iƹni Misubuṭamya,</char> iruḥ izḏeɣ ḏi ṯendint n Ḥaran. Wami immuṯ babas, yuwi-ṯ Arebbi ɣar ṯmurṯ-a mani ṯzeddɣem ȓexxu. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Walakin war ḏas yuci uȓa ḏ ccbar zi ṯmurṯ-a aṯ imlek. Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni Brahim war ɣares bu ṯarwa. Waxxa amenni iwƹeḏ-iṯ Arebbi inna-as: Aḏac uceɣ ṯamurṯ-a aḏ tiȓi nnec cek ḏ ddurriṯ nnec menbaƹd i cek.<verse eid="ACT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Ammu iy ḏas inna Arebbi: Ddurriṯ nnec aḏ ƹicen ḏi ṯmurṯ n midden, aḏ iȓin ḏ isemɣan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isemɣan niṯni ḏ lƹabid.</char></note> n ayṯbab n ṯmurṯ nni, axasen ssekken tamara arbeƹmiyya iseggwusa. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Walakin Arebbi iqqar: Aḏ ƹaqbeɣ iwḏan n ṯmurṯ nni iy ṯen iggin ḏ isemɣan, menbaƹd aḏ ffɣen ssenni <char style="it">ddurriṯ nnec</char> aḏ tiȓi ƹebbḏen-ayi ḏeg umcan-a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amcan-a ixes aḏ yini ṯamurṯ n Ayṯ-Israʼil.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Fa Arebbi yuca-as ȓƹaheḏ nni n ṭṭahareṯ i Brahim. Brahim ijja-d Isḥaq, iṭehhar-iṯ nhar wis ṯmenyam. Isḥaq ijja-d Yaƹqub. Yaƹqub ijja-d ṯenƹac n ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ ḥessḏen <char style="it">umaṯsen</char> Yusef, zzenzen-ṯ aḏ iḏweȓ ḏ ismeɣ ḏi Miṣra. Walakin Arebbi aqaṯ akiḏes, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />ifekk-iṯ zi marra tamara nnes. Yuca-as lḥikma, isƹizz-iṯ ɣar Firƹun iƹni azeǧiḏ n Miṣra. Iggi-ṯ Firƹun aḏ iḥkem x Miṣra ḏ ȓeqṣar nnes ikmaȓ.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Ṯumma iwqeƹ buheyyuf ḏi marra ṯimura n Miṣra ḏ Kanƹan. Ṯekka xasen tamara ḏ ṯameqqrant, ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ war ufin min ɣa ccen. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Wami isȓa Yaƹqub Miṣra ḏayes ḏinni irḏan, issekk ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ ḏinni ṯwaȓa ṯamezwarut. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Wami ruḥen ḏinni ṯwaȓa wis ṯnayen, inna-asen Yusef i ayṯmas aqa nec ḏ umaṯwem Yusef, ȓexddenni ƹeqȓen-ṯ. Ssenni ig issen Firƹun ȓeḥbab n Yusef. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Yusef issekk aḏ d awin babas Yaƹqub ḏ ȓeḥbab nnes, ḏaysen xemsa u sebƹin iḏsen. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ihwa-d Yaƹqub ɣar Miṣra mani immuṯ netta ḏ ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Mmeysin-d ssenni uwin-ṯen ɣar ṯmurṯ n Cakim, neḍȓen-ṯen ḏinni ḏeg unḍeȓ nni iy tuɣa isɣa Brahim s can n nnuqarṯ x Ayṯ-Ḥammur ḏi Cakim.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Ṯumma wami d ṯqarreb ȓweqṯ nni iy ḏi ɣa ikemmeȓ Arebbi awaȓ nnes minzi tuɣa iwƹeḏ Brahim, ikṯar ccaƹb nneɣ ḏi Miṣra imarni-d aṭṭas. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Imeḍhar-d ijjen n uzeǧiḏ nneɣni ḏi Miṣra netta war issin ca Yusef. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Ixeddeƹ ccaƹb nneɣ issekk-it x ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ, itegg xasen bessif bac aḏ nḍaren iseyman nsen ɣar barra ḥima aḏ mmṯen. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni ixȓeq-d Musa, netta ḏ aṣebḥan aṭṭas. Itwarebba ṯeȓt chur ḏi ṯeddarṯ n babas. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Wami ṯ nḍaren ɣar barra, ṯeysi-ṯ yeǧis n Firƹun ṯrebba-ṯ ṯarri-ṯ ḏ mmis. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Uca sȓemḏen-as i Musa marra min ssnen imiṣriyen, iḏweȓ ɣares jjheḏ ḏi min iqqar ḏ min itegg.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Ṯumma wami ikemmeȓ arbeƹin iseggwusa, irezzu aḏ ifqeḏ ayṯmas iƹni Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Iẓra ijjen n umiṣri iƹedd x yijjen n uʼisraʼili, iruḥ netta iḏafeƹ x wenni itwaḍeȓmen, intaqam-as inɣa amiṣri nni. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Netta inwa ayṯmas Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏ fehmen belli aṯen isenjem Arebbi x ufus nnes, walakin niṯni war fhimen ca. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ṯiwecca nnes yufa ṯnayen israʼiliyen tmenɣan jarasen, ixes aṯen ismeṣȓaḥ inna-asen: Kenniw ḏ awmaṯen, mayemmi tƹeddam x wayawya? <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Ikkar-d wenni itƹeddan, iƹann-iṯ inna-as: Uw c iggin cek ḏ arrayes niɣ ḏ ȓqaḍi xaneɣ? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ma ṯrezzuḏ aḏayi ṯenɣeḏ am ṯenɣiḏ amiṣri nni n iḍennaṭ? <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Wami isȓa Musa manaya, ikkar yarweȓ iruḥ ɣar ṯmurṯ n Midyan iƹic ḏinni ḏ abarrani. Xeȓqen-d ɣares ḏinni ṯnayen n iḥenjiren.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Ṯumma wami ƹḏun arbeƹin iseggwusa, ṯbedd-d ɣares ijjen n lmalaʼika zeg uḥaḏuq n ṯmessi ṯreqq ḏeg uxcab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maci maƹruf min iƹna uxcab-a, walakin imken ḏ can arbiƹ am ṯabɣa niɣ am can ṯcejjarṯ ṯamezyant ḏayes isennanen.</char></note> ḏi ṣṣaḥra zzaṯ i uḏrar n Sina. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Wami iẓra Musa manayenni itƹejjeb, iqarreb ɣares aḏ ixzar. Isȓa i ṣṣut n Siḏi Arebbi iqqar-as: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />Nec ḏ Arebbi n ȓejḏuḏ nnec, ḏ Arebbi n Brahim ḏ Isḥaq ḏ Yaƹqub. Ibḏa Musa iterjiji s ṯiggwḏi war izƹim ca aḏ ixzar.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Inna-as Siḏi Arebbi: Kkes ṯisiȓa zeg iḍaren nnec qa amcan-a mani ṯbeddeḏ netta muqeddes. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Aqa ẓriɣ ȓaƹḏab n ccaƹb inu iǧan ḏi Miṣra, sȓiɣ i iɣuyan nsen aqa hwiɣ-d aṯen snejmeɣ. Ȓexxu araḥ-d cek ac ssekkeɣ ɣar Miṣra.<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Musa-ya nkaren-ṯ nnan-as: Uw c iggin cek ḏ arrayes niɣ ḏ ȓqaḍi xaneɣ? Walakin netta issekk-iṯ Arebbi aḏ yiȓi ḏ arrayes ḏ wenni iy ṯen ɣa isnejmen. Issekk-iṯ Arebbi x ufus n lmalaʼika nni iy ḏas d imeḍharen ḏeg uxcab nni. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Musa-ya ḏ netta iy ṯen isufɣen s ȓaƹjayeb ḏ lmuƹjizaṯ iy igga ḏi Miṣra, ḏi Ȓebḥar azeggwaɣ, uȓa ḏi ṣṣaḥra arbeƹin iseggwusa.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Ḏ Musa-ya iy ḏasen innan i Ayṯ-Israʼil: Aḏawem d yuc Arebbi ijjen n nnabi zeg ayṯmaṯwem am nec. <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ḏ netta <char style="it">Musa</char> iy igguren ak jmaƹeṯ n Ayṯ-Israʼil ig imunen ḏi ṣṣaḥra. Ḏ netta mikeḏ ṯessiweȓ lmalaʼika x uḏrar n Sina ḏ ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ. Ḏ netta iy xef d hwan wawaȓen iddaren ḥima aḏaneɣ ṯen yuc.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Walakin ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ ugin aḏas ṭaƹen ugin aṯ qebȓen, nwan ḏeg wuȓawen nsen aḏ ḏewȓen ɣar Miṣra. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Nnan-as i Harun:<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Harun netta ḏ umas n Siḏna Musa.</char></note> Ṣneƹ-aneɣ lʼaṣnamaṯ ḥima aḏ iȓin ḏ arebbiṯen nneɣ aṯen neysi ɣar zzaṯ nneɣ. War nessin ca manis ikka Musa-ya iy ḏaneɣ d isufɣen zi Miṣra! <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Ḏi ȓiyyam nni ṣenƹen ijjen n lʼaṣnam x teṣwirṯ n uyenduz. Qeddmen-as dbiḥeṯ, farḥen aṭṭas x min ggin s ifassen nsen.<verse eid="ACT 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ibeƹƹeḏ xasen Arebbi, ijji-ṯen aḏ ƹebbḏen iṯran n ujenna am mammec iqqar Lkitab n lʼanbiya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">"Ay Ayṯ-Israʼil, wami tqeddamem dbiḥeṯ ḏ teḍḥiyeṯ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ḏi arbeƹin iseggwusa nni ḏi ṣṣaḥra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ma ṯeggim-ayi-t i nec niɣ?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Lla, ṯeysim aqiḍun n lʼaṣnam umi qqaren Mulux,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ḏ yiṯri n arebbi nwem umi qqaren Rafan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Ḏ yina ḏ lʼaṣnamaṯ iy ṯeggim bac aṯen ṯƹebḏem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">X manaya nec axawem azzȓeɣ aɣirin i ṯmurṯ n Babil."<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Ɣarsen ɣar ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ Ṯamziḏa uqiḍun n Arebbi ḏi ṣṣaḥra. Iggi-t Musa amec iy ṯ yumar Arebbi ƹlaḥsab cckel iy tuɣa iẓra. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Ṯamziḏa nni uqiḍun ṯemmuc-asen i ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ. Niṯni ysin-t akiḏsen ak Yacuƹ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siḏna Yacuƹ tuɣa netta ḏ axeddam n Siḏna Musa, iḥkem x Ayṯ-Israʼil wami immuṯ Siḏna Musa.</char></note> ɣar ṯmurṯ-a n ȓegnus iy xef yuzzeȓ Arebbi zzaṯ i ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ. Ṯeqqim amenni aȓ wussan n Dawed. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Dawed irḍa xas Arebbi inna-as: A Siḏi Arebbi n jeddiṯneɣ Yaƹqub, ejj-ayi aḏ ḏebbareɣ ijjen n umcan aḏayes ṯiȓi ṯzeddiɣṯ nnec. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Walakin iruḥ Suliman ibna netta ijjen n ṯeddarṯ i Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Waxxa amenni qa Arebbi Yuƹȓan war izeddeɣ ca ḏi ṯuḏrin iy bennan s ifassen. Amec inna nnabi <char style="it">Icaƹya</char>:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Iqqar Siḏi Arebbi ajenna ḏ lƹarc inu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">ḏ ṯamurṯ mix srusiɣ iḍaren inu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Mammec ṯegga ṯeddarṯ iy ḏayi ɣa ṯebnam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Mani ɣa yiȓi umcan n arraḥeṯ inu?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ma war iǧi ca ḏ fus inu iy d ixeȓqen manaya kuȓci?<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />
    <char style="it">Inna-asen Stifan:</char> A yinni iy ḏi ṯeǧa ṯɣennant, qa uȓawen nwem ḏ imejjan nwem qqnen!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S ȓmaƹna n ṯyunaniṯ iqqar uȓawen nwem ḏ imejjan nwem war ṭehharen ca.</char></note> Kenniw teggem mammec iy ggin ȓejḏuḏ nwem, kif-kif. Ȓebda tƹarraḍem-as i Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Ma injem can n nnabi war ṯ ƹeddben ca ȓejḏuḏ nwem? Niṯni nɣin uȓa ḏ lʼanbiya nni n zman iy innan qa aḏ d yas wenni iǧan ṣṣaliḥ, iƹni wenni ȓexxu ṯxeḏƹem kenniw ṯenɣim-ṯ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wenni xeḏƹen nɣin-ṯ netta ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Ṯeṭṭfem ccariƹa x ufus n lmalaʼikaṯ, kenniw war zzayes ṯeggim ca."<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmewṯ n Stifan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Wami sȓin Jmaƹeṯ nni n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil <char style="it">awaȓ n Stifan</char>, xeyyqen ɣeḍben, tɣeẓẓaẓen ɣares ṯiɣmas. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Stifan iccur s Arruḥ iqeddsen, ixzar ɣar ujenna iẓra lƹaḍama n Arebbi yufa Ƹisa ibedd x ufusi n Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Inna: "Aqa twaȓiɣ ajenna inurzem ḏ Mmis n bnaḏem ibedd x ufusi n Arebbi."<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ s jjheḏ bellƹen x imejjan nsen, hejmen xas marra iḏsen. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Sufɣen-ṯ barra i ṯendint bḏan rejjmen-ṯ s uzru. Sersen izeǧuba nsen ɣar iḍaren n yijjen n ccab qqaren-as Cawul. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Qqimen rejjmen Stifan s uzru netta inna: "A Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa, qbeȓ buḥbeȓ inu!" <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Iwḍa x ifadden inna-as s jjheḏ: "A Siḏi, war xasen ḥesseb ca ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ-a!" Wami inna manaya ṣafi iffeɣ-iṯ buḥbeȓ nnes.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="s">Cawul itƹeddab jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Wami nɣin Stifan, ijjen qqaren-as Cawul aqaṯ ḏinni <char style="it">iḥḍar</char> itafeq akiḏsen. Nhar nni bḏan tƹeddaben jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Lquds. Mesfraqen marra ȓmuminin ruḥen ɣar jwayeh n Yahuḏiya ḏ Samarya kuȓ ijjen mani iruḥ, war iqqim ḥadd ḏi Lquds illa arrusul. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Can n iryazen iy teggwḏen Arebbi neḍȓen Stifan ḥeznen xas aṭṭas. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Cawul netta irezzu aḏ iqḍa x jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin, itaḏef zi ṯeddarṯ ɣar ṯeddarṯ isufuɣ-d iryazen ḏ ṯemɣarin itegg-iṯen ḏi ȓeḥbes.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tbeccaren s Lʼinjil ḏi ṯendint n Samarya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Ȓmuminin nni imesfraqen traḥen zeg umcan ɣar umcan tbeccaren s wawaȓ n Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filippas iruḥ ɣar ṯendint n Samarya, itḥeddaṯ i imezḏaɣ nnes s Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Ssenni marra ȓɣaci nni wami sȓin i wawaȓ nnes wami ẓrin lmuƹjizaṯ nni igga, qqimen tṣennaṭen-as mliḥ ɣar min iqqar. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Jnun iƹeffanen ffɣen zeg waṭṭas n yiwḏan snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ s jjheḏ. Aṭṭas n izeḥḥafen ḏ yinni umi mmuṯen iḍaren genfan. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Farrḥen aṭṭas ḏi ṯendint nni.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Ḏinni ḏi ṯendint nni ijjen n useḥḥar qqaren-as Simƹan mecḥaȓ zeg wami isxeddam ssḥur. Iseḏhac marra iwḏan n Ayṯ-Samarya, yarra ixef nnes ḏ ameqqran. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Tesȓan-as marra iwḏan s umezyan ḏ umeqqran nnan xas: "Aryaz-a netta ḏ jjheḏ nni ameqqran n Arebbi iy iǧan Ƹaḍim!" <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Tesȓan-as minzi iseḏhac-iṯen aṭṭas n ȓweqṯ s ssḥur nnes. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Walakin wami ṯen ibeccar Filippas s ȓmulk n Arebbi ḏ yisem n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ȓexddenni umnen tetwaṭehharen s waman s iryazen ḏ ṯemɣarin. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simƹan netta s yixef nnes yumen itwaṭehhar s waman. Imun ak Filippas itƹejjeb Simƹan wami iẓra lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ lburhanaṯ ḏ ṯimeqqranin ig itewqiƹen.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Wami d arrin ȓexbar arrusul ḏi Lquds qa Ayṯ-Samarya qebȓen awaȓ n Arebbi, kkaren ssekken ɣarsen Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Wami uwḍen, ttaren-as i Arebbi aḏasen yuc Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Ƹaḏ war d ihwi Arruḥ uȓa x yijjen zzaysen minzi tuɣa twaṭehharen s waman ƹlaḥsab isem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa u ṣafi. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Ṯumma Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna sersen xafsen ifassen nsen uca immuc-asen Arruḥ iqeddsen.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Wami sersen arrusul ifassen nsen x yiwḏan itwaȓa Simƹan belli immuc-asen Arruḥ iqeddsen. Ikkar Simƹan irezzu aḏasen yuc tmenyaṯ <char style="it">i arrusul</char>. <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />Inna-asen: "Ucem-ayi uȓa ḏ nec jjheḏ-a ḥima wenni iy xef ɣa serseɣ ifassen inu aḏas immuc Arruḥ iqeddsen."<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ikkar Buṭrus inna-as: "Lla, jmeƹ nnuqarṯ nnec qa aḏ tiȓi ḏ ṯimessi akiḏec ḏi ȓefna minzi ṯenwiḏ aḏ tesɣeḏ lhadiya n Arebbi s tmenyaṯ! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />War ɣarek itiȓi bu umcan uȓa ḏ ȓḥaqq ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ-a ȓaḥeqqac uȓ nnec war iǧi ca nican ak Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Tub zi ccarr nnec, ttar i Siḏi Arebbi imken aḏac iɣfar min ṯenwiḏ ḏeg wuȓ nnec. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Twaȓiɣ cek ṯeccureḏ s ṯarzugi n ȓeḥseḏ, cek ḏ ameḥbus n ccarr."<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Inna-as Simƹan: "Ttareṯ akiḏi ɣar Siḏi Arebbi ḥima war ḏayi tewqiƹ uȓa ḏ ijjen n ȓḥajeṯ zi min ṯennim."<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Wami Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna cehḏen <char style="it">x Ƹisa</char> beccaren niṯni s wawaȓ n Siḏi Arebbi, kkaren ḏewȓen ɣar Lquds beccaren s Lʼinjil ḏeg waṭṭas n ȓedcuraṯ ḏi Samarya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filippas ak yijjen n lwazir n ṯmurṯ n Lḥabaca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Ijjen lmalaʼika n Siḏi Arebbi ṯessiweȓ-d ɣar Filippas ṯenna-as: "Kkar, ruḥ ɣar ljanub ekk x ubriḏ nni n ȓexȓa itawin zi Lquds ɣar Ɣazza." <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Ikkar iruḥ, imseȓqa ḏinni ak yijjen n uryaz netta ḏ aḥabaci ḏ axaṣyuni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Axaṣiyuni iƹni s ṯespanyuṯ </char><char style="it">eunuco</char> u s ṯfransist <char style="it">eunuque</char>.</note> Netta zeg imeqqranen n lmalika n Lḥabaca qqaren-as nettaṯ Kandaka, netta ig itkellafen x ṣṣenduq n tmenyaṯ n lmalika nni. Tuɣa iruḥ ɣar Lquds aḏ iƹbeḏ Arebbi, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />iḏweȓ-d ɣar Lḥabaca inya x ukarru nnes iqqar ḏi Lkitab n nnabi Icaƹya.<verse eid="ACT 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Inna-as Arruḥ n Arebbi i Filippas: "Yallah, mun ak ukarru-yin."<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Yuzzeȓ Filippas ɣar uḥabaci nni itsȓa-yas iqqar ḏi Lkitab n nnabi Icaƹya. Inna-as: "Ma ṯfehmeḏ min ṯeqqareḏ?"<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Inna-as uḥabaci nni: "Nec, mammec ɣa ggeɣ aḏ fehmeɣ meȓa war ḏayi isefhem can yijjen? Yallah ney-d akiḏi ḏeg ukarru-ya." <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Aqa lʼayaṯ nni iy iqqar uḥabaci ḏi Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">&lt;Netta amecnaw aḥuȓi iy tawin aḏas ɣarṣen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">amecnaw izmar iy iḏweȓ ḏ azeyzun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">zzaṯ i yinni itȓassen ṯaḍufṯ nnes,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">ammen war irezzem ca netta aqemmum nnes.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Ḍeȓmen-ṯ, ksin-as ȓḥaqq nnes.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">War ɣares ṯeǧi ddurriṯ axas yiȓi wawaȓ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ṯuḏarṯ nnes twakkes x ṯmurṯ-a.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Isseqsa uḥabaci nni Filippas inna-as: "Tettareɣ zzayek aḏayi ṯiniḏ, minxef issawaȓ nnabi-ya? Ma x yixef nnes niɣ x can ḥadd nneɣni?"<verse eid="ACT 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Itcarraḥ-as Filippas ibḏa-yas zi lʼayaṯ-a ḏi Lkitab itbeccar-iṯ s Ƹisa. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Gguren ḏeg ubriḏ uwḍen ɣar can waman. Inna-as uḥabaci nni: "Aqac aman mujud, min ḏayi yuɣen nec war twaṭehhareɣ ca s waman-a?"<verse eid="ACT 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />{Inna-as Filippas: "Cek, meȓa ṯumneḏ s marra uȓ nnec qa ṯzemmareḏ aḏ twaṭehhareḏ s waman-a." Yarra xas inna-as: "Wah, nec tamneɣ belli Ƹisa Lmasiḥ netta ḏ Mmis n Arebbi."}<verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Yumar uḥabaci aḏ sbedden akarru nni. Hwan s ṯnayen iḏsen ɣar waman, Filippas iṭehhar-as i uḥabaci nni s waman. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Wami d gaƹƹḏen zeg waman nni, Arruḥ n Siḏiṯneɣ irfeƹ Filippas ssenni. War iqqim ca uḥabaci nni itwaȓa Filippas ktar ƹaḏ, yuyur x ubriḏ nnes s ȓefraḥeṯ. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filippas yufa ixef nnes ḏi ṯendint n Wacdud, itraḥ zeg umcan ɣar umcan itbeccar s Lʼinjil ḏi marra ibilajen ḥetta aȓ wami yuweḍ ɣar ṯendint n Qayṣariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Itamen Cawul s Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Cawul ƹaḏ itheddaḏ s ȓmewṯ imeḥḍaren n Siḏiṯneɣ. Ikkar iruḥ ɣar arrayes n ȓfuqaha, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />ittar zzayes arruxṣaṯ aṯent iysi ɣar ṯemziḏawin n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi Dimaceq bac yinni ɣa yaf ḏeffaren abriḏ n Ƹisa s ṯemɣarin ḏ iryazen aṯen yawi ḏ imeḥbas ɣar Lquds. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Wami iggur ɣar Dimaceq iqqim-as cwayt aḏ yaweḍ, ƹlaɣafla inneḍ-as-d ijjen n nnur itceƹciƹ-d xas zeg ujenna. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Iwḍa ɣar ṯmurṯ, itesȓa i yijjen n ṯmijja ṯeqqar-as-d: "A Cawul a Cawul, mayemmi ḏayi tƹeddabeḏ?"<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Yarra xas Cawul inna-as: "Min ṯeƹniḏ cek a Siḏi?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Ṯenna-as ṯmijja nni: "Nec ḏ Ƹisa wenni iy tƹeddabeḏ." <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Inna-as: "Kkar aḏef ɣar ṯendint, aḏac itwanna ḏinni min itxeṣṣa aḏ teggeḏ."<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Iryazen nni isafaren ak Cawul bedden ḏinni ḏewȓen war ssiwiȓen ca. Sȓin i ṯmijja walakin war twiȓin ḥadd. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Ikkar Cawul zi ṯmurṯ irzem ṯiṭṭawin nnes iḏweȓ war itwiȓi walu. Ṭṭfen-ṯ zeg ufus nnes uwin-ṯ ɣar Dimaceq. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Iqqim ḏinni ṯeȓtiyyam war itett ca, war isess ca, war itwiȓi ca.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Ḏinni ḏi Dimaceq ijjen n umeḥḍar qqaren-as Anas. Imeḍhar-as-d Siḏiṯneɣ ḏi lwaḥi inna-as: "Ay Anas."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Yarra xas inna-as: "Aqayi a Siḏi."<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Inna-as Siḏiṯneɣ: "Kkar ruḥ ɣar zzenqeṯ nni umi qqaren &lt;Abriḏ Iseggḏen&gt;, rzu ḏinni ḏi ṯeddarṯ n Yahuḏa x yijjen n uryaz zi ṯendint n Ṭarsus, isem nnes Cawul. Netta itẓaǧa ḏinni. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Tuɣa iẓra ḏi lwaḥi ijjen n uryaz qqaren-as Anas aḏ d yas axas isers ifassen nnes bac aḏ iḏweȓ itwaȓa."<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Yarra xas Anas inna-as: "A Siḏi, nec xebbaren-ayi aṭṭas n yiwḏan x bnaḏem-a <char style="it">Cawul</char>, mecḥaȓ iƹeddeb netta ȓmuminin nnec ṣṣaliḥin ḏi Lquds. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Ȓexxu aqaṯ ḏa, ucin-as arruxṣa arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḥima aḏ iṭṭef marra yinni iƹebbḏen s yisem nnec."<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Inna-as Siḏiṯneɣ: "Lla ruḥ, qa aryaz-a ḏ nec iy ṯ ixḍaren aṯ ssekkeɣ ḥima aḏ issiweḍ isem inu i yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil, ḏ izeǧiḏen nsen, ḏ israʼiliyen. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Nec aḏas d seḍhareɣ mecḥaȓ iy ɣa itwaƹeddeb u labud x ssabab n yisem inu nec."<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Iruḥ Anas yuḏef ṯaddarṯ nni isers ifassen nnes x Cawul inna-as: "Ay uma Cawul, nec qa issekk-ayi-d Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa, wenni iy ḏac d imeḍharen ḏeg ubriḏ nni iy d ṯuwiḏ. Issekk-ayi-d ɣarek ḥima aḏ tḏewȓeḏ twaȓiḏ aḏ teccareḏ s Arruḥ iqeddsen." <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ȓexddenni ṯewḍa-yas-d ijjen n ȓḥajeṯ zi ṯiṭṭawin nnes am ṯeqcurṯ, iḏweȓ itwaȓa. Ikkar itwaṭehhar s waman. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Wami icca, iḏweȓ-d ɣares jjheḏ nnes.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Cawul itbeccar ḏi ṯendint n Dimaceq</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Iqqim Cawul ȓebƹaḍ n wussan ak imeḥḍaren ḏi Dimaceq. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Ȓexddenni ibḏa itḥeddaṯ ḏi ṯemziḏawin n Ayṯ-Israʼil iqqar-asen qa Ƹisa ḏ Mmis n Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Tƹejjben marra yinni itesȓan qqaren: Ma war iǧi ḏ wanita irzun aḏ iqḍa x yinni itȓaɣan x yisem-a n Ƹisa ḏi Lquds? Ma war iǧi ɣarsen iy d yusa ḏanita bac aṯen iṭṭef aṯen yawi ɣar arruyas n ȓfuqaha? <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Cawul netta yarni itḥeddaṯ s jjheḏ, iseḏhac Ayṯ-Israʼil ig izeddɣen ḏi Dimaceq, isbeyyen-asen-d s wawaȓ nnes qa Ƹisa ḏ Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23-24" />Wami ƹḏun aṭṭas n wussan, mcawaren Ayṯ-Israʼil jarasen ḥima aḏ nɣen Cawul, netta yarra-d ȓexbar. Ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar ḥeṭṭan ṯiwwura n ṯendint ḥima aṯ nɣen. <verse eid="ACT 9:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ijjen n ǧiȓeṯ imeḥḍaren nnes serwȓen-ṯ, sehwan-ṯ-iḏ s iseɣwan ḏeg yijjen n uqbub<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iqbuben teggen-ṯen x usarḏun neqȓen ḏaysen imendi, irḏan, ibawen, ṯinifin u ḏ ȓeḥwayej nneɣni.</char></note> <char style="it">zeg yijjen n ṯburjat </char>n ṣṣur n ṯendint.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cawul ḏi ṯendint n Lquds</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Wami d yuweḍ Cawul ɣar Lquds irezzu aḏ imun ak imeḥḍaren, walakin ggwḏen zzayes marra war ḏayes ttiqen ca netta ḏ ameḥḍar n ṣṣaḥ. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Barnaba ikkar ikellef zzayes yuwi-ṯ ɣar arrusul. Iƹaweḏ-asen xas mammec ḏas d imeḍhar Siḏiṯneɣ i Cawul ḏeg ubriḏ nni ḏ mammec iy kis issiweȓ ḏ mammec itḥeddaṯ s zƹameṯ ƹlaḥsab isem n Ƹisa ḏi Dimaceq. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Ssenni ṣafi, itraḥ itas-d Cawul akiḏsen ḏi Lquds, itḥeddaṯ s yijjen n zƹameṯ ƹlaḥsab isem n Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Issawaȓ ak israʼiliyen yinni issawaȓen s lluɣa ṯayunaniṯ itemnaqar akiḏsen, ssenni niṯni rezzun aṯ nɣen. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Wami d arrin ȓexbar ayṯmaṯneɣ, uwin-ṯ ɣar Qayṣariya ssenni ssekken-ṯ ɣar ṯendint n Ṭarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi marra jwayeh n Yahuḏiya ḏ Ljalil ḏ Samarya hnan. Twajehḏen, teggwḏen zi Siḏi Arebbi, twacejjaƹen s Arruḥ iqeddsen, tmarnin <char style="it">ḏi lƹadad</char>.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agenfi n yijjen n bnaḏem qqaren-as Ƹinyas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Buṭrus itraḥ zeg umcan ɣar umcan, iruḥ iẓra ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin iy zeddɣen ḏeg ubilaj n Ludda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Yufa ḏinni ijjen n uryaz qqaren-as Ƹinyas, netta izzeȓ ṯmenya iseggwusa ḏi ṯassuṯ mmuṯen-as iḍaren. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Inna-as Buṭrus: "A Ƹinyas, qa cek isgenfa-cek Ƹisa Lmasiḥ! Kkar jmeƹ ṯassuṯ nnec." Ȓexddenni ikkar ibedd x iḍaren. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Marra iwḏan iy zeddɣen ḏeg ubilaj n Ludda ḏ ȓewḍa n Carun ẓrin-ṯ tuben ɣar Siḏi Arebbi.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṭabita tnekkar-d zi ȓmewṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Ḏi ṯendint n Yafa ḏinni ijjen n ṯmeḥḍarṯ qqaren-as Ṭabita (ȓmaƹna n yisem-a, &lt;ṯiɣit n uzɣar&gt;). Tegg ȓxir aṭṭas tƹawan imesƹan. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni ṯehȓec ṯemmuṯ, ysint-teṯ sirḏent-teṯ sgaƹƹḏen-teṯ ɣar yijjen n ṯɣurfat.<verse eid="ACT 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Sȓin imeḥḍaren ḏi ṯendint n Yafa belli Buṭrus aqaṯ ḏeg ubilaj n Ludda. Ludda ṯuḏes-d i Yafa, ssekken ɣares ṯnayen n yiwḏan ḥecmen-ṯ nnan-as: "Ƹafek arwaḥ akiḏneɣ ḏeɣya!" <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Ikkar Buṭrus iruḥ akiḏsen. Wami yuweḍ sgaƹƹḏen-ṯ ɣar ṯɣurfat nni. Nnḍent-as-d i netta marra ṯajjaȓin, trunt seḍharent-as ičammiren ḏ izeǧuba tuɣa ṯxeyyeḍ Ṭabita wami tuɣa ṯeǧa akiḏsent. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Ssenni isufeɣ-iṯen Buṭrus marra zi ṯɣurfat, iwḍa x ifadden ibḏa itẓaǧa. Ixzar ɣar ddat nnes inna-as: "Ya Ṭabita, kkar!" Uca nettaṯ ṯerzem ṯiṭṭawin nnes, wami ṯeẓra Buṭrus ṯekkar ṯeqqim. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Isiɣ-as fus nnes, isekkar-it-id. Iȓaɣa-d i ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin ḏ ṯajjaȓin inna-asen aqa ṯeddar. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Iffeɣ ȓexbar ḏi ṯendint n Yafa marra, umnen zi Siḏiṯneɣ aṭṭas n yiwḏan. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Iqqim Buṭrus ḏi Yafa aṭṭas n wussan ak yijjen n bu-yiȓemawen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bu-yiȓemawen netta ixeddem ḏeg yiȓemawen n lḥayawan.</char></note> qqaren-as Simƹan.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Buṭrus ḏ Kurninyus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Ḏi ṯendint n Qayṣariya tuɣa ḏinni ijjen n uryaz qqaren-as Kurninyus. Netta ḏ ijjen n uƹaskari ḏ ameqqran n arrumanus aqaṯ ḏeg yijjen n lfirqa n ȓƹaskar umi qqaren &lt;Aṭalyan.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Ḏayes ddin iteggweḏ Arebbi, netta ḏ marra ayṯbab n ṯeddarṯ nnes. Itegg ȓxir aṭṭas ḏeg yinni iḥḏajen, war ixeṭṭi ca ṯẓaǧiṯ nnes.<verse eid="ACT 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ijjen n nhar ɣar ṯȓaṯa uƹecci, iẓra nican ḏi lwaḥi ijjen n lmalak n Arebbi itaḏef-d xas itȓaɣa-yas-d: "A Kurninyus."<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Ixzar ḏayes Kurninyus mliḥ iggweḏ inna-as: "A siḏi, min ṯrezzuḏ?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Inna-as lmalak nni: "Qa ṯẓaǧiṯ nnec ḏ ṣṣaḏaqa nnec aqa iqbeȓ-iṯent zzayek Arebbi, netta qa ifqeḏ-icek. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Sekk ȓexxu iryazen ɣar ṯendint n Yafa aḏac d awin ijjen n bnaḏem isem nnes Simƹan umi qqaren Buṭrus. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Aqaṯ ḏ anewji ɣar yijjen n bu-yiȓemawen qqaren-as Simƹan, ṯaddarṯ nnes aqat x ṭṭarf n ȓebḥar."<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Wami iruḥ lmalak nni iy kis d issiwȓen, iȓaɣa-d i ṯnayen zeg ixeddamen nnes ḏ yijjen n uƹaskari ḏayes ddin, itiȓi ȓebda akiḏes. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Iƹaweḏ-asen marra min iweqƹen, issekk-iṯen ɣar ṯendint n Yafa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Ṯiwecca nnes, yinni itwassekken zi Kurninyus ɣar ṯendint n Yafa wami ƹȓayen aḏ awḍen ḏinni, yuȓi Buṭrus ɣar ṯzeqqa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯazeqqa nettaṯ ḏ ssḍaḥ n ṯeddarṯ.</char></note> ɣar uzyen n nhar aḏ iẓẓaǧ. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Iǧuz aṭṭas ixes aḏ icc. Wami ƹaḏ sewjaḏen-as mecca yuḥa-yas-d Arebbi ḏi lwaḥi. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Iẓra ajenna inurzem shewwan-d zzayes ɣar ṯmurṯ ijjen n ȓḥajeṯ ṯegga am ṯcuqqet ḏ ṯameqqrant twacedd zi ṯɣemmura nnes s arbeƹa. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Ḏayes marra lḥayawanaṯ igguren x arbeƹa n iḍaren ḏ min itenḥuruḏen x uƹeddis ḏ yijḍaḍ n ujenna. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Ṯendeq-d ijjen n ṯmijja ṯenna-as: "Kkar a Buṭrus, ɣareṣ, ecc!"<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Inna-as netta: "Lla walu a Siḏi! Nec ƹemmarṣ ma cciɣ min iǧan ḥram niɣ mekruh."<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Ṯendeq-d ṯmijja nni wis marrṯayen ṯenna-as: "Cek war tḥarram ca min iḥeǧeȓ Arebbi yarri-ṯ ḥalal!"<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Iwqeƹ manaya ṯȓaṯa n ṯwaȓaṯin, ssenni ṯnejmeƹ ṯcuqqet nni ṯeḏweȓ ɣar ujenna. <verse eid="ACT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Iqqim Buṭrus itxemmam itƹejjeb ḏi ȓmaƹna n lwaḥi-ya iy iẓra, ȓexddenni iryazen nni iy d issekk Kurninyus ufin ṯaddarṯ n Simƹan bedden ɣar ṯewwarṯ nnes. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Ȓaɣan nnan: "Simƹan wenni umi qqaren Buṭrus, ma aqaṯ ḏinni ḏ anewji?"<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Buṭrus ƹaḏ itxemmam ḏi lwaḥi nni inna-as Arruḥ <char style="it">n Arebbi</char>, "Qa ṯȓaṯa n iryazen rezzun xak. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Kkar hwa ɣarsen, ruḥ akiḏsen bȓa ma aḏaysen ṯcekkeḏ qa ḏ nec iy ṯen d issekken."<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Ihwa-d Buṭrus ɣar iryazen nni inna-asen, "Aqa ḏ nec iy xef ṯrezzum. Mayemmi ɣari d ṯusim?"<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Nnan-as: "Qa neccin issekk-aneɣ-d Kurninyus ijjen n uƹaskari ḏ ameqqran n arrumanus. Netta ḏ ijjen n uryaz nican iteggweḏ Arebbi, tweqqaren-ṯ marra ȓqum n Ayṯ-Israʼil. Inna-as ijjen n lmalak n Arebbi: Sekk ɣar Buṭrus, aḏ d yas ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnec aḏas ṯṣennṭeḏ min ḏac ɣa yini." <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Ikkar Buṭrus isiḏef-iṯen ɣar ḏaxeȓ isnewjew-iṯen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Ṯiwecca nnes iruḥ akiḏsen Buṭrus. Munen akiḏes ȓebƹaḍ n ayṯmas zi ṯendint n Yafa. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Farwicca nnes<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Farwicca twaḥsab ṯasyaḍen.</char></note> yuweḍ Buṭrus ɣar ṯendint n Qayṣariya. Itraja-ṯen ḏinni Kurninyus, akiḏes ȓebƹaḍ n ȓeḥbab nnes ḏ ȓebƹaḍ n imeddukaȓ nnes iy d iƹareḍ. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Wami yuweḍ Buṭrus ɣar ṯeddarṯ nni, iffeɣ-d ɣares Kurninyus iwḍa-yas ɣar iḍaren nnes isejjeḏ-as. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Isbedd-iṯ Buṭrus x iḍaren inna-as: "Lla, kkar bedd. Qa nec ḏ bnaḏem am nec am cek."<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Yuḏef Buṭrus issaweȓ akiḏes yufa ḏinni aṭṭas n yiwḏan munen. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Inna-asen: "Qa ṯessnem belli israʼiliyen ɣarsen ḥram aḏ xellṭen ak ȓbarrani niɣ aḏ aḏfen ṯaddarṯ nsen. Walakin Arebbi isfahem-ayi-d qbeȓ war qqareɣ i ḥadd qa cek ḥram niɣ mekruh. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Wami ḏayi d ṯȓaɣim usiɣ-d bȓa ma aḏ iniɣ lla. Akenniw sseqsiɣ, mayemmi ɣari d ṯessekkem?"<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Indeq-d Kurninyus inna-as: "Qa nec arbeƹiyyam zeg wami ɣar ṯȓaṯa uƹecci am ȓweqṯ-a, tuɣa tẓaǧiɣ ḏi ṯeddarṯ inu. Ƹlaɣafla ibedd-d zzaṯi ijjen n uṯarras ɣares arruḍ itceƹciƹ. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Iqqar-ayi-d: A Kurninyus! Qa Arebbi istajeb-ac i ṯẓaǧiṯ nnec, ṣṣaḏaqa nnec ifekkar ḏayes. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Sekk ɣar ṯendint n Yafa, awi-d Simƹan wenni umi qqaren Buṭrus. Aqaṯ ḏinni ḏ anewji ḏi ṯeddarṯ n yijjen n bu-yiȓemawen qqaren-as Simƹan x ṭṭarf n ȓebḥar. <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Iwa x manaya iy ɣarek d ssekkeɣ ḏeɣya, ṯeggiḏ mliḥ wami d ṯusiḏ. Neccin ȓexxu marra aqaneɣ neḥḍar zzaṯ i Arebbi bac a nṣenneṭ marra minzi cek iweṣṣa Siḏi Arebbi."<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Ibḏa Buṭrus issawaȓ inna-asen: "Ḏ ṣṣaḥ twaȓiɣ Arebbi war itegg ca s wuḏemawen jar yiwḏan. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Arebbi iqebbeȓ iwḏan zi mkuȓ ȓgens yinni iy ṯ iteggwḏen teggen min iǧan nican. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Ṯessnem Arebbi issekk-d awaȓ nnes ɣar Ayṯ-Israʼil itbeccar-iṯen s Lʼinjil n ȓehna s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, netta ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ n marra iwḏan. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37-38" />Kenniw qa ṯessnem min iweqƹen ḏi marra ṯamurṯ n Yahuḏiya. Aqa nnabi Yaḥya tuɣa itbeccar iwḏan ḥima aḏ twaṭehharen s waman. Ssenni zi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil ibḏa Ƹisa naṣiri itbeccar, iccur-iṯ Arebbi s jjheḏ ḏ Arruḥ iqeddsen. Netta itraḥ zeg umcan ɣar umcan itegg ȓxir isgenfa marra yinni itƹeddab Ibȓis minzi Arebbi aqaṯ akiḏes. <verse eid="ACT 10:37-38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Neccin ḏ ȓechuḏ x marra min itegg Ƹisa ḏi ṯmurṯ n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ ṯendint n Lquds. Nɣin-ṯ wami ṯ refƹen x ṯeḥnact.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯaḥnact-a nettaṯ ḏ ṯaḥniyṯ nni xef ṣellben Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Nhar wis ṯeȓtiyyam isekkar-iṯ-iḏ Arebbi zi ȓmewṯ ismeḍhar-iṯ-iḏ. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Maci ismeḍhar-iṯ-iḏ Arebbi i marra ccaƹb; Lla, ismeḍhar-iṯ-iḏ i ȓechuḏ iy ixḍar zi qbeȓ iƹni neccin iy kiḏes iccin iy kiḏes iswin wami d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Neccin iweṣṣa-yaneɣ Ƹisa a nbeccar ccaƹb, a necheḏ belli Arebbi ixḍar-iṯ aḏ iḥaseb yinni iddaren ḏ yinni immuṯen. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Marra lʼanbiya cehhḏen xas nnan qa marra yinni zzayes ɣa yamnen aḏ twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen s yisem nnes."<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Wami ƹaḏ issawaȓ Buṭrus ḏi manaya, yusa-d Arruḥ iqeddsen ihwa-d x marra yinni itesȓan i wawaȓ nnes. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Ȓmuminin zeg Ayṯ-Israʼil iy d yusin ak Buṭrus qqimen tƹejjben wami ufin Arruḥ iqeddsen itwafeyyeḍ uȓa x yinni war iǧin ca ḏ israʼiliyen. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Ȓaḥeqqac sȓin-asen ssawaȓen s lluɣaṯ <char style="it">war iǧin bu nsen</char> ḥemmḏen Arebbi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Uca inna Buṭrus: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />"Ma ḏinni can bnaḏem iy ɣa isbedden iwḏan-a bac war tetwaṭehhiren ca s waman? Yina immuc-asen Arruḥ iqeddsen am neccin am niṯni!" <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />S manaya iweṣṣa-ṯen <char style="it">Buṭrus</char> aḏ twaṭehharen s waman ƹlaḥsab isem n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Ssenni ttaren zzayes akiḏsen iqqim can wussan.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Buṭrus itxebbar jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi Lquds</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Menbaƹd, arrusul ḏ uwmaṯen yinni iǧan ḏi Yahuḏiya sȓin qa uȓa ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil qebȓen awaȓ n Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2-3" />Wami igaƹƹeḏ Buṭrus ɣarsen ɣar Lquds ȓexddenni kkaren ȓmuminin nni n Ƹisa yinni iticcen lhimma aṭṭas i ṭṭahareṯ ccin-ṯ s ȓhemm nnan-as: "Mayemmi ṯuḏfeḏ ɣar ṯeddarṯ n yinni war iṭehharen ca ṯecciḏ akiḏsen aɣrum?"<verse eid="ACT 11:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Ibḏa Buṭrus itfessar-asen ṯa s ṯa inna-asen: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />"Nec wami tuɣa ǧiɣ ḏi ṯendint n Yafa tẓaǧiɣ yuḥa-ayi-d Arebbi, ḏi lwaḥi nni shewwan-d zeg ujenna ɣar ṯmurṯ ijjen n ȓḥajeṯ ṯegga am ṯcuqqet ḏ ṯameqqrant twacedd zi ṯɣemmura nnes s arbeƹa ṯusa-d ɣari. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Xzareɣ ḏayes mliḥ ufiɣ lḥayawanaṯ igguren x arbeƹa n iḍaren ḏ ȓuḥuc ḏ min itenḥuruḏen x uƹeddis ḏ yijḍaḍ n ujenna. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Ṯumma sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja ṯeqqar-ayi: Kkar a Buṭrus, ɣareṣ, ecc! <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Nniɣ-as: Lla walu a Siḏi! Nec ƹemmarṣ war ggiɣ ḏeg uqemmum inu min iǧan ḥram niɣ mekruh. <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Ṯendeq-d ṯmijja nni zeg ujenna wis marrṯayen ṯenna-ayi: Cek war tḥarram ca min iḥeǧeȓ Arebbi yarri-ṯ ḥalal! <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Iwqeƹ-ayi manayenni ṯȓaṯa n ṯwaȓaṯin, ssenni inejmeƹ kuȓci ɣar ujenna.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Ḏi ṯsaƹƹat nni bedden ṯȓaṯa n iryazen ɣar ṯeddarṯ nni mani ǧiɣ ḏ anewji, twassekken-d ɣari zi ṯendint n Qayṣariya. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Ṯumma iweṣṣa-ayi Arruḥ n Arebbi inna-ayi ruḥ akiḏsen bȓa ma aḏaysen ṯcekkeḏ. Uwiɣ akiḏi setta-ya n yayṯma, nuḏef ɣar ṯeddarṯ n Kurninyus. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Iƹaweḏ-aneɣ netta mammec iẓra ijjen n lmalak ibedd-d ḏi ṯeddarṯ nnes inna-as: Sekk iryazen ɣar ṯendint n Yafa aḏ d awin ssenni Simƹan umi qqaren Buṭrus. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Aḏac yini awaȓen iy zi ɣa ṯnejmeḏ cek ḏ marra ayṯbab n ṯeddarṯ nnec. <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Ṯumma wami bḏiɣ ssawaȓeɣ, yusa-d Arruḥ iqeddsen ihwa-d xasen mammec xaneɣ d ihwa ḏeg umezwaru. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Fekkareɣ-d min inna Siḏiṯneɣ wami inna qa Yaḥya iṭehhar i yiwḏan s waman, kenniw qa aḏ twaṭehharem s Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Iwa meȓa yuca-asen Arebbi i niṯni amecnaw min ḏaneɣ yuca i neccin wami numen zi Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, min ƹniɣ nec bac aḏ ƹarrḍeɣ i Arebbi?"<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Yinni iḥḍaren wami sȓin i wawaȓ-a, sqaren ḥemḏen Arebbi nnan: "Xyar, uȓa ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil yuca-asen Arebbi ttuba aɣarsen ṯiȓi ṯuḏarṯ!"<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Wanṭakya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Ƹlaḥsab aƹeddeb nni iy iweqƹen wami itwaneɣ Stifan, ȓmuminin kuȓ ijjen mani iruḥ: ijjen iruḥ aȓ Finiqya, ijjen iruḥ aȓ Qubruṣ, ijjen iruḥ aȓ Wanṭakya. War tbecciren ḏinni ḥadd s wawaȓ n Arebbi illa israʼiliyen. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Walakin ȓebƹaḍ n iryazen zi Qubruṣ ḏ Lqurina usin-d ɣar Wanṭakya bḏan ssawaȓen ak iyunaniyen tbeccaren-ṯen s Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Siḏi Arebbi aqaṯ akiḏsen, aṭṭas n yiwḏan umnen ḏewȓen-d ɣar Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Yuweḍ ȓexbar-a ɣar jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi Lquds, kkaren ssekken Barnaba ɣar Wanṭakya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Wami d yuweḍ, yufa mammec ṯen ibarek Arebbi. Ifareḥ ibḏa itcejjaƹ-iṯen marra bac aḏ qqimen ḏeg ubriḏ n Siḏiṯneɣ s marra uȓawen nsen. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barnaba netta ḏ ijjen n uryaz ḏ aṣebḥan iccur s Arruḥ iqeddsen itamen aṭṭas, xarebbi n yiwḏan umnen zi Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Iruḥ Barnaba ɣar ṯendint n Ṭarsus irezzu x Cawul. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Wami ṯ yufa yuwi-ṯ-iḏ akiḏes ɣar ṯendint-a n Wanṭakya. Seƹḏun ƹam ikmaȓ ak jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin, seȓmaḏen aṭṭas n yiwḏan. Ḏanita ḏi Wanṭakya-ya iy twasemman imeḥḍaren ṯwaȓa ṯamezwarut s &lt;imasiḥiyen.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Ḏi ȓiyyam nni hwan-d can n lʼanbiya zi Lquds ɣar Wanṭakya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Ikkar ijjen zzaysen qqaren-as Ɣabus, ixbar <char style="it">i ȓmuminin ḏinni</char> s min ḏas inna Arruḥ n Arebbi. Inna-asen qa aḏ iwqeƹ ijjen n buheyyuf ḏ ameqqran x ṯmurṯ marra (u ḏ ṣṣaḥ iwqeƹ manayenni ḏi ȓweqṯ n Lmalik Qayṣar Kludyus). <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Kkaren imeḥḍaren tafqen jarasen kuȓ ijjen zzaysen aḏ ssekken cwayt n lmuƹawana ƹlaḥsab ṯizemmar nsen ɣar ayṯmaṯsen ig izeddɣen ḏi Yahuḏiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Amenni iy ggin jarasen, ucin lmuƹawana nni i Barnaba ḏ Cawul at ssiwḍen i imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin iy iǧan ḏinni.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Buṭrus inejjem zeg ufus n Lmalik Hirudus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni, azeǧiḏ Hirudus ibḏa itƹeddab ȓebƹaḍiṯ zi jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Netta yumar uca nɣin s ssif Yaƹqub umas n Yuḥanna. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Wami yufa manayenni iƹjeb-asen i Ayṯ-Israʼil ikkar iṭṭef uȓa ḏ Buṭrus. Ḏi ȓiyyam n Ȓƹiḏ n Ṯefḍirṯ iy ḏi iwqeƹ manayenni. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Iṭṭef-iṯ iggi-ṯ ḏi ȓeḥbes, isellem-iṯ i arbeƹa n lfirqaṯ n ȓƹaskar aṯ ḥḍan, mkuȓ lfirqa ḏayes arbeƹa. Inwa axas iḥkem zzaṯ i ccaƹb menbaƹd i Ȓƹiḏ Ameqqran. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Tƹessasen x Buṭrus ḏi ȓeḥbes, jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin tettaren xas i Arebbi.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Ǧiȓeṯ nni iy ḏi d ɣa iṣebbeḥ Hirudus aḏ iḥkem x Buṭrus zzaṯ i ccaƹb, tuɣa Buṭrus iṭṭeṣ jar ṯnayen n ȓƹaskar icedd s ṯnayen n snaseȓ. Ȓƹaskar nneɣni ɣar ṯewwarṯ tƹessasen x ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Ȓexddenni ṯmeḍhar-d ḏinni ijjen n lmalaʼika n Siḏi Arebbi, itceƹciƹ-d ijjen n nnur ḏi ȓeḥbes. Lmalaʼika nni ṯuwṯa Buṭrus ɣar uɣezḏis nnes ṯesfaq-iṯ-iḏ ṯenna-as: "Kkar ḏeɣya!" Uca snaseȓ nni fesyent zeg ifassen nnes. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ṯenna-as lmalaʼika nni: "Kkar ḥezzem, qqen ṯisiȓa nnec." Igga Buṭrus min ḏas ṯenna. Ṯenna-as ƹaweḏ: "Egg azeǧab nnec, ḏfar-ayi-d."<verse eid="ACT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Ikkar Buṭrus iffeɣ iḏfar-it, war issin ca min tegg lmalaʼika nni ma ḏ ṣṣaḥ ma lla, itɣir-as yuḥa-yas-d Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Ƹḏun x uƹessas amezwaru ḏ wis ṯnayen. Uwḍen ɣar ṯewwarṯ n ȓeḥḏiḏ ṯenni itawin ɣar ṯendint, ṯerzem waḥḏes ffɣen. Ȓexddenni wami gguren ḏeg yijjen n zzenqeṯ ṯesmeḥ ḏayes lmalaʼika nni. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Ḏinni iy d yarra Buṭrus ȓbaȓ nnes inna: "Ȓexxu ssneɣ manaya ḏ ṣṣaḥ qa issekk-ayi-d Siḏi Arebbi lmalaʼika nnes, isenjem-ayi-d zeg ifassen n Hirudus ḏ marra min xsen aḏayi ggen Ayṯ-Israʼil."<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Wami ifṭen ḏi manaya, iruḥ ɣar ṯeddarṯ n Maryam yemmas n Yuḥanna umi qqaren Marqus, tmunen ḏinni aṭṭas n yiwḏan tẓaǧan. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Buṭrus tuɣa isqerqub ḏi ṯewwarṯ n barra, ṯruḥ ɣares ijjen n ṯxeddant qqaren-as Ruda aḏas terzem. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Wami ṯeƹqeȓ awaȓ n Buṭrus ṯfareḥ aṭṭas, walakin qbeȓ ma aḏ terzem ṯawwarṯ ṯeƹqeb-d ɣarsen ṯuzzeȓ ṯenna-asen qa Buṭrus aqaṯ ɣar ṯewwarṯ <char style="it">isqerqub</char>. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Nnan-as: "Ma ṯbuhȓiyeḏ niɣ?" Walakin nettaṯ metʼakkeda belli min ṯenna nican. Nnan-as: "Waqila wanita ḏ buḥbeȓ n Buṭrus waha."<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Iqqim Buṭrus isqerqub ƹaḏ ḏi ṯewwarṯ. Wami ḏas rezmen ufin-ṯ ḏ netta, qqimen tƹejjben. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Iqqar-asen s ufus stukaṯ, ssenni iƹaweḏ-asen mammec iy ṯ isufeɣ Siḏi Arebbi zi ȓeḥbes. Inna-asen: "Xebbarem Yaƹqub ḏ ayṯmaṯneɣ s min iweqƹen." Iffeɣ iruḥ ɣar yijjen n umcan nneɣni.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Wami iṣbaḥ ȓḥaȓ iwqeƹ ijjen n umenɣi ḏ ameqqran jar ȓƹaskar manis ikka Buṭrus. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Hirudus issekk axas rzun, war ṯ yufi ca. Wami ḏasen igga lʼistijwab i iƹessasen nni, yumar aṯen nɣen.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 12:19">Ȓmewṯ n uzeǧiḏ Hirudus</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Ssenni iffeɣ uzeǧiḏ Hirudus zi ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya iruḥ ɣar ṯendint n Qayṣariya iqqim ḏinni. <verse eid="ACT 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Tuɣa iɣḍeb x imezḏaɣ n ṯendint n Ṣur ḏ ṯendint n Ṣayda. Kkaren imezḏaɣ nni rezzun aḏ meṣȓaḥen ak uzeǧiḏ Hirudus liʼanna lmakla nsen tekk-d zi ṯmurṯ n uzeǧiḏ. Ttaren-as manaya wami ruḥen mesfhamen ak Blastus iǧan netta ḏ naʼib n Hirudus. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Ḏeg yijjen n ȓmunasaba, ikkar Hirudus irsa arruḍ iy teggen izeǧiḏen iqqim x lƹarc ibḏa istexṭab x imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ nni. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Kkaren niṯni ƹeyyḍen s jjheḏ qqaren: "Cek ṯmijja nnec am yijjen zi arebbiṯen maci am bnaḏem!" <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Ȓexddenni ijjen n lmalaʼika n Siḏi Arebbi ṯsehȓec Hirudus wami war iḥmiḏ ca Arebbi. Ɣeẓẓen-ṯ imiɣziwen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Imiɣziwen niṯni ḏ sintaṯ tiȓint ḏeg uƹeddis n bnaḏem.</char></note> immuṯ netta.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Walakin awaȓ n Arebbi itentacer netta yarenni. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Barnaba ḏ Cawul ḏewȓen-d zi Lquds wami kemmȓen ȓxeḏmeṯ nsen, uwin-d akiḏsen Yuḥanna umi qqaren Marqus.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Ȓmuminin ssekken-d Barnaba ḏ Cawul aḏ beccaren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Ḏi jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Wanṭakya ḏinni lʼanbiya ḏ imseȓmaḏen. Niṯni ḏ Barnaba, ḏ Simƹan wenni umi qqaren Abercan, ḏ Luqyus zi Lqurina, ḏ Manahen wenni ig irebban ak uzeǧiḏ Hirudus zi ṯemẓi nnes, ḏ Cawul. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Wami ƹebbḏen Siḏi Arebbi tẓumman, inna-asen Arruḥ iqeddsen: Ḥuzem-ayi-d Barnaba ḏ Cawul i ȓxeḏmeṯ nni umi ṯen ixḍareɣ. <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Wami ẓummen ẓẓuǧen, ȓexddenni sersen xasen ifassen nsen ssekken-ṯen.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Issekk-iṯen Arruḥ iqeddsen ruḥen ɣar ṯendint n Sulukya. Ssenni safaren ḏeg uɣarrabu ɣar ṯeyzirṯ n Qubruṣ. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Wami uwḍen ɣar ṯendint n Salamis bḏan tbeccaren s wawaȓ n Arebbi ḏi ṯemziḏawin n Ayṯ-Israʼil, itƹawan-iṯen Yuḥanna nni.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Uyuren ḏi ṯeyzirṯ nni amen-ṯekmaȓ aȓ wami uwḍen ɣar ṯendint n Pafus. Ufin ḏinni ijjen n useḥḥar netta ḏ aʼisraʼili yarra ixef nnes ḏ nnabi qqaren-as Benyacuƹ. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Itiȓi ak lƹamil wenni umi qqaren Sarjyus Bulus. Lƹamil nni netta ḏ ijjen n uryaz ḏ amiɣis, iȓaɣa-d i Barnaba ḏ Cawul ixes aḏas sȓemḏen awaȓ n Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Walakin iƹarreḍ-asen useḥḥar nni Benyacuƹ (wenni umi qqaren s ṯyunaniṯ Ulimas). Netta irezzu aḏ isbeƹƹeḏ lƹamil x lʼiman. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Ikkar Cawul iƹni Bulus iccur s Arruḥ iqeddsen ixzar ḏeg useḥḥar nni mliḥ; <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />Inna-as: "Cek ḏ mmis n Ibȓis. Cek ḏ ȓaƹḏu n qaƹ min iǧan nican, ṯeccureḏ s lḥila ḏ ṯeḥraymect! Ma ƹaḏ ṯrezzuḏ aḏ tƹewwjeḏ ibriḏen iy iǧan nican n Siḏi Arebbi? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Ssa aȓ ṯsawent Siḏi Arebbi aqaṯ ḍeḏ nnec, aḏ tḏarɣȓeḏ ataf war ṯẓerreḏ ca ṯfawṯ n ṯfuct aȓ yijjen n lmudda." Ȓexddenni ṯekka-as-d ṯacbabṯ i useḥḥar nni x ṯiṭṭawin itwaȓa ṯaǧest, iqqim itenneḍ ḏinni irezzu wi ṯ ɣa isgewwḏen s ufus. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Iẓra manayenni lƹamil ȓexddenni yumen, iqqim iḏehhec s ttaƹlim n Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ḏ Barnaba tbeccaren ḏi Wanṭakya ḏ Pisidya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Inya Bulus ḏ imeddukaȓ nnes ḏeg uɣarrabu, ruḥen zi ṯendint nni n Pafus ɣar ṯendint n Barja ḏi Pamfilya. Ismeḥ ḏaysen ḏinni Yuḥanna iḏweȓ-d ɣar Lquds. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Niṯni ffɣen zi ṯendint n Barja ruḥen ɣar ṯendint n Wanṭakya ḏi jwayeh n Pisidya. Uḏfen qqimen ḏi ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi nhar n ssebṯ. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Menbaƹd i ṯɣuri zi Lkutub n Ccariƹa n Musa ḏ lʼanbiya, ssekken arruyas n ṯemziḏa awaȓ nsen i Barnaba ḏ Cawul nnan-asen: "Ay ayṯma, meȓa ɣarwem can wawaȓ iy zi ɣa ṯcejjƹem ccaƹb-a, inim-asen-ṯ."<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Ikkar iceyyar-asen Bulus s ufus inna-asen: "Ay iryazen n Ayṯ-Israʼil ay yinni iteggwḏen Arebbi, ṣennṭeṯ. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Fa Arebbi iy iǧan x ccaƹb n Ayṯ-Israʼil ixḍar netta ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ, yarni lƹadad nsen wami niṯni tuɣa zeddɣen ḏi Miṣra. Isufeɣ-iṯen ssenni s jjheḏ nnes. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Ṯumma iṣbar akiḏsen ḏeg uƹeṣṣay nsen can arbeƹin sna ḏi ṣṣaḥra. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ṯumma iqḍa x sebƹa n ȓegnus ḏi ṯmurṯ n Kanƹan, ṯamurṯ nni iswarṯ-it i ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Marra manayenni ikka xasen ijjen arbeƹmiyya u xemsin sna. Ṯumma igga xasen ȓquḍaṯ aȓ ȓweqṯ nni n nnabi Ṣamwil. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ṯumma ttaren-as i Arebbi aɣarsen yiȓi ijjen n uzeǧiḏ nsen, ssenni yuca-asen Cawul mmis n Qays zi Ayṯ-Benyamin. Iḥkem xasen netta arbeƹin iseggwusa. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Ṯumma ikkes-iṯ Arebbi, yarra Dawed ḏ azeǧiḏ xasen. Icheḏ xas inna qa ufiɣ Dawed mmis n Yassa netta ḏ ijjen n uryaz iqbeȓ ȓxaḍar inu aḏ igg marra min xseɣ.<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Ṯumma zi ddurriṯ n Dawed issekk-d Arebbi Ƹisa ɣar Ayṯ-Israʼil iƹni wenni iy ṯen ɣa isnejmen, mammec ṯen iwƹeḏ zi qbeȓ. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Qbeȓ ma aḏ iraḥ ɣarsen Ƹisa, tuɣa ḏinni Yaḥya itbeccar marra ccaƹb n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḥima aḏ tuben aḏ twaṭehharen s waman. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Wami Yaḥya ƹȓayen aḏ ikemmeȓ ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes inna-asen: Min ḏayi tarrim kenniw? Qa nec war ǧiɣ ca ḏ wenni iy trajam! Menbaƹd i nec aḏ d yas ijjen war sḏihiǧeɣ aḏas fesyeɣ uȓa ḏ ifiȓan n ṯsiȓa iqqen ḏeg iḍaren nnes."<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />
    <char style="it">Inna-asen Bulus</char>: "Ay ayṯma, a ṯarwa n Brahim, ay yinni iteggwḏen Arebbi! Qa ḏ neccin umi d issekk Arebbi awaȓ-a iy zi ɣa nenjem. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Qa imezḏaɣ n Lquds ḏ arruyas nsen war ƹqiȓen ca Ƹisa-ya, war fhimen ca awaȓen n lʼanbiya ḏi Lkutub iy qqaren ḏi ṯemziḏawin zi ssebṯ ɣar ssebṯ. Wami ḥekmen x Ƹisa s ȓmewṯ ffɣen-d wawaȓen nni iy nnan lʼanbiya. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Waxxa war ufin uȓa ḏ ijjen n ssabab iy zi ɣa xas ḥekmen s ȓmewṯ, walakin ttaren i Bilaṭus aṯ ineɣ. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Wami ggin marra min tuɣa xas urin lʼanbiya, sehwan-ṯ-iḏ zi ṯeḥnact sersen-ṯ ḏeg unḍeȓ. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Walakin Arebbi isekkar-iṯ-iḏ zi ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Ṯumma imeḍehhar-d Ƹisa ḏeg waṭṭas n nhuraṯ i yinni tuɣa igaƹƹḏen akiḏes zi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil ɣar ṯendint n Lquds. Ȓexxu yina iǧan ḏ ȓechuḏ nnes ɣar ccaƹb.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32-33" />Fa neccin netbeccar-ikenniw s manaya. Iƹni Arebbi wami d isekkar Ƹisa zi ȓmewṯ ṣafi ikemmeȓ min zi tuɣa iwƹeḏ ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ, ikemmeȓ-iṯ akiḏneɣ neccin iǧan ḏ ṯarwa nsen. Aqa yura ḏi Lkitab n Zzabur ḏeg yizȓi wis ṯnayen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:32-33">Aqa cek ḏ Mmi, nhara nec ḏewȓeɣ ḏ Babac.<verse eid="ACT 13:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Fa Arebbi isekkar-d Ƹisa zi ȓmewṯ iƹni ƹemmarṣ aḏ ikiccew. Amenni iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Aḏawem uceɣ lbaraka ṯamqeddest, lbaraka ḏ ṣṣaḥ iy zi weƹḏeɣ <char style="it">nnabi</char> Dawed.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Amenni iqqar ƹaweḏ Lkitab: &lt;War tejjiḏ ca Lƹaḍim nnec aḏ ikiccew.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Liʼanna Dawed ḏi zman nnes wami ikemmeȓ min ixes Arebbi ṣafi immuṯ, itwanḍeȓ ṭṭarf i ȓejḏuḏ nnes ṣafi ikiccew. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Walakin wenni d isekkar Arebbi zi ȓmewṯ netta lla war ikiccew ca.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39" />Iḏen ay ayṯma, rezzuɣ aḏ tessnem s wawaȓ-a belli s Ƹisa-ya iy zi ɣa twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ. Marra wenni zzayes ɣa yamnen as twaɣfarent marra ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnes; Lɣufran-a wanita war izemmar ca aḏ yiȓi s Ccariƹa n Musa. <verse eid="ACT 13:38-39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Iwa ḥḍaṯ ixef nwem bac war ḏawem itewqiƹ ca min urin lʼanbiya:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />Xzareṯ a yinni itbuṣaren, tƹejjbeṯ fnaṯ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Ḏi ȓiyyam nwem aḏ ggeɣ can ṯmesȓayin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">waxxa ixebbar-ikenniw ḥadd zzaysent,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">war ṯ timnem ca."<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Wami kkaren Bulus ḏ Barnaba aḏ d ffɣen zi ṯemziḏa nni n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ttaren zzaysen yiwḏan nni aḏasen ḥeddṯen s manayenni nhar n ssebt iy d ɣa yasen. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Wami d teffɣen zi ṯemziḏa, ḏfaren-ṯen aṭṭas n israʼiliyen ḏ yinni iseȓmen ḏi ddin n Ayṯ-Israʼil iy teggwḏen Arebbi. Bulus ḏ Barnaba ssiwȓen akiḏsen cejjƹen-ṯen ḥima aḏ arnin ḏi arḍa n Arebbi.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Wami d ṯuweḍ sebṯ nni, munen ƹȓayen marra ayṯbab n ṯendint ḥima aḏ ṣennṭen i wawaȓ n Siḏi Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ayṯ-Israʼil wami ufin ȓɣaci aṭṭas bḏan ḥessḏen aṭṭas arrusul bḏan tƹarraḍen i wawaȓ n Bulus, tukkaren-ṯ. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Bulus ḏ Barnaba nnan-asen s yijjen n zƹameṯ: "Neccin tuɣa itxeṣṣa aḏawem nessiweȓ i kenniw ḏ imezwura s wawaȓ n Arebbi. Wami ṯugim, ṯḥekmem x yixef nwem belli kenniw war ṯesḏiheǧem ca ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda, ȓexxu qa neccin a nraḥ ɣar yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Liʼanna Siḏi Arebbi iweṣṣa-yaneɣ inna-aneɣ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">&lt;Arriɣ-cek ḏ ṯfawṯ i marra ȓegnus,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">ḥima iwḏan aḏ nejmen ḥetta aȓ ṭṭarf n ddunect.&gt;"<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil wami sȓin min inna <char style="it">Bulus</char>, farḥen ḥemmḏen i wawaȓ n Siḏi Arebbi. Umnen marra yinni ixḍar Arebbi i ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Intacar wawaȓ n Siḏi Arebbi ḏi ṯmurṯ nni marra. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Walakin israʼiliyen samaren ṯimɣarin iy ḏaysent ddin ɣarsent lmartaba, ƹaweḏ samaren imeqqranen n ṯendint. Teggen ssabab i yiwḏan ḥima aḏ ƹeddben Bulus ḏ Barnaba uca uzzȓen xasen zi jjiheṯ nni. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Kkaren Bulus ḏ Barnaba mesḥen ṯaƹejjact zeg iḍaren nsen <char style="it">am yijjen n chaḏeṯ</char> xasen, ruḥen ɣar ṯendint n Ikunya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Imeḥḍaren iǧan ḏinni ccuren s ȓefraḥeṯ ḏ Arruḥ iqeddsen.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ḏ Barnaba tbeccaren ḏi ṯendint n Ikunya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Ḏi ṯendint n Ikunya uḏfen Bulus ḏ Barnaba s ṯnayen iḏsen ɣar ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil, umnen aṭṭas n israʼiliyen ḏ iyunaniyen s ttebcir nsen. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Walakin israʼiliyen iy yugin aḏ amnen samaren yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil x ayṯmaṯneɣ, ƹemmaren-asen azeǧif. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Bulus ḏ Barnaba qqimen ḏinni aṭṭas n ȓweqṯ tbeccaren s Siḏiṯneɣ s yijjen n zƹameṯ. Igga Siḏiṯneɣ lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ lburhanaṯ x ifassen n Bulus ḏ Barnaba bac aḏ isbeyyen awaȓen nni iy tbeccaren x arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ ḏ ṣṣaḥ. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Mesfraqen ayṯbab n ṯendint-a n Ikunya x ṯnayen. Ȓebƹaḍ iḏsen aqaṯen ak israʼiliyen, ȓebƹaḍ iḏsen aqaṯen ak arrusul. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Kkaren israʼiliyen ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil tafqen ak arruyas nsen bac aḏ ƹedden x arrusul aṯen rejmen s uzru. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6-7" />Arrin-d ȓexbar <char style="it">arrusul</char>, arewȓen ɣar ṯendint n Listra ḏ ṯendint n Dirba ḏ marra jwayeh iy ḏasent d yuḏsen tbeccaren ḏinni ḏi lwilaya n Likawniya.<verse eid="ACT 14:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rejjmen arrasul Bulus s uzru ḏi ṯendint n Listra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Ḏi ṯendint n Listra ḏinni ijjen n uryaz ḏ anecruf mmuṯen-as iḍaren, zeg wami d ixȓeq ƹemmarṣ ma yuyur. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Itsȓa i wawaȓ n Bulus. Ixzar ḏayes mliḥ Bulus, yufa ḏayes lʼiman iy zi ɣa igenfa. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Iȓaɣa-d s yijjen n ṯmijja ṯejheḏ inna-as: "Kkar, bedd nican x iḍaren nnec!" Ȓexddenni inexḍef ibḏa iggur.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Wami ẓrin ȓɣaci nni min igga Bulus, ƹeyyḍen s lluɣa n Liqunya nnan qa arebbiṯen ḏewȓen ḏ iwḏan hwan-d ɣarneɣ! <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Semman-as i Barnaba &lt;Zafas&gt;, semman-as i Bulus &lt;Hirmis&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isemawen-a &lt;Zafas&gt; ḏ &lt;Hirmis&gt; niṯni ḏ lʼaṣnam n iyunaniyen.</char></note> liʼanna ḏ Bulus ig itbeccaren aṭṭas. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Yusa-d ȓemqeddem n lʼaṣnam Zafas wenni ig itiȓin ḏi zzawyiṯ zzaṯ i ṯendint, yuwi-d iyenduzen yuwi-d ṯiqebbiḍin n nwar ɣar ṯewwura n ṯendint, ixes netta ḏ ccaƹb aḏasen qeddmen dbiḥeṯ i Barnaba ḏ Bulus.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Arrusul nni iƹni Barnaba ḏ Bulus wami sȓin awaȓ nni kkaren cerrgen arruḍ nsen. Uḏfen ḏi ȓwesṭ n yiwḏan ƹeyyḍen nnan-asen: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />"Ay iryazen, mayemmi teggem manaya? Qa neccin ḏ iwḏan waha am kenniw am neccin kif-kif. Nuwi-awem-d ijjen n wawaȓ ḏ aṣebḥan bac aḏ tbeƹƹḏem i ṯmesȓayin-a war ineffƹen ca, aḏ tḏewȓem ɣar Arebbi iddaren iy d ixeȓqen ajenna ḏ ṯmurṯ ḏ ȓebḥar ḏ marra min ḏaysen. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ḏi zmanaṯ iƹḏun, Arebbi ijja marra ȓegnus aḏ ḏfaren ibriḏen iy xsen. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Walakin Arebbi isbeyyan-awem-d ixef nnes s min ixeddem, iƹni itegg ȓxir iticc-awem anẓar zeg ujenna ḏ ṯfeǧaḥṯ ḏi ȓweqṯ nnes. Iteccar-awem uȓawen nwem s ȓefraḥeṯ." <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />S wawaȓ-a Bulus ḏ Barnaba sbedden-ṯen, walakin ȓɣaci nni qesḥen s waṭṭas ƹȓayen qeddmen-asen dbiḥeṯ.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Menbaƹḏ usin-d can israʼiliyen zi Wanṭakya ḏ Ikunya tsamaren ȓɣaci nni, arejmen Bulus s uzru jarren-ṯ barra i ṯendint tɣiȓ-asen immuṯ. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Walakin wami xas munen imeḥḍaren, ikkar-d iddar wa ssenni yuḏef ɣar ṯendint. Ṯiwecca nnes iffeɣ ak Barnaba iruḥ ɣar ṯendint n Dirba.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Teƹqaben-d ɣar ṯendint n Wanṭakya ḏi Surya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Beccaren ḏi ṯendint nni <char style="it">n Dirba</char>, arrin aṭṭas n yiwḏan ḏ imeḥḍaren. Ssenni ḏewȓen ɣar ṯendint n Listra ḏ Ikunya ḏ Wanṭakya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Ggin uȓ ḏeg imeḥḍaren nni, cejjƹen-ṯen bac aḏ arnin ḏi lʼiman nsen. Qqaren-asen: U labud axaneɣ ṯekk aṭṭas n tamara bac neccin <char style="it">ȓmuminin</char> a naḏef ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Bulus ḏ Barnaba ixḍaren imeqqranen ḏi mkuȓ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ȓexddenni ẓẓuǧen, ẓummen, jjin-ṯen ḏeg ufus n Siḏi Arebbi iy zi umnen.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ssenni ƹḏun x jwayeh n Pisidya, uwḍen ɣar jwayeh n Pamfilya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Wami tbeccaren s wawaȓ n Arebbi ḏi ṯendint n Barja, ƹḏun ɣar ṯendint n Waṭalya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" /><char style="it">Wami kemmȓen ȓxeḏmeṯ nni ḏinni,</char> ƹeqben ssenni ḏeg uɣarrabu ɣar ṯendint n Wanṭakya manis d usin qbeȓ, zi manis twakellfen s ȓxeḏmeṯ nni s arḍa n Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Wami uwḍen ḏinni, smunen jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ƹawḏen-asen marra min igga Arebbi x ufus nsen ḏ mammec irzem-asen ṯawwarṯ n lʼiman i yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Seƹḏun aṭṭas n ȓweqṯ ḏinni ak imeḥḍaren.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Lƹalaqa iǧan jar imasiḥiyen ḏ Ccariƹa n Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Usin-d ca n iryazen zi Yahuḏiya seȓmaḏen ayṯmaṯneɣ <char style="it">ḏeg Wanṭakya</char> nnan-asen: "War ṯzemmarem ca aḏ tnejmem illa meȓa ṯeggim ṭṭahareṯ ƹlaḥsab Ccariƹa n Musa." <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2-3" />Iruḥ Bulus ḏ Barnaba temnaqaren ak <char style="it">yinni iy d yusin zi Yahuḏiya</char>, iwqeƹ jarasen ijjen n lxilaf ḏ ameqqran. Kkaren jmaƹeṯ nni n ȓmuminin <char style="it">ḏeg Wanṭakya</char> ixḍaren Bulus ḏ Barnaba bac aṯen ssekken ak ȓebƹaḍ n ȓmuminin nsen ɣar ṯendint n Lquds bac aḏ sseqsan arrusul ḏ imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin x lxilaf-a ig iweqƹen. Wami ssekken Bulus ḏ Barnaba ɣar Lquds x ubriḏ nsen ƹḏun x Finiqya ḏ Samarya. Xebbaren ayṯmaṯneɣ iǧan ḏinni x mammec ig umnen uȓa ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. Ȓexbar nni isfareḥ-iṯen aṭṭas marra. <verse eid="ACT 15:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Wami uwḍen ɣar Lquds, reḥḥben zzaysen jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḏ imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ-a ḏ arrusul. Ḏinni Bulus ḏ Barnaba ƹawḏen-asen i niṯni marra min igga Arebbi x ufus nsen.<verse eid="ACT 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Walakin kkaren can n ȓmuminin ȓḥizeb nsen zeg ifarrisiyen nnan: Itxeṣṣa wa labud aḏ ṭehharen yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil, aṯen ṯweṣṣam aḏ ṭaƹen i Ccariƹa n Musa.<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Munen arrusul ḏ imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḥima aḏ xzaren ḏi lxilaf-a. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Wami mnaqacen aṭṭas, ikkar Buṭrus ibedd inna-asen: "Ay ayṯma, aqa kenniw ṯessnem mecḥaȓ zeg wami iy ḏayi ixḍar Arebbi zzaywem bac yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏ sȓen zeg uqemmum inu awaȓ n Lʼinjil aḏ amnen. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Arebbi ḏ netta ig issnen uȓ n bnaḏem, iseḍhar-d netta belli iqbeȓ-iṯen iƹni yuca-asen Arruḥ iqeddsen mammec ḏaneɣ ṯ yuca i neccin. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />War iggi bu s wuḏemawen jaraneɣ, isireḏ-asen uȓawen nsen wami umnen. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Ȓexxu kenniw mayemmi ṯzaƹmem aḏ teẓrem Arebbi min ɣa igg, teggem dqeȓ n ṯzayȓut<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯzayȓut nettaṯ ḏ ṯzagȓut. Teggen-teṯ x yirawen n ifunasen ḏi zman cerrzen zzayes. Qqaren-as ƹaweḏ ṯaɣwawṯ. Zaƹma nettaṯ ḏ Ccariƹa n Musa, ṯeḏqeȓ x yiwḏan minzi ḏayes aṭṭas n ȓuṣiyaṯ.</char></note> x yiri n imeḥḍaren? Dqeȓ nni tuɣa war nzemmar aṯ neysi lla neccin uȓa ḏ ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Neccin min ntamen? Ntamen belli neccin a nenjem s arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa mammec ɣa nejmen uȓa ḏ yinni <char style="it">war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil</char>."<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Marra jmaƹeṯ nni ḏinni iy qqimen war nnin walu, tesȓan i Barnaba ḏ Bulus ssawaȓen x lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ lburhanaṯ igga Arebbi x ufus nsen jar yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil.<verse eid="ACT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Wami kemmȓen awaȓ nsen, indeq-d Yaƹqub inna-asen: "Ay ayṯma, ṣennṭem ɣari mliḥ! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Iƹaweḏ-aneɣ Simƹan x mammec ḏeg umezwaru ifqeḏ Arebbi yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil ixḍar ca zzaysen aḏ iȓin ḏ ccaƹb nnes. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Manaya yusa-d ak lʼanbiya min nnan ḏi zman, mammec iqqar Lkitab:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Menbaƹd i manaya nec aḏ d ḏewȓeɣ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">aqiḍun n Dawed iy iwḍan aṯ sbeddeɣ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">min zzayes inheḏmen aṯ sgaƹƹḏeɣ aṯ ƹeḏȓeɣ.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17-18" />Bac yinni iqqimen zeg yiwḏan aḏ rzun x Siḏi Arebbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17-18">bac marra yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17-18">yinni iy iysin isem inu axas rzun.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17-18">Ammu iqqar Siḏi Arebbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17-18">ṯimesȓayin-a iy ǧant zi zman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17-18">ȓexxu ismeḍhar-iṯent-id."<verse eid="ACT 15:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />
    <char style="it">Inna-asen Yaƹqub:</char> "X manaya nec twaȓiɣ war nseqsaḥ ca x yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil ig itamnen ȓexxu zi Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Walakin aḏasen nari <char style="it">ṯabrat-a</char> ḥima aḏ beƹƹḏen x lmakla itwaqeddmen i lʼaṣnam ḏ lfasad ḏ min itwajeyyfen ḏ iḏammen. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Liʼanna zi zman tḥeddaṯen i yiwḏan s Ccariƹa n Musa ḏi mkuȓ ṯendint, qqaren-t zi ssebṯ ɣar ssebṯ ḏi ṯemziḏawin n Ayṯ-Israʼil."<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯabrat i ȓmuminin iy war iǧin ca ḏ israʼiliyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />X manaya arrusul ḏ imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḏ marra jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ggin aḏ ixḍaren can n iryazen nsen, aṯen ssekken ak Bulus ḏ Barnaba ɣar ṯendint n Wanṭakya. Ixḍaren ijjen umi qqaren Silas ḏ yijjen qqaren-as Yahuḏa iƹni wenni umi qqaren Barsaba, ɣarsen ijjen n umcan ḏ ameqqran jar ȓmuminin. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Ssekken akiḏsen ṯabrat-a nnan-asen:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">"Ay ayṯmaṯneɣ war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil ig izeddɣen ḏi Wanṭakya ḏ Surya ḏ lʼiqlim n Kilikya, netseǧam xawem neccin iy iǧan ḏ arrusul ḏ imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Netsȓa belli can yiwḏan zzayneɣ usin-d ɣarwem bȓa lʼiḏen nneɣ, seddƹen-kenniw siḏfen ḏaywem ccekk s wawaȓ nsen. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Neccin marra ntafeq, nixḍar can n iryazen aṯen d nessekk ɣarwem ak imƹizzen nneɣ Barnaba ḏ Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Iryazen-a ɣamaren s ṯuḏarṯ nsen x yisem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />X manaya nessekk-awem-d uȓa ḏ Yahuḏa-ya ḏ Silas-a bac aḏawem inin s uqemmum nsen min ḏawem d nura ḏi ṯebrat-a. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Neccin ḏ Arruḥ iqeddsen netwaȓa mliḥ war xawem ntegg bu dqeȓ aṭṭas illa min iǧan wa labud. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Iƹni aḏ tbeƹƹḏem x lmakla itwaqeddmen i lʼaṣnam, ḏ iḏammen, ḏ min itwajeyyfen, ḏ lfasad. Meȓa ṯbeƹƹḏem x ṯmesȓayin-a wa ataf ṯeggim mliḥ.</para>
  <para style="pmc" vid="ACT 15:29">Akenniw iƹawen Arebbi."<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Yina itwassekken ɣar Wanṭakya ṣafi uwḍen ḏinni, smunen jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ucin-asen ṯabrat nni. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Wami t ɣrin jmaƹeṯ nni farḥen aṭṭas liʼanna ṯcejjeƹ-iṯen. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yahuḏa ḏ Silas niṯni ḏ l'anbiya, tcejjaƹen ȓmuminin s waṭṭas n wawaȓen, ggin ḏaysen uȓ. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Qqimen dinni ijjen n lmudda, menbaƹd ssekken-ṯen ȓmuminin nni ḏi ȓehna ɣar yinni iy ṯen d issekken. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />{Walakin Silas igga aḏ iqqim ḏinni.} <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Bulus ḏ Barnaba qqimen ḏi ṯendint n Wanṭakya, seȓmaḏen tbeccaren s wawaȓ n Siḏi Arebbi, niṯni ḏ waṭṭas n yiwḏan.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxilaf jar arrasul Bulus ḏ Barnaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ṯeƹḏu ijjen n ȓweqṯ, inna-as Bulus i Barnaba: Yallah, a neḏweȓ ɣar ayṯmaṯneɣ ḏi kuȓ ṯendint mani nbeccar s wawaȓ n Siḏi Arebbi a nẓer mammec ǧan. <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barnaba ixes akiḏsen yawi Yuḥanna wenni umi qqaren Marqus. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Walakin Bulus war ḏas iƹjib ca aṯ awin akiḏsen minzi Marqus tuɣa ismeḥ ḏaysen ḏi Pamfilya war kisen iqqim ca ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ nni. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />War tafqen qaƹ ḏi ṯmesȓayṯ-a, kuȓ ijjen manis ikka. Barnaba isafar ak Marqus ḏeg uɣarrabu ɣar Qubruṣ. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Bulus netta ixḍar Silas, ffɣen niṯni kellfen-ṯen ȓmuminin x ȓxeḏmeṯ nni nnan axawem yarḍa Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Iruḥ ɣar Surya ḏ lʼiqlim n Kilikya itegg uȓ ḏi ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Itmun Timutawus ak arrasul Bulus ḏ Silas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Yuweḍ Bulus ɣar ṯendint n Dirba ḏ ṯendint n Listra, yufa ḏinni ijjen n umeḥḍar qqaren-as Timutawus. Yemmas nettaṯ ḏ ṯaʼisraʼiliṯ ḏ ȓmumna, babas ḏ ayunani. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Ayṯmaṯneɣ iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Ikunya ḏ Listra ssiwȓen mliḥ x Timutawus. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Igga-as ṭṭahareṯ Bulus wami ixes aṯ yawi akiḏes. Igga-as amenni ƹlaḥsab israʼiliyen iǧan ḏeg imucan nni niṯni marra ssnen belli babas ḏ ayunani.<verse eid="ACT 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Xmi iggur <char style="it">Bulus ḏ imeddukaȓ nnes</char> zeg ubilaj ɣar ubilaj iqqar-asen ȓuṣiyaṯ nni ṯinni iy ggin arrusul ḏ imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi Lquds<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ȓuṣiyaṯ-a ḏ ṯabrat nni iy iǧan ḏeg wuḏem wis 15 ḏi lʼayaṯ 28 ḏ 29.</char></note> ḥima aṯent ḏfaren yiwḏan. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Amenni ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin tejhiḏent ḏi lʼiman, kuȓ nhar yarenni lƹadad nsent.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwaḥi nni iy d ihwan zi Arebbi i Bulus ḏi ṯendint n Traws</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Bulus ḏ imeddukaȓ nnes kkin x jwayeh n Frijya ḏ Galaṭya, war ṯen ijji ca Arruḥ iqeddsen aḏ beccaren s wawaȓ n Arebbi ḏi lʼiqlim n Asya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Wami uwḍen ɣar lḥudud n Misya, qeǧben aḏ aḏfen lʼiqlim n Biṯinya walakin war ṯen ijji ca Arruḥ n Ƹisa. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />S manaya semḥen ḏi Misya hwan ɣar ṯendint n Traws. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Ḏi ǧiȓeṯ nni ihwa-d ijjen n lwaḥi x Bulus iẓra ḏayes ijjen n uṯarras zi lʼiqlim n Masidunya ibedd itṭalab-iṯ iqqar-as zwa-d ɣarneɣ ɣar Masidunya ƹawen-aneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Wami ṣafi iẓra lwaḥi nni Bulus, nekkar neccin nsewjeḏ ḥima a nsafer ȓexddenni ɣar lʼiqlim n Masidunya. Nefhem belli Arebbi itȓaɣa-d xaneɣ aṯen nbeccar s Lʼinjil ḏinni.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus ḏ Silas tbeccaren ḏi ṯendint n Filippi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Ssenni nsafer ḏeg uɣarrabu zi ṯendint n Traws, nruḥ nican ɣar ṯendint n Samutrakya. Ṯiwecca nnes nruḥ ɣar ṯendint n Niyapulis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Ssenni nruḥ ɣar Filippi, nettaṯ ḏ ijjen n ṯendint ṯusa-d ḏi lwilaya ṯamezwarut n lʼiqlim n Masidunya, staƹmaren-teṯ irumaniyen. Neqqim ḏinni ḏi ṯendint nni ȓebƹaḍ n wussan.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Ḏi nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada neffeɣ zi ṯewwarṯ n ṯendint nruḥ ɣar ṭṭarf n yiɣzar, tɣiȓ-aneɣ a naf ḏinni ijjen n umcan n ṯẓaǧiṯ. Neqqim nessawaȓ ak ṯemɣarin nni iy nufa ḏinni imunen. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Akiḏsent ḏinni ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ ṯesȓa-yaneɣ qqaren-as Lidya. Nettaṯ zi ṯendint n Ṯiyatra ṯeznuza ṯcuqqet nni iy iɣȓan llun nnes ḏ llila,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lila nettaṯ ḏ banefsaji.</char></note> ṯƹebbeḏ Arebbi. Irzem-as Siḏi Arebbi uȓ nnes bac aḏ tṣenneṭ i wawaȓ n Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Wami ṯetwaṭehhar s waman nettaṯ ḏ ȓeḥbab nnes, ṯettar zzayneɣ ṯenna-aneɣ: "Araḥem-d ɣar ṯeddarṯ inu qqimem akiḏi iƹni meȓa ṯteyyqem belli nec umneɣ zi Siḏi Arebbi." Ṯḥeccem-aneɣ nettaṯ aȓ wami neqbeȓ.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus ḏ Silas twaḥebbsen ḏi ṯendint n Filippi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />
    <char style="it">Ijjen n nhar</char> wami nruḥ ɣaȓ umcan nni mani tẓaǧan yiwḏan, ṯmeȓqa akiḏneɣ ijjen n ṯismeɣṯ nettaṯ ḏ ṯakehhant tawi-d s ssiḥer nnes aṭṭas n tmenyaṯ i ayṯbab nnes. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Tbaƹ-aneɣ-d neccin ḏ Bulus tƹeyyaḍ ṯeqqar qa iryazen-a ƹebbḏen Arebbi Yuƹȓan, tbeccaren-kenniw s ubriḏ iy zi ɣa ṯnejmem! <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Ṯegga manayenni aṭṭas n nhuraṯ, Bulus war ḏas iƹjib bu ȓḥaȓ. Ineqȓeb-d ɣares inna-as i jjenn nni iy ḏayes: "Nec tamareɣ-cek ƹlaḥsab isem n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ azzayes ṯeffɣeḏ." Ȓexddenni iffeɣ jjenn nni zzayes ḏeg umcan.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Ayṯbab n ṯismeɣṯ nni wami ufin ṯawwarṯ n lmanda nsen ṣafi ṯbelleƹ xasen, kkaren ṭṭfen Bulus ḏ Silas jarren-ṯen ɣar ssaḥa ɣar lḥukkam. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Qeddmen-ṯen ɣar lḥukkam nnan-asen: "Iryazen-a ḏ israʼiliyen teggen-aneɣ ȓfawḍa ḏi ṯendint. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Seȓmaḏen lƹadaṯ war nzemmar ca aṯent neqbeȓ niɣ azzaysent nexḏem minzi neccin ḏ irumaniyen." <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Ȓexddenni munen ȓɣaci hejmen x Bulus ḏ Silas, lḥukkam nni cerrgen-asen arruḍ umaren xasen bac aḏasen ucen aƹmuḏ. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Uwṯin-ṯen aṭṭas s uƹmuḏ nḍaren-ṯen ḏi ȓeḥbes. Nnan-as i lḥaris n ȓeḥbes ƹess xasen mliḥ. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Wami isȓa netta awaȓ-a, iruḥ iggi-ṯen ɣar ḏaxeȓ qaƹ n ȓeḥbes iqqen-iṯen zeg iḍaren nsen ɣar ikeccuḍen iḏeqȓen.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Ɣar ȓwesṭ n ǧiȓeṯ Bulus ḏ Silas tẓaǧan tɣennajen izȓan i Arebbi, tesȓan-asen imeḥbas. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Ƹlaɣafla iwqeƹ ijjen n zzinzal ḏ ameqqran aȓ wami nhezzen uȓa ḏ dsasaṯ n ȓeḥbes. Nurzment ṯewwura nnes marra, ƹaweḏ nufsȓent-asen snaseȓ i imeḥbas marra. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Wami d ifaq lḥaris n ȓeḥbes zeg yiḍeṣ yufa ṯiwwura n ȓeḥbes nurzment tɣiȓ-as imeḥbas nni arewȓen, ijbeḏ-d ssif ḥima aḏ ineɣ ixef nnes. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Iȓaɣa-yas-d Bulus s jjheḏ inna-as: "Lla! Ɣarek aḏ tḍarreḏ ixef nnec, qa neccin ƹaḏ aqaneɣ ḏa marra iḏneɣ!"<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Inna lḥaris n ȓeḥbes ceƹƹȓem ȓefnaraṯ. Iruḥ itazzeȓ ɣar Bulus ḏ Silas isejjeḏ-asen ɣar iḍaren nsen ibḏa iterjiji. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Isufeɣ-iṯen-d inna-asen: "A siyaḏi, min ɣa ggeɣ bac aḏ nejmeɣ?" <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Nnan-as: "Amen zi Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa aḏ tnejmeḏ cek ḏ ȓeḥbab nnec." <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Bḏan tbeccaren-ṯ netta ḏ marra ȓeḥbab nnes s wawaȓ n Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Ḏi ṯsaƹƹat nni s ǧiȓeṯ, yuwi-ṯen lḥaris n ȓeḥbes imseḥ-asen ijarriḥen. Ȓexddenni itwaṭehhar s waman netta ḏ marra ȓeḥbab nnes. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Yuwi-ṯen ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnes yuca-asen aḏ ccen. Ifareḥ netta ḏ marra ȓeḥbab nnes minzi umnen zi Arebbi.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Wami d iṣbeḥ ȓḥaȓ, lḥukkam ssekken imxazniyen ɣar lḥaris n ȓeḥbes nnan-as: Ḍȓeq-asen i iryazen-a! <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Lḥaris ixebbar Bulus inna-as qa umaren-kenniw lḥukkam aḏ twaḍeȓqem. Ṣafi ffɣeṯ, ruḥeṯ ḏi ȓehna!<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Inna-asen Bulus i imxazniyen nni: "Uwṯin-aneɣ zzaṯ i yiwḏan bȓa ȓqanun nḍaren-aneɣ ḏi ȓeḥbes, walakin neccin ɣarneɣ ljinsiya n Ruma. Ȓexxu niṯni, ma rezzun aḏaneɣ sufɣen war d itarri ḥadd ȓexbar?" <char style="it">Inna-asen:</char> "Lla, itxeṣṣa aḏ d asen lḥukkam nni s yixef nsen aḏaneɣ sufɣen!"<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Imxazniyen nni ruḥen ƹawḏen-asen awaȓ-a i lḥukkam, lḥukkam nni nxeȓƹen wami ssnen belli Bulus ḏ Silas ḏ irumaniyen. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Usin-d ɣarsen tettaren zzaysen aḏasen samḥen, sufɣen-ṯen zi ȓeḥbes ttaren zzaysen aḏ ffɣen zi ṯendint. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Wami ffɣen zi ȓeḥbes ruḥen ɣar ṯeddarṯ n Lidya. Ẓrin ḏinni ayṯmaṯsen cejjƹen-ṯen, ssenni uyuren.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Twaƹeddaben Bulus ḏ Silas ḏi ṯendint n Salunik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Ƹḏun x ṯendint n Umfipulis ḏ ṯendint n Upulunya, uwḍen ɣar ṯendint n Salunik mani ṯeǧa ḏinni ijjen n ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Yuḏef Bulus ɣar ṯemziḏa nni mammec itegg ȓebda. Ṯȓaṯa n simanaṯ kuȓ nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada itemnaqac akiḏsen iqqar-asen min yurin ḏi Lkutub. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Isefham-iṯen isbeyyan-asen ddalil x mammec u labud Lmasiḥ aḏ itwaƹeddeb aḏ d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ. Inna-asen qa Ƹisa-ya iy zi kenniw tbeccareɣ netta s yixef nnes ḏ Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Qtanƹen ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen munen ak Bulus ḏ Silas. Akiḏsen xarebbi n iyunaniyen iy iteggwḏen Arebbi. Akiḏsen ƹaweḏ aṭṭas n ṯemɣarin zi ṯinni iy ɣar ṯeǧa lmartaba.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Walakin israʼiliyen nneɣni ḥesḏen-ṯen, ruḥen smunen-d zi ssuq ijjen n lmejmuƹ n ikruccaren iƹeffanen bac aḏ ggen ssdaƹ, snekkaren ȓfawḍa ḏi ṯendint. Hejmen x ṯeddarṯ n yijjen qqaren-as Yasin rezzun x Bulus ḏ Silas ḥima aṯen sellmen i ȓɣaci. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Wami war ṯen ufin ca, jarren Yasin ḏ ȓebƹaḍ n ayṯmaṯneɣ ɣar lḥukkam n ṯendint. Snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ qqaren: "Iryazen nni iy ggin lfitna ḏi marra ddunect, ȓexxu aqaṯen ḏa <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />ḏ inewjiwen ɣar Yasin <char style="it">wanita</char>. Marra yina ƹeṣṣan ȓqanun n Lmalik Qayṣar qqaren qa ḏinni ijjen n uzeǧiḏ nneɣni qqaren-as Ƹisa." <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Wami ccaƹb ḏ lḥukkam n ṯendint sȓin i manaya, ikkar ijjen n ssdaƹ ḏ ameqqran. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Ssenni ṭṭfen lkafala zi Yasin ḏ inneɣni, ḍeȓqen-asen.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus ḏ Silas ḏi ṯendint n Birya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Ssenni s ǧiȓeṯ nni ayṯmaṯneɣ ssekken Bulus ḏ Silas ɣar ṯendint umi qqaren Birya. Wami uwḍen, uḏfen ɣar ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Ayṯ-Birya niṯni ḥsen zeg Ayṯ-Salunik, qebbȓen awaȓ n Arebbi ḏeɣya s ȓefraḥeṯ. Qqaren ḏi Lkutub kuȓ nhar bac aḏ ssnen awaȓ nni iy qqaren Bulus ḏ Silas ma ḏ ṣṣaḥ niɣ lla. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Umnen aṭṭas zzaysen. Umnent xarebbi n ṯemɣarin ṯiyunaniyin ɣarsent lmartaba, umnen ƹaweḏ aṭṭas n iyunaniyen.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Israʼiliyen nni ḏi ṯendint n Salunik arrin-d ȓexbar Bulus itbeccar s wawaȓ n Arebbi ḏi ṯendint n Birya. Usin-d ɣar Birya bḏan teggen ixarwiḍen shajen xas ȓɣaci. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Ȓexddenni ayṯmaṯneɣ ssekken Bulus ɣar ȓebḥar, iqqim Silas ḏ Timutawus ḏi ṯendint n Birya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Iryazen nni iy ruḥen ak Bulus ssiwḍen-ṯ ɣar ṯendint n Utina ssenni ḏewȓen-d. Iweṣṣa-ṯen Bulus inna-asen: Inim-asen i Silas ḏ Timutawus araḥem-d ɣari ḏeɣya.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itbeccar ḏi ṯendint n Utina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Bulus wami tuɣa itraja Silas ḏ Timutawus ḏi ṯendint nni n Utina itwaȓa ṯandint nni ṯƹemmar s lʼaṣnamaṯ war ḏas iƹjib bu ȓḥaȓ. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Itemnaqac ḏi ṯemziḏa ak israʼiliyen ḏ inneɣni iteggwḏen Arebbi, itemnaqac ƹaweḏ ak yinni iy keḏ itemseȓqa kuȓ nhar ḏi ssaḥa n ṯendint. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Can n lfalasifa umi qqaren ibikuriyen ḏ can lfalasifa nneɣni umi qqaren iriwaqiyen bḏan temnaqacen ak Bulus nnan ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen, min ixes aḏ yini wanita itpeȓpiȓen waha? Nnan yiwḏan nneɣni imken itbeccar s arebbiṯen n dduwal. Nnan manaya minzi Bulus itbeccar s Ƹisa ḏ lqiyama. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Uwin Bulus nedhen-ṯ ɣar lmajlis nsen umi qqaren Aryubagus nnan-as: "Nrezzu a nessen ttaƹlim-a n jḏiḏ iy zi ṯseȓmaḏeḏ cek. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Ṯimesȓayin-a netƹejjeb ḏaysent, ƹemmarṣ war nesȓi x min ṯeqqareḏ cek. Nexs a nessen ȓmaƹna nsent." <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Iwa marra imezḏaɣ n Utina niɣ ḏ ȓbarrani iy ḏayes izeḏɣen sƹeddun marra ȓweqṯ nsen ḏeg wawaȓ niɣ ḏeg uṣenneṭ n can ȓḥajeṯ ḏ jḏiḏ.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Ȓexddenni ibedd Bulus ḏi ȓwesṭ n lmajlis inna-asen: "Ay iryazen n Utina, nec twaȓiɣ kenniw ṯceɣȓem aṭṭas ḏi ddin. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Axmi tsariɣ nec, xezzareɣ mliḥ ḏi zzawyaṯ nwem mani ṯƹebbḏem. Ẓriɣ ḏinni ijjen n ȓmeḏbaḥ urint ḏayes ṯira, ṯira nni qqarent: <char style="bd">Arebbi nni iy war itwassnen ca</char>. Cuf, Arebbi nni iy ṯƹebbḏem kenniw war ṯ ṯessinem ca, aḏawem iniɣ nec min iƹna. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Ixȓeq-d ddunect-a ḏ marra min ḏayes, netta ḏ Siḏi Arebbi n ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ. War izeddeɣ ca ḏi zzawyaṯ nni ig bennan yiwḏan s ifassen nsen. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />War xas tsexxiren ca ifassen n bnaḏem, netta war iteḥḏiji walu. Ḏ netta iy d iticcen i marra iwḏan ṯuḏarṯ ḏ buḥbeȓ ḏ marra ṯimesȓayin nneɣni. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Zeg yijjen n bnaḏem iy zi d ixȓeq marra ȓegnus bac aḏ zeḏɣen ḏi ddunect-a amen-ṯekmaȓ. Iḥedd-asen nhuraṯ n ttarix nsen ḏ mani iy ɣa zeḏɣen. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Igga-asen ammu Arebbi ḥima iwḏan axas rzun aɣares swizzḏen s ifassen nsen aṯ afen. Innama, netta kuȓ ijjen zzayneɣ war xas iggwij ca. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Zzayes netta iy neddar, zzayes netta iy ntenhezza, zzayes netta iy neǧa. Mammec nnan uȓa ḏ ȓebƹaḍ n ccuƹaraʼ nwem qa neccin ḏ ṯarwa nnes.<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Cuf, neccin meȓa ḏ ṯarwa n Arebbi, itxeṣṣa-yaneɣ war netfekkir ca belli wenni yuƹȓan qa netta am ddheb niɣ am nnuqarṯ niɣ am uzru. Arebbi war iǧi ca ḏ lʼaṣnam ig itṣennaƹ bnaḏem s lfikra nnes ḏ ṯzemmar nnes. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Manaya Arebbi war t yuwi ca ḏi zman n ȓeqfaȓeṯ, walakin ȓexxu yumar marra iwḏan ḏi mkuȓ amcan bac aḏ tuben. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Mayemmi? Arebbi izemmem ijjen n nhar iy ḏi ɣa iḥaseb marra iwḏan s ȓḥaqq x ufus n bnaḏem nni ig ixḍar. Yuca-asen ddalil i marra iwḏan x manaya wami ṯiḏ isekkar zi ȓmewṯ."<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Yina wami tesȓan x yiwḏan aḏ d kkaren zi ȓmewṯ ḏi Lqiyama ḍeḥcen ȓebƹaḍ xasen, walakin ȓebƹaḍ nneɣni nnan-as qa neccin nexs aḏac nṣenneṭ ṯwaȓa nneɣni x manaya. <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ssenni iffeɣ Bulus zi ȓwesṭ nsen. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen umnen munen ak Bulus. Zzaysen Diyunisyus zi lmajlis n Aryubagus ḏ yijjen n ṯemɣarṯ qqaren-as Damaris ḏ inneɣni akiḏsen.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus ḏi ṯendint n Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Menbaƹd iffeɣ Bulus zi ṯendint n Utina iruḥ ɣar ṯendint n Kurinṯ. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2-3" />Yufa ḏinni ijjen n uʼisraʼili netta ḏ mmis n lʼiqlim n Punṭus qqaren-as Akilas. Netta tuɣa yusa-d ḏeg wussan nni zi ṯmurṯ n Iṭalya netta ḏ ṯemɣarṯ nnes umi qqaren Priskila. Liʼanna Lmalik Kludyus tuɣa yumar x marra Ayṯ-Israʼil aṯen sufɣen zi Ruma. Iruḥ Bulus ɣar Wakilas ḏ Priskila aṯen iẓer. Iqqim akiḏsen, ixeddem akiḏsen minzi niṯni ȓxeḏmeṯ nsen ḏ icten teggen iqiḍan. <verse eid="ACT 18:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Mkuȓ nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada Bulus itemnaqac ak Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ iyunaniyen ḏi ṯemziḏa bac aṯen iseqneƹ. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Wami d ixḍeȓ Silas ḏ Timutawus zi lʼiqlim n Masidunya, ibḏa Bulus ixeddem ɣir s ttebcir u ṣafi, icehheḏ i Ayṯ-Israʼil belli Ƹisa netta ḏ Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Wami bḏan tƹarraḍen-as tbuṣaren xas, imseḥ arruḍ nnes <char style="it">am yijjen n chaḏeṯ</char> xasen inna-asen: "Iḏammen nwem x yirawen nwem, qa nec tberriɣ azeǧif inu zzaywem. Ssa aȓ ṯsawent aḏ raḥeɣ ɣar yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil."<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Iffeɣ-d ssenni iruḥ ɣar ṯeddarṯ n yijjen n uryaz iƹebbḏen Arebbi qqaren-as Titus Yustus, ṯaddarṯ nnes aqat ṭṭarf i ṯemziḏa nni. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Ȓefqih n ṯemziḏa nni qqaren-as Krispus, yumen s Siḏiṯneɣ netta ḏ marra ȓeḥbab nnes. Xarebbi n yiwḏan zi ṯendint n Kurinṯ wami sȓin <char style="it">i wawaȓ n Bulus</char>, umnen twaṭehharen s waman.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Ijjen n ǧiȓeṯ yuḥa-yas-d Siḏi Arebbi i Bulus inna-as: "War teggweḏ ca, siweȓ war stuka ca. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Nec aqayi akiḏec, cek war c itḍarri ḥadd zeg yinni xak d ɣa ihejmen minzi nec ɣari aṭṭas n ccaƹb inu ḏi ṯendint-a." <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Iqqim ḏinni Bulus ƹam u sett-chur iseȓmaḏ netta awaȓ n Arebbi i yiwḏan.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Walakin ḏi ȓweqṯ nni n Galyun lƹamil n lʼiqlim n Uxaya, munen israʼiliyen hejmen x Bulus uwin-ṯ ɣar lmaḥkama. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Nnan aryaz-a isqenneƹ iwḏan aḏ ƹebḏen Arebbi ḍed i ȓqanun. <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Wami ƹȓayen aḏ issiweȓ Bulus ikkar lƹamil Galyun inna-asen i israʼiliyen nni: "Maƹlik ṯceṯcam x can n ccarr niɣ x can n ljarima ḏ ṯaƹeffant, ataf ɣarwem ȓḥaqq aɣarwem ṣennṭeɣ. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Walakin manaya ḏ lxilaf jarawem kenniw ḏeg wawaȓen ḏ yisemawen ḏ ccariƹa nwem. Ḥellem manaya nniṯ jarawem. Bȓa ma aḏ iȓiɣ nec ḏ ȓqaḍi x ṯmesȓayin-a jarawem." <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ssenni yuzzeȓ-d xasen zi lmaḥkama. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Kkaren marra iḏsen ṭṭfen Sastin ȓefqi n ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil uwṯin-ṯ zzaṯ i lmaḥkama. Galyun netta war ṯ icqi ca manayenni qaƹ.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iteƹqab Arrasul Bulus ɣar Wanṭakya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Iqqim ƹaḏ Bulus aṭṭas n wussan ḏi ṯendint n Kurinṯ. Ssenni imsafaḍ x ayṯmas ḏinni, inya ḏeg uɣarrabu iruḥ ɣar Surya akiḏes Priskila ḏ Wakilas. Tuɣa iḥeff Bulus acewwaf nnes ḏi <char style="it">ȓemwiyi umi qqaren</char> Kanɣarya minzi tuɣa xas ȓƹaheḏ <char style="it">iy igga ak Siḏi Arebbi</char>. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Uwḍen ɣar ṯendint n Ufasus, ijja Bulus ḏinni <char style="it">Priskila ḏ Wakilas, </char> ssenni yuḏef ɣar ṯemziḏa bac aḏ imnaqac ak israʼiliyen. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Ttaren zzayes israʼiliyen-a aḏ iqqim ƹaḏ ktar walakin netta yugi. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Wami xasen imsafaḍ inna-asen qa meȓa ixes Arebbi, ƹaḏ aḏ d ƹeqbeɣ. Ssenni inya ḏeg uɣarrabu iffeɣ zi ṯendint nni n Ufasus. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Wami yuweḍ ɣar ṯendint n Qayṣariya, igaƹƹeḏ <char style="it">ɣar Lquds</char> iseǧem x jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin, ssenni yuyur ɣar ṯendint n Wanṭakya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Wami iy ḏayes ikka can ȓweqṯ, iffeɣ iƹḏu ḏi jwayeh n Galaṭya ḏ jwayeh n Frijya itegg uȓ ḏeg imeḥḍaren nni iy iǧan ḏinni marra.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apulus itbeccar ḏi ṯendint n Ufasus ḏ lʼiqlim n Uxaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Ijjen n uʼisraʼili qqaren-as Apulus netta ixȓeq ḏi ṯendint n Iskandariya, yusa-d ɣar ṯendint n Ufasus. Netta ifsus ḏeg wawaȓ iɣra aṭṭas ḏi Lkutub. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Aryaz-a iȓmeḏ x ubriḏ n Siḏiṯneɣ, issawaȓ s jjheḏ ḏ ameqqran, iseȓmaḏ nican x Ƹisa. Walakin issen ɣir x uṭehhar nni n waman ig isexḏem nnabi Yaḥya. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Ibḏa issawaȓ ḏi ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil s zƹameṯ. Sȓin-as Priskila ḏ Wakilas, uwin-ṯ akiḏsen ɣar ṯeddarṯ nsen bḏan sfehhamen-ṯ ḥsen x ubriḏ n Arebbi.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Wami ixes Apulus aḏ isafer ɣar lʼiqlim n Uxaya, cejjƹen-ṯ ayṯmas urin-asen ijjen n ṯebrat i imeḥḍaren nni n ḏinni bac azzayes reḥben. Wami yuweḍ <char style="it">ɣar lʼiqlim nni</char> iƹawen aṭṭas yinni yumnen s arḍa n Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Liʼanna netta itemnaqac s jjheḏ ak israʼiliyen zzaṯ i yiwḏan, niṯni war zemmaren ca aṯ jawben nican minzi isbeyyen-asen-d awaȓen zi Lkutub belli netta Ƹisa ḏ Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itḥeddaṯ ḏi ṯendint n Ufasus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apulus wami iǧa ḏi ṯendint n Kurinṯ <char style="it">ḏi lʼiqlim n Uxaya</char>, ikkar <char style="it">arrasul</char> Bulus ikka x ubriḏ n iḏurar yuweḍ ɣar ṯendint n Ufasus. Yufa ḏinni can imeḥḍaren <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />inna-asen: "Ma ihwa-d xawem Arruḥ iqeddsen wami ṯumnem?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Nnan-as: "Lla, neccin ƹemmarṣ war xas nesȓi ca x Arruḥ iqeddsen."<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Inna-asen: "Mammec ṯeggim wami ṯetwaṭehharem s waman?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Nnan-as: "Neccin netwaṭehhar s waman ƹlaḥsab mammec ixeddem nnabi Yaḥya."<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Inna-asen Bulus: "Qa Yaḥya itṭehhar s waman i yinni ituben, iqqar-asen amneṯ zeg wenni iy d ɣa yasen menbaƹd i nec, iƹni Ƹisa." <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Sȓin i manaya ruḥen twaṭehharen s waman ƹlaḥsab isem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Wami xasen isers Bulus ifassen nnes, ihwa-d xasen Arruḥ iqeddsen. Bḏan ssawaȓen s lluɣaṯ <char style="it">war iǧin bu nsen</char>, ssawaȓen s minzi ƹeȓmen zi Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Iryazen nni niṯni can ṯenƹac iḏsen.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Ssenni Bulus yuḏef ɣar ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil, issawaȓ ḏinni s zƹameṯ can n ṯeȓt-chur. Itemnaqac akiḏsen bac aṯen iseqneƹ x ȓmulk n Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen ṭṭfen akiḏes ṯaɣennant ugin aḏ amnen, tukkaren ḏi ttaƹlim n Siḏiṯneɣ zzaṯ i yiwḏan. Ssenni iffeɣ-d Bulus zi ṯemziḏa nni yuwi akiḏes imeḥḍaren nnes, kuȓ nhar iseȓmaḏ-iṯen ḏi lmarkez n Tirannus. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Iqqim Bulus itegg manayenni ƹamayen. Marra imezḏaɣ n lʼiqlim n Asya sȓin i wawaȓ n Siḏi Arebbi, Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ iyunaniyen s ṯnayen iḏsen.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯarwa n ȓefqi qqaren-as Skiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Arebbi itegg lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ ṯimeqqranin x ufus n Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Iwḏan kessin ȓezyuf ḏ ṯibantiwin tḥaḏan zzaysent Bulus srusan-ṯent x imehȓac. Ȓexddenni ȓehȓacaṯ nni tgenfan, ƹaweḏ teffɣen zzaysen jnun nni iƹeffanen iy ḏaysen.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Ḏinni can israʼiliyen niṯni ḏ iseḥḥaren traḥen zeg umcan ɣar umcan. Tjarraben aḏ sxeḏmen isem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa bac aḏ sufɣen jnun iƹeffanen zeg yiwḏan. Nnan-asen qa tʼamareɣ-kenniw ƹlaḥsab isem n Ƹisa iy zi itḥeddaṯ Bulus, ffɣeṯ! <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Amenni iy teggen ijjen n sebƹa n ṯarwa n yijjen n uʼisraʼili qqaren-as Skiba, netta zi arruyas n ȓfuqaha.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ijjen n nhar indeq-d jjenn nni aƹeffan inna-asen qa nec ssneɣ Ƹisa min iƹna, ssneɣ Bulus min iƹna, kenniw min ṯeƹnam? <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Ȓexddenni inḍew xasen uryaz nni iy ḏi iǧa jjenn aƹeffan iɣeȓb-iṯen marra ijheḏ xasen. Arewȓen zi ṯeddarṯ nni ḏ iƹaryanen jarrḥen. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Arrin-asen-d ȓexbar marra imezḏaɣ n Ufasus, iƹni Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ iyunaniyen s ṯnayen iḏsen. Ṯeȓqef-iṯen ṯiggwḏi uca itwasemɣar isem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa aṭṭas.<verse eid="ACT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Usin-d aṭṭas zeg yinni iy yumnen ȓexxu, ȓexḏayem nsen iy tuɣa ggin ṯiƹeffanin ƹtarfen zzaysent. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Aṭṭas n yiwḏan tuɣa ggin ssḥur uwin-d lkutub nsen sḥarrqen-ṯen ɣar barra zzaṯ i kuȓci. Wami ḥesben ttaman n lkutub nni, ufin xemsin aȓaf n dinar. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Amenni awaȓ n Siḏi Arebbi itentacer yarenni ɣares jjheḏ aṭṭas.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tewqiƹ ijjen n ȓfawḍa ḏi ṯendint n Ufasus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Menbaƹd i manaya, iƹewweȓ Bulus aḏ isafer ɣar Lquds, aḏ ikk x lʼiqlim n Masidunya ḏ lʼiqlim n Uxaya. Inna: Xmi ɣa awḍeɣ ḏinni, itxeṣṣa-ayi ƹaweḏ aḏ raḥeɣ ɣar ṯendint n Ruma! <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Issekk ɣar Masidunya ṯnayen zeg yinni iy ṯ itƹawanen ijjen qqaren-as Timutawus ijjen qqaren-as Arisṭus, netta Bulus iqqim ijjen n ȓweqṯ ḏi lʼiqlim n Asya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni ṯewqeƹ ijjen n ȓfawḍa ṯemɣar x ssabab n ubriḏ <char style="it">n Siḏiṯneɣ</char>. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Ḏinni ijjen n uryaz qqaren-as Dimitriyus. Netta iḍebbaƹ nnuqarṯ, itṣennaƹ munikuṯ s nnuqarṯ itemcabbahen ḏi zzawyiṯ n lʼaṣnam umi qqaren Ṯarṭamist. Dimitriyus-a isrebbaḥ aṭṭas yina itṣennaƹen munikuṯ-a. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Iȓaɣa-d x yinni ixeddmen ḏi manayenni ḏ yinni itṣennaƹen ṯimesȓayin nneɣni amenni. Inna-asen: "Ay iryazen, ṯessnem belli nrebbeḥ aṭṭas n tmenyaṯ ḏi ṣṣenƹaṯ-a. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Aqa twaȓam tesȓam Bulus-a isqenneƹ aṭṭas n yiwḏan ḏi ṯendint-a n Ufasus ƹȓayen uȓa ḏi marra lʼiqlim n Asya, isufuɣ-iṯen zeg ubriḏ nneɣ. Iqqar-aneɣ qa l'aṣnam-a itwaṣenƹen s ifassen qa war ǧin ca ḏ arebbiṯen. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Xaṭar manaya x ṣṣenƹaṯ nneɣ ataf war ɣares bu lqima. Xaṭar ƹaweḏ uȓa x zzawyiṯ ṯameqqrant n arebbi nneɣ Ṯarṭamist ataf aḏ tneqḍeƹ. Ataf nettaṯ ƹaweḏ imken war ḏayes tɣimi lƹaḍama nnes qaƹ, ṯanita iy ƹebbḏen imezḏaɣ n lʼiqlim-a n Asya marra ḏ ddunect amen-ṯekmaȓ."<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Wami sȓin i wawaȓ-a, ɣeḍben aṭṭas snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ qqaren Ṯarṭamist n Ayṯ-Ufasus mecḥaȓ ṯemɣar! <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Ṯewqeƹ ijjen n ȓfawḍa ḏ ṯameqqrant ḏi ṯendint nni amen-ṯekmaȓ. Munen yiwḏan-a uzzȓen ɣar furbu jarren akiḏsen ṯnayen n imeddukaȓ n Bulus iy kiḏes itsafaren, ijjen qqaren-as Ɣayus ijjen qqaren-as Aristarxus, niṯni zi Ayṯ-Masidunya. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Irezzu Bulus aḏ iḥḍar zzaṯ i ȓɣaci nni, war ṯ jjin ca imeḥḍaren nnes. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Ḥetta can n imxazniyen ḏ imeqqranen zi lʼiqlim nni n Asya iy ǧan ḏ imeddukaȓ n Bulus ssekken ɣares ttaren zzayes nnan-as war traḥ ca ɣar furbu nni.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Mxarwaḍen marra iwḏan iy ḏinni imunen, snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ kuȓ ijjen min iqqar. Azyen ameqqran war issin mixef ḏin munen. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Ḏinni jar ȓɣaci nni ijjen n bnaḏem qqaren-as Iskander. Ƹanen-ṯ israʼiliyen ɣar zzaṯ, ȓaɣan-as-d ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen ḥima aḏ issiweȓ. Itceyyar-asen i ȓɣaci nni s ifassen irezzu aṯen isbedd bac aḏ iḏafeƹ s yijjen n wawaȓ. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Wami ẓrin ȓɣaci nni netta ḏ aʼisraʼili, munen marra iḏsen can ṯnayen n ṯsaƹƹaṯin snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ nnan Ṯarṭamist n Ayṯ-Ufasus mecḥaȓ ṯemɣar!<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Yusa-d naʼib n lḥakem n ṯendint ihedden ȓɣaci nni inna-asen: "Ay iryazen n Ufasus, ma ḏinni ca ḥadd iy war issinen ca belli ṯandint-a n Ufasus ḏ nettaṯ iy iḥeṭṭan zzawyiṯ n Ṯarṭamist ṯameqqrant ḏ uzru nnes amqeddes iy d iwḍan zeg ujenna? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Manaya war ḏayes bu ccekk. Iḏen itxeṣṣa kenniw aḏ theddnem, war xeddmeṯ ca bȓa ȓaƹqeȓ. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ṯuwim-d ḏanita iryazen-a, war xewwnen ca zzawyaṯ war nnin bu ȓƹib ḏi arebbi nneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Meȓa ixes Dimitriyus ḏ yinni iy kiḏes itṣennaƹen <char style="it">nnuqarṯ</char> aḏ ceṯcan x can yijjen, aqa lmaḥkama mujud u lƹamil mujud aḏ raḥen aḏ ceṯcan s ȓqanun. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Meȓa ɣarwem ca uceṯci nneɣni, axas ḥekmen ḏi lmajlis n ṯendint. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Ȓexxu aqaneɣ ḏi lxaṭar a netwaḥkem marra iḏneɣ x ȓfawḍa itewqiƹen nhara, neccin war ɣarneɣ bu can n ssabab x ssdaƹ-a." <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Wami inna awaȓ-a issekk yinni imunen aḏ rewwḥen.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus aqaṯ ḏi Lyunan ḏ lʼiqlim n Masidunya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ṯkemmeȓ ȓfawḍa nni, menbaƹd Bulus iȓaɣa-d x imeḥḍaren icejjeƹ-iṯen. Ssenni imsafaḍ xasen, iruḥ isafer ɣar lʼiqlim n Masidunya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Itcejjaƹ imeḥḍaren ḏinni s waṭṭas n wawaȓen. Wami iƹḏu ḏi jwayeh nni, yuweḍ ɣar Lyunan <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />ikka ḏinni ṯeȓt-chur. Wami ƹȓayen aḏ iney Bulus ḏeg uɣarrabu aḏ iraḥ ɣar Surya, ciṭṭnen israʼiliyen bac aṯ nɣen. X manaya netta igga aḏ iƹqeb x ubriḏ n Masidunya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Isafer akiḏes Supatrus mmis n Piru zi ṯendint n Birya, ḏ Aristarxus ḏ Sakundus niṯni zi ṯendint n Salunik, ḏ Ɣayus zi ṯendint n Dirba, ḏ Timutawus ḏ Tuciq ḏ Trifumu niṯni zi lʼiqlim n Asya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Yina izwaren-aneɣ trajan-aneɣ ḏi ṯendint n Traws. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Wami iƹḏu Ȓƹiḏ n Ṯefḍirṯ, nenya ḏeg uɣarrabu neffeɣ zi ṯendint n Filippi. Menbaƹd i xemsiyyam neḏfar-iṯen ɣar ṯendint n Traws, neqqim ḏinni sebƹiyyam.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus isekkar-d ijjen n uḥenjir zi ȓmewṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Ḏeg wass amezwaru n simana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ƹlaḥsab taqalid n israʼiliyen, manaya iwqeƹ nhar n ssebṯ s ǧiȓeṯ. Ƹlaḥsab taqalid n iyunaniyen, iwqeƹ nhar n ȓḥad s ǧiȓeṯ.</char></note> nmun neccin a necc aɣrum, issiweȓ Bulus ak yiwḏan. Iqqim issawaȓ aȓ uzyen n ǧiȓeṯ minzi ṯiwecca nnes inwa aḏ isafer. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Ḏinni aṭṭas n ȓeqnaḏeȓ ḏi ṯɣurfat nni mani nmun. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Ḏinni ijjen n uḥenjir qqaren-as Yutikus iqqim netta x ṯenharṯ n ṯburjat.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯanharṯ n ṯburjat qqaren-as ƹaweḏ baḏu n ȓkazi niɣ ageddim n sarjem.</char></note> Iȓha Bulus itemharwaḍ, aḥenjir nni iṭṭef-iṯ yiḍeṣ iɣelleb xas yiḍeṣ nni uca iwḍa zi ṯȓaṯa n ṭṭbaqaṯ aȓ ṯmurṯ ufin-ṯ immuṯ. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Ihwa-d Bulus yuḍaȓ ɣares iysi-iṯ-iḏ s ifassen. Inna-asen: War teggwḏem ca, aqa iƹqeb-as-d buḥbeȓ nnes. <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Iruḥ Bulus igaƹƹeḏ sennej, irza aɣrum icca. Issiweȓ aṭṭas aȓ wami ḏ ȓefjar ikkar yuyur. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Iwḏan nni twacejjƹen aṭṭas wami aḥenjir nni srewwḥen-ṯ iddar.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itsafar zi Traws ɣar Militus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Itafeq Bulus akiḏneɣ bac neccin a nsafer ɣar ṯendint n Wassus ḏeg uɣarrabu netta aḏ d yas x iḍaren, menbaƹd a nemseȓqa ḏinni aṯ nesney akiḏneɣ ḏeg uɣarrabu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Wami xaneɣ d iḥreṯ ḏi ṯendint n Wassus, nesney-iṯ-iḏ akiḏneɣ ḏeg uɣarrabu nruḥ ɣar ṯendint n Mitilini. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Ssenni nsafer ḏeg uɣarrabu, ṯiwecca nnes nuweḍ ɣar ṯeyzirṯ n Kiyus. Wis ṯeȓtiyyam nuweḍ zzaṯ i ṯeyzirṯ n Samus. Wis arbeƹiyyam nuweḍ ɣar ṯendint n Militus.<verse eid="ACT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itemsafaḍ x imeqqranen n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16-17" />Zi ṯendint nni n Militus issekk Bulus ɣar ṯendint n Ufasus iȓaɣa-d x imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin bac aɣares d asen. Tuɣa igga Bulus aḏ ikk x ȓebḥar x uɣezḏis n ṯendint n Ufasus ig iǧan ḏi lʼiqlim n Asya bac war itƹeṭṭaȓ ca ḏinni. Itqeǧiq bac aḏ yaweḍ ḏeɣya ɣar ṯendint n Lquds imken qbeȓ i Ȓƹiḏ n nhar wis xemsin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.16-17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ȓƹiḏ n nhar wis xemsin ḏ ijjen n ȓƹiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil itas-d xemsin yum menbaƹd i Ȓƹiḏ ameqqran nsen.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 20:16-17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Wami ɣares d usin imeqqanen nni inna-asen: "Kenniw qa ṯessnem mammec tƹiceɣ marra ȓweqṯ nni iy tuɣa akiḏwem qqimeɣ, zi nhar nni amezwaru iy d uḏfeɣ ɣar Asya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Xeddmeɣ i Siḏi Arebbi bȓa ttakebbur, s imeṭṭawen inu kkint xafi ȓemḥayen wami xayi ciṭṭnen israʼiliyen. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />War zzaywem snuffareɣ walu, nec txebbareɣ-kenniw s marra min kenniw ɣa inefƹen. Seȓmaḏeɣ-awem-ṯ zzaṯ i yiwḏan u ƹaweḏ zi ṯeddarṯ ɣar ṯeddarṯ. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Ƹeǧmeɣ i israʼiliyen ḏ iyunaniyen bac aḏ tuben ɣar Arebbi aḏ amnen s Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Nec nhara ggureɣ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds ḏ Arruḥ iy ḏayi itawin ḏinni, war ssineɣ min ḏayi ɣa iweqƹen. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Innama, ḏi mkuȓ ṯendint iƹeǧem-ayi-d Arruḥ iqeddsen qa itraja-ayi ȓeḥbes ḏ tamara. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Walakin war ticceɣ bu lhimma i ṯuḏarṯ inu. Nec aḏ kemmȓeɣ minxef d usiɣ ḏ ȓxeḏmeṯ iy zi ḏayi ikellef Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa, iƹni aḏ cehḏeɣ x L'injil n arḍa n Arebbi.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Ȓexxu kenniw umi beccareɣ s ȓmulk n Arebbi ssneɣ nec belli uȓa ḏ ijjen zzaywem ma aḏ iẓer aɣembub inu ssa aȓ ṯsawent. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />X manaya qqareɣ-awem nec zi nhara tberriɣ ixef inu zeg iḏammen nwem marra. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Liʼanna nec war zzaywem snuffareɣ walu zi marra min inewwa Arebbi aṯ igg. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Ḥḍaṯ ixef nwem. Ḥḍaṯ ṯḥimerṯ nwem, ṯenni iy zi kenniw ikellef Arruḥ iqeddsen. Arewseṯ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Arebbi qa netta iseɣ-it s iḏammen nnes.<verse eid="ACT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Cuf, ssneɣ xmi ɣa uyureɣ nec aḏ d aḏfen jarawem can n wuccanen iwƹaren war reḥḥmen ca ṯḥimerṯ. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Ƹaweḏ zzaywem aḏ d meḍharen can iṯarrasen aḏ sƹewwjen lḥaqiqa ḥima aḏ jarren ɣarsen imeḥḍaren. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Iwa iȓiṯ ƹlabal! War tettum ca nec ṯeȓt-snin iy kiḏwem kkiɣ, qqimeɣ tweṣṣiɣ mkuȓ ijjen zzaywem ǧiȓeṯ ḏ wass s imeṭṭawen inu.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Ay ayṯma, ȓexxu axawem weddiɣ, iȓiṯ ag Arebbi ḏ wawaȓen n arḍa nnes. Awaȓen-a ḏaysen ṯizemmar aḏawem ucen jjheḏ aḏawem ucen ȓwarṯ ak marra ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Nec ƹemmarṣ war ḍmiƹeɣ i yixef inu can n ddheb niɣ ḏ nnuqarṯ niɣ ḏ warruḍ n can ḥadd. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Kenniw ṯessnem nec tuɣa xeḏmeɣ s ifassen inu bac aɣari yiȓi min ḥḏajeɣ nec ḏ min ḥḏajen yinni akiḏi. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />S marra manaya smeḍhareɣ-awem-d mammec itxeṣṣa-yaneɣ a nexḏem mliḥ bac a nƹawen yinni iḥḏajen. A nfekkar ḏeg wawaȓ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa iy inna: Ssaƹḏ n wenni iticcen ktar zeg wenni iqebbȓen."<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Wami inna Bulus ṯimesȓayin-a, irkeƹ x ifadden ḏ yinni marra netta iẓẓuǧ. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Ḏerrƹen-as i Bulus bḏan tseǧamen xas, trun marra iḏsen. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Xeyyqen aṭṭas s wawaȓ nni iy ḏasen inna war ṯẓerrem ca aɣembub inu ssa aȓ ṯsawent. Ssenni uwin-ṯ ɣar uɣarrabu.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itsafar ɣar ṯendint n Lquds</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Wami xasen d nuyur ssenni, nenya ḏeg uɣarrabu nruḥ nican ɣar ṯeyzirṯ n Kus. Ṯiwecca nnes nuweḍ ɣar ṯeyzirṯ n Rudus. Ssenni nuyur ɣar ṯendint n Batara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Nufa ḏinni ijjen n uɣarrabu itraḥ ɣar jwayeh n Finiqya, nenya ḏayes nuyur. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Ṯmeḍhar-aneɣ-d ṯeyzirṯ n Qubruṣ x uẓeȓmaḍ nneɣ. Neƹḏu-t, nruḥ ɣar Surya neḍra ḏi ṯendint n Ṣur minzi aɣarrabu itxeṣṣa aḏ isers sseȓƹaṯ ḏinni. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Wami nerzu x imeḥḍaren, nufi-ṯen ḏinni neqqim akiḏsen sebƹiyyam. Ƹlaḥsab min ƹeȓmen niṯni zi Arruḥ, qqaren-as i Bulus war tgaƹƹaḏ ca cek ɣar ṯendint n Lquds. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Wami ḏaneɣ ṯeqḍa ḏinni ȓweqṯ nneɣ nekkar neffeɣ bac a nsiɣi x usafar nneɣ. Marra imeḥḍaren ruḥen akiḏneɣ ɣar barra n ṯendint s ṯemɣarin nsen ḏ ṯarwa nsen, nerkeƹ x ifadden nneɣ x yijḏi n ȓebḥar neẓẓuǧ. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Wami nemsafaḍ xasen nenya ḏeg uɣarrabu, niṯni rewwḥen ɣar ṯuḏrin nsen.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Ssenni nsiɣi x usafar nneɣ ḏi ȓebḥar zi ṯendint nni n Ṣur nexḍeȓ ɣar ṯendint n Baṭlaymus. Nseǧem x ayṯmaṯneɣ ḏinni, neqqim akiḏsen ijjen n nhar. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ṯiwecca nnes nruḥ ɣar ṯendint n Qayṣariya nuḏef neqqim ḏi ṯeddarṯ n lmubcir Filippas. Netta ḏ ijjen zi sebƹa <char style="it">n ṣṣaḥaba n arrusul n Lquds</char>. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Netta ɣares arbeƹa n ṯḥenjirin ḏ ṯiƹzriyin ssawaȓent s min ƹeǧment zi Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Wami neqqim akiḏsen can wussan, yusa-d ɣarneɣ ijjen n nnabi zi Yahuḏiya qqaren-as Ɣabus. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Iqarreb-d ɣarneɣ iysi aḥezzam n Bulus, icedd iḍaren ḏ ifassen i yixef nnes inna: "Iqqar Arruḥ iqeddsen: Ammu israʼiliyen n Lquds aḏ qqnen bab n uḥezzam-a, aṯ sellmen i yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil."<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Neccin ḏ yiwḏan wami nesȓa manaya nḥeccem Bulus bac war itriḥ ca ɣar ṯendint n Lquds. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Inna-aneɣ: "Min kenniw yuɣin? Mayemmi iy ḏayi ṯeḥfarem ḏeg wuȓ s imeṭṭawen nwem? Nec aqayi mujud maci aḏayi qqnen waha. Nec aqayi mujud aḏ mmṯeɣ ḏi Lquds ƹlaḥsab isem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa!" <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Wami nufa neccin war ṯ nseqniƹ ca, nesqar nenna: Min ixes Siḏi Arebbi aṯ igg ḏ wenni netta!<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Menbaƹd ȓexddenni, nsewjeḏ ixef nneɣ a ngaƹƹeḏ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Uwin-aneɣ can n imeḥḍaren zi ṯendint n Qayṣariya bac a nnewjew ɣar yijjen n bnaḏem qqaren-as Mnasun netta zi ṯendint n Qubruṣ. Netta zeg imeḥḍaren imezwura.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itemseȓqa ak arrasul Yaƹqub</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Wami nuweḍ ɣar Lquds, reḥḥben zzayneɣ ayṯmaṯneɣ s ȓefraḥeṯ. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Ṯiwecca nnes yuḏef akiḏneɣ Bulus ɣar <char style="it">arrasul</char> Yaƹqub, ḥḍaren ḏinni marra imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Iseǧem xasen Bulus, iƹaweḏ-asen ṯa s ṯa inna-asen min igga Arebbi x ufus nnes jar yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Wami sȓin i manayenni, ḥemḏen Arebbi nnan-as i Bulus: "Cuf ay umaṯneɣ mecḥaȓ n uȓufaṯ n israʼiliyen iy yumnen! Marra iḏsen rezzun aḏ ggen lwajib ƹlaḥsab ccariƹa <char style="it">nneɣ</char>. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Itwanna-yasen zaƹma cek ṯseȓmaḏeḏ marra israʼiliyen iy zeddɣen ḏi lxarij aḏ semḥen ḏi Musa, ṯeqqareḏ-asen war ṭehhareṯ ca i ṯarwa nwem, war ḏeffareṯ ca lƹadaṯ nneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Bȓa ccekk aḏ sȓen qa cek illa ṯusiḏ-d. Iwa, mammec ɣa negg? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Iḏen, min ḏac ɣa nini egg-iṯ. <char style="it">Cuf,</char> ɣarneɣ arbeƹa n iryazen ggin ȓƹaheḏ <char style="it">ak Siḏi Arebbi</char>. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Awi yina xeǧes xasen axmi ɣa ṯeggem marra kenniw ȓuḍu nni aṣebḥan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ȓuḍu-ya aṣebḥan ḏ ijjen n nnuƹ n ȓuḍu maci ƹadi, teggen-ṯ bac aḏ ssiṣfan ixef nsen mliḥ. Itekk simana, txeǧasen xas aṭṭas n tmenyaṯ.</char></note> bac niṯni aḏ ḥeffen aḏ ḏewȓen ḏ iqeccura. Ammu aḏ ssnen marra min xak itwannan war iǧi bu ḏ ṣṣaḥ. Cek s yixef nnec ṯḏeffareḏ ccariƹa nneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Walakin ƹlaḥsab ȓmuminin nni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil, nura-yasen ṯabrat numar-iṯen aḏ beƹƹḏen x lmakla itwaqeddmen i lʼaṣnam, ḏ iḏammen, ḏ min itwajeyyfen, ḏ lfasad."<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Ṯiwecca nnes yuwi Bulus iryazen nni akiḏes, igga ȓuḍu nni aṣebḥan akiḏsen. Yuḏef ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant aḏ iƹȓem ȓfuqaha x ȓweqṯ iy ḏi ɣa kemmȓen nhuraṯ nni iqqimen x uṣeffi nsen, iƹni ȓweqṯ iy ɣa qeddmen ȓfuqaha dbiḥaṯ i arbeƹa-ya.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Teṭṭfen Arrasul Bulus ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Wami ƹȓayen aḏ kemmȓen sebƹa nni n nhuraṯ n ȓuḍu, can israʼiliyen zi lʼiqlim n Asya ẓrin Bulus ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant samaren xas marra ȓɣaci nni temzaḥamen xas. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ qqaren: "Ay iryazen n Ayṯ-Israʼil! Qa aryaz-a wenni iseȓmaḏen iwḏan marra ḏi mkuȓ amcan irezzu aḏ ƹarrḍen ccaƹb nneɣ ḏ ccariƹa nneɣ ḏ umcan-a nneɣ! Ƹaweḏ isiḏef-d iyunaniyen ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant, isexnaz amcan-a muqeddes." <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" /><char style="it">Nnan manayenni</char> minzi tuɣa ẓrin akiḏes ḏi ṯendint ijjen n bnaḏem qqaren-as Trifumu zi Ayṯ-Ufasus, itɣiȓ-asen Bulus isiḏef-iṯ ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Ṯekkar ȓfawḍa ḏi ṯendint marra. Kkaren yiwḏan nni uzzȓen ɣar Bulus ṭṭfen-ṯ, jarren-ṯ zi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant ɣar barra ȓexddenni bellƹen ṯiwwura. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Wami rezzun aṯ nɣen, yuweḍ ȓexbar ɣar arrayes n ȓƹaskar n arrumanus ṯekkar ijjen n ȓfawḍa ḏi Lquds marra. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Iruḥ netta ḏeɣya yuwi akiḏes ȓƹaskar ḏ imeqqranen nsen yuzzeȓ ɣarsen. Israʼiliyen wami ẓrin arrayes ḏ ȓƹaskar nnes, bedden war qqimen ca ƹaḏ ccaṯen Bulus.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Iqarreb arrayes nni ɣar Bulus iṭṭef-iṯ, yumar aṯ qqnen s ṯnayen n snaseȓ. Isseqsa xas inna-asen: Wanita min iƹna ḏ min igga? <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Ȓɣaci nni snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ kuȓ ijjen min iqqar. Wami arrayes nni war ifhim ca nican man ssabab n ssdaƹ nni, yumar aṯ siȓin ɣar lqecla. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Wami yuweḍ Bulus ɣar ddruj, arbun-ṯ ȓƹaskar siȓin-ṯ ƹlaḥsab amenɣi nni n yiwḏan. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Minzi ḏeffaren-ṯ snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ qqaren ysim xaneɣ wanita!<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itḏafaƹ x yixef nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Wami ƹȓayen aḏ siḏfen Bulus ɣar lqecla nni, inna-as i arrayes n ȓƹaskar: "Smeḥ-ayi ac iniɣ ijjen n wawaȓ."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Inna-as arrayes nni i Bulus: "Mammec teggeḏ cek ṯessawaȓeḏ ṯayunaniṯ? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Ma war ṯeǧiḏ ca cek ḏ amiṣri nni iy iggin lfitna ḏi ȓiyyam nni wami ṯsuyureḏ arbeƹaȓaf n lʼirhabiyen ɣar ȓexȓa?"<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Inna-as Bulus: "Lla, nec ḏ aʼisraʼili, ljinsiya inu zi ṯendint maƹrufa n Ṭarsus ḏi lʼiqlim n Kilikya. Tettareɣ zzayec aḏayi ṯsemḥeḏ aḏ ssiwȓeɣ ak yiwḏan-a." <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Wami iy ṯ ijja arrayes n ȓƹaskar aḏ issiweȓ, ibedd Bulus x ddruj iceyyar-asen s ifassen nnes. Niṯni sqaren, issiweȓ akiḏsen s lluɣa lƹibriya inna-asen:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />"Ay ayṯma ay imɣaren, ṣennṭeṯ-ayi mliḥ ȓexxu bac aḏ ḏafƹeɣ x yixef inu!" <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Wami sȓin i Bulus issawaȓ s lluɣa lƹibriya uca qeḍƹen ȓḥess. Inna-asen: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />"Nec ḏ aʼisraʼili xeȓqeɣ ḏi ṯendint n Ṭarsus ḏi lʼiqlim n Kilikya, walakin nec ymiɣ ḏi ṯendint-a ḏanita. Ɣriɣ ɣar iḍaren n lʼustad Gamlil twarebbiɣ s ccariƹa n ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ mammec ḏaneɣ ṯweṣṣa ṯa s ṯa kuȓci. Rezzuɣ aḏ ggeɣ lwajib ak Arebbi s wuȓ inu mamc ṯrezzum aḏ teggem kenniw marra nhara.<verse eid="ACT 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Nec tuɣa tƹeddabeɣ yinni iḏfaren abriḏ-a ḥetta wami mmuṯen. Ṭṭfeɣ iryazen ḏ ṯemɣarin ggiɣ-ṯen ḏi ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Arrayes n ȓfuqaha ḏ marra Jmaƹeṯ n imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil niṯni ḏ ȓechuḏ x manayenni. Ucin-ayi arruxṣaṯ aṯent ssiwḍeɣ ɣar ayṯmaṯsen ḏi ṯendint n Dimaceq. Ruḥeɣ ḏinni aḏ ṭṭfeɣ iwḏan <char style="it">n ubriḏ-a</char> aṯen d awiɣ ɣar Lquds bac aḏ twaƹaqben.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Nec tuɣa ggureɣ ḏeg ubriḏ qarrbeɣ ɣar Dimaceq, tuɣa ƹȓayen ḏ azyen n nhar. Ƹlaɣafla inneḍ-ayi-d ijjen n nnur itceƹciƹ zeg ujenna. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Wḍiɣ ɣar ṯmurṯ sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja ṯeqqar-ayi-d: A Cawul a Cawul, mayemmi ḏayi tƹeddabeḏ? <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Nniɣ-as nec: Min ṯeƹniḏ cek a Siḏi? Inna-ayi Nec ḏ Ƹisa zi Naṣira ḏ wenni iy tƹeddabeḏ.<verse eid="ACT 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Yinni kiḏi iǧan ẓrin nnur nni walakin war fhimen ca i ṯmijja n wenni iy kiḏi d issawaȓen.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Nniɣ-as nec: Min ɣa ggeɣ a Siḏi? Inna-ayi Siḏiṯneɣ: Kkar aḏef ɣar Dimaceq, aḏac itwanna ḏinni marra min yurin aḏ teggeḏ.<verse eid="ACT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Nnur nni tuɣa itseqsiq ijheḏ xafi, ḏewȓeɣ war twiȓiɣ walu. Ṭṭfen-ayi zeg ufus inu yinni kiḏi iǧan, ssiwḍen-ayi ɣar Dimaceq. <verse eid="ACT 22:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12-13" />Yusa-d ɣari ḏinni ijjen qqaren-as Anas. Netta ḏayes ddin, itṭaƹa i ccariƹa. Ssawaȓen xas mliḥ marra israʼiliyen iy zeddɣen ḏi Dimaceq. Ibedd-d zzaṯi inna-ayi: Ay uma Cawul, ȓexxu aḏ tḏewȓeḏ aḏ twaȓiḏ! Ȓexddenni genfiɣ twaȓiɣ netta. <verse eid="ACT 22:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Inna-ayi: Arebbi n ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ ixḍar-icek netta bac aḏ tessneḏ min ixes, aḏ twaȓiḏ <char style="it">s ṯiṭṭawin nnec</char> axeddam nnes ṣṣaliḥ aḏ tṣennṭeḏ i yijjen n wawaȓ zeg uqemmum nnes. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Cek axas ṯiȓiḏ ḏ ccaheḏ ɣar marra iwḏan ƹlaḥsab min ṯeẓriḏ ḏ min ṯesȓiḏ. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Y ȓexxu min trajiḏ? Kkar aḏ twaṭehhareḏ s waman, sireḏ zi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnec xmi ɣa ṯȓaɣiḏ x yisem nnes.<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Wami ḏewȓeɣ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds tẓaǧiɣ ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant, ihwa-d xafi ijjen n lwaḥi. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Ẓriɣ <char style="it">Siḏiṯneɣ</char> inna-ayi: Kkar ffeɣ ḏeɣya zi Lquds minzi chaḏeṯ nnec xafi war t qebbȓen ca. <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Nniɣ-as: A Siḏi, niṯni ssnen belli tuɣa traḥeɣ zi ṯemziḏa ɣar ṯemziḏa tḥebbaseɣ ccaṯeɣ yinni zzayek yumnen. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Ḥḍareɣ nec wami sizzȓen iḏammen n Stifan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Stifan netta zi sebƹa nni n ṣṣaḥaba n arrusul ḏi ṯendint n Lquds. Nɣin-ṯ israʼiliyen. </char></note> wenni xak icehhḏen. Wafqeɣ x ȓmewṯ nnes, ḥḍiɣ-asen uȓa ḏ arruḍ n yinni iy ṯ inɣin. <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Inna-ayi Siḏi: Ruḥ, cek ac ssekkeɣ ɣar imucan ggwjen aṭṭas, ɣar yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil."<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Sȓin mliḥ i Bulus ḥetta aȓ wami inna awaȓ-a aneggaru. Ȓexddenni snekkaren xas ṯɣuyyeṯ nnan: Mḥaṯ aryaz-a zi ddunect-a, war isḏiheǧ ca aḏ iqqim ƹaḏ iddar! <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ, neṭṭaren izeǧuba nsen, zzuzzaren ṯaƹejjact ɣar ujenna. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Ikkar arrayes n ȓƹaskar yumar aḏ siḏfen Bulus ɣar lqecla, aṯ uwṯen s usɣun aḏas ggen lʼistijwab mayemmi xas snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ qaƹ ammu. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Wami ṯ cedden bac aṯ uwṯen, inna-as Bulus i umeqqran n ȓƹaskar ibedden ḏinni: "Ma qanuni aḏ tuwṯem ijjen n bnaḏem s usɣun ɣares ljinsiya n arrumanus meȓa war xas ṯḥekkimem ca?"<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Wami isȓa umeqqran nni n ȓƹaskar manayenni, iruḥ ɣar arrayes n ȓƹaskar inna-as: "Min teggeḏ cek ammu? Qa aryaz nni ɣares ljinsiya n arrumanus!"<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Yusa-d arrayes nni inna-as: "In-ayi cek, ma ɣarek ljinsiya n arrumanus?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Yarra xas Bulus: "Wah, nec aqat ɣari."<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Inna-as arrayes nni: "Qa nec sɣiɣ ljinsiya inu s waṭṭas n tmenyaṯ."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Inna-as Bulus: "Nec xeȓqeɣ-d zzayes." <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Ȓexddenni beƹƹḏen xas ḏeɣya yinni ixsen as ggen lʼistijwab. Iggweḏ waxxa ḏ arrayes nni wami issen belli icedd ijjen ɣares ljinsiya n arrumanus.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus zzaṯ i Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Ṯiwecca nnes, irezzu arrayes nni n ȓƹaskar aḏ issen mayemmi Ayṯ-Israʼil tahamen Bulus, iruḥ yumar arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ marra Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏ munen. Ȓexddenni isufeɣ-d Bulus yuwi-ṯ-iḏ ɣarsen isbedd-iṯ zzaṯsen.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Ixzar mliḥ Bulus ɣar Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil inna-asen: "Ay ayṯma, qa nec ggiɣ lwajib nican ak Arebbi, zi qbeȓ ḥetta nhara nec ḍḍamir inu mertaḥ." <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ikkar Anas arrayes n ȓfuqaha yumar yinni ibedden ak Bulus aṯ uwṯen ɣar uqemmum. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Ȓexddenni inna-as Bulus: "Cek ṯeggiḏ am ȓḥiḍ ircan ijjiyaren s jjir, ac yuweṯ Arebbi! Ṯeqqimeḏ cek ḏinni axafi ṯḥekmeḏ ƹlaḥsab ccariƹa, walakin ȓexxu txalafeḏ ccariƹa wami ṯen ṯumareḏ aḏayi uwṯen."<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Nnan-as i Bulus yinni ḏinni iḥḍaren: "Ma tukkareḏ cek arrayes n ȓfuqaha n Arebbi?!"<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Inna-asen Bulus: "Ay ayṯma, qa nec war ṯ ssineɣ ca tuɣaṯ ḏ arrayes n ȓfuqaha minzi Lkitab iqqar: &lt;Arrayes n ccaƹb, war ḏayes qqar bu ȓƹib.&gt;"<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Wami issen Bulus qa ca zzaysen zi ȓḥizeb n iṣadduqiyen ca nneɣni zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen, ikkar iȓaɣa-d s jjheḏ ḏi Jmaƹeṯ nni n lḥukkam jarasen inna-asen: "Ay ayṯma, qa nec ḏ afarrisi mmis n ifarrisiyen! Aqa tḥakamem xafi wami nec ɣari lʼamal aḏ d kkaren yiwḏan zi ȓmewṯ ḏi Lqiyama." <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Wami inna manaya iwqeƹ ijjen n lxilaf jar ifarrisiyen ḏ iṣadduqiyen, Jmaƹeṯ nni n lḥukkam mesfraqen jarasen. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Minzi iṣadduqiyen qqaren qa war ḏinni lla Lqiyama, lla lmalaʼikaṯ, lla jnun, walakin ifarrisiyen qqaren marra manaya iǧa.)<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Iwqeƹ ijjen n ssdaƹ imɣar, kkaren ȓebƹaḍ zeg imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa niṯni ḏ ifarrisiyen temnaqaren s jjheḏ qqaren: "Neccin war ḏas ntif bu can lɣaleṭ ḏi bnaḏem-a, imken issiweȓ akiḏes can n jjenn niɣ ḏ can n lmalaʼika."<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Wami bḏan tmenɣan s jjheḏ ƹlaḥsab lxilaf nni, iggweḏ arrayes n ȓƹaskar aḏ mezqen Bulus. Yumar ȓƹaskar nnes aḏ hwan aḏ d xeḍfen Bulus zi ȓwesṭ nsen, aṯ siȓin ɣar lqecla. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Ǧiȓeṯ nni ibedd-d Siḏiṯneɣ ɣar Bulus inna-as: "Egg zƹameṯ! Mammec iy zzayi ṯcehḏeḏ ḏi ṯendint n Lquds, u labud ƹaweḏ azzayi ṯcehḏeḏ ḏi ṯendint n Ruma."<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayṯ-Israʼil tciṭṭinen bac aḏ nɣen Arrasul Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Wami d iṣbeḥ ȓḥaȓ ciṭṭnen Ayṯ-Israʼil, weƹḏen Arebbi ḥarrmen ixef nsen war tetten war sessen aȓ ɣa nɣen Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Ktar zi arbeƹin iḏsen ig iciṭṭnen ḏi manaya. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ruḥen ɣar arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil nnan-asen: "Neccin newƹeḏ Arebbi nḥarrem ixef nneɣ war ntett walu aȓ ɣa nneɣ Bulus neccin. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Ȓexxu Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam ḏ kenniw ttarem zi arrayes n ȓƹaskar n arrumanus bac aɣarwem d issekk Bulus. Ggeṯ ixef nwem ṯexsem akiḏes ṯeggem lʼistijwab mliḥ. Neccin aqaneɣ mujud bac aṯ nneɣ qbeȓ iy d ɣa yaweḍ."<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Mmis n učmas n Bulus yarra-d ȓexbar x min ciṭṭinen yiwḏan nni, iruḥ ɣar lqecla yuḏef ḏinni iƹaweḏ-as manayenni i Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Iȓaɣa-d Bulus x yijjen n uƹaskari ḏ ameqqran n arrumanus inna-as: "Awi aḥenjir-a ɣar arrayes nwem aqa ɣares can wawaȓ aḏas ṯ yini."<verse eid="ACT 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Yuwi-ṯ ɣar arrayes n ȓƹaskar inna-as qa iȓaɣa-d xafi Bulus ameḥbus nni ittar zzayi inna-ayi aḏac d awiɣ aḥenjir-a aqa ɣares can wawaȓ aḏac ṯ yini.<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Arrayes nni n ȓƹaskar iṭṭef aḥenjir nni ḏeg ufus, yuwi-ṯ ɣar can ṯɣemmarṯ waḥḏes inna-as: "Min texseḏ aḏayi ṯiniḏ?"<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Inna-as uḥenjir nni: "Israʼiliyen ttafaqen jarasen bac azzayek ttaren aḏ d tessekkeḏ ṯiwecca Bulus ɣar Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam nsen. Ggin ixef nsen axmi xsen aḏas ggen lʼistijwab mliḥ. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />War ṯen tejja ca ac sqenƹen qa ḏinni ktar zi arbeƹin n iryazen wejjḏen i Bulus, weƹḏen Arebbi ḥarrmen ixef nsen war tetten war sessen aȓ ṯ ɣa nɣen. Aqa niṯni wejjḏen, ɣir trajan aḏ twafqeḏ x ṭṭaleb nsen."<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Issekk arrayes-a n ȓƹaskar aḥenjir nni inna-as: "War tƹawaḏ i ḥadd belli cek ṯenniḏ-ayi i nec ȓexbar-a."<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawin Arrasul Bulus ɣar lwali Filiks</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Ȓexddenni iȓaɣa-d arrayes nni n ȓƹaskar i ṯnayen n imeqqranen nnes inna-asen: "Swejḏeṯ miyytayen n ȓƹaskar ḏ sebƹin n yinni iy inyin x yiysan ḏ miyytayen zeg yinni ikessin ikeccuḍen ɣarsen ṯicceṭ n wuzzeȓ, aḏ traḥem ɣar tesƹa n ǧiȓeṯ ɣar ṯendint n Qayṣariya. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Swejḏeṯ i Bulus minxef ɣa iney bac aṯ tsiwḍem ḏi lʼaman u ḍaman ɣar Lwali Filikes."<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Uca yura ijjen n ṯebrat i Lwali Filikes inna-as ḏayes: <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />"A si Lwali Filikes, nec Kludyus Lisyas tseǧameɣ xak. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Aryaz-a ṭṭfen-ṯ Ayṯ-Israʼil tuɣa ƹȓayen aṯ nɣen. Wami d arriɣ ȓexbar qa netta ɣares ljinsiya n arrumanus, ruḥeɣ nec ḏ ȓƹaskar inu nsenjem-iṯ-iḏ. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Rezzuɣ aḏ ssneɣ nec ttuhmaṯ iy xas ggin, uwiɣ-ṯ ɣar Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam nsen. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ufiɣ ttuhmaṯ nni niṯenti ḏ can ṯmesȓayin x ccariƹa nsen waha. War xas ufiɣ bu can ttuhma isḏaheǧ xas ȓmewṯ niɣ ḏ ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Wami d arriɣ ȓexbar ciṭṭnen xas, ssekkeɣ-ṯ-iḏ ɣarek ḏeɣya. Umareɣ yinni xas iy ggin ttuhmaṯ aḏac ƹawḏen min ɣarsen ḍed nnes."<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31-33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31-33" />Ssenni nefḏen ȓƹaskar ƹlaḥsab min zi ṯen yumar. Uwin Bulus s ǧiȓeṯ ɣar ṯendint n Antipatris. Ṯiwecca nnes ḏewȓen-d ȓebƹaḍ n ȓƹaskar ɣar lqecla nsen, yinni iy inyin x yiysan kemmȓen x ubriḏ nsen ak Bulus uwḍen ɣar Qayṣariya. Kellfen ḏinni Lwali x Bulus sellmen-as ṯabrat nni. <verse eid="ACT 23:31-33" /><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34-35" />Wami t iɣra Lwali inna-as i Bulus man lʼiqlim iy ɣar twaḥsabeḏ cek? Wami ḏas inna Bulus nec zi lʼiqlim n Kilikya inna-as Lwali: "Nec aḏ iȓiɣ x ljelsa nnec xmi d ɣa awḍen yinni iy xak ɣa inin ttuhma." Ssenni yumar axas ƹesssen ḏi ȓeqṣar n Hirudus.<verse eid="ACT 23:34-35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Tḥakamen x Arrasul Bulus zzaṯ i Lwali Filiks</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Menbƹad i xemsiyyam ihwa-d <char style="it">ɣar Qayṣaria</char> arrayes n ȓfuqaha Anas akiḏes ȓebƹaḍ n imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ ijjen n lmuḥami qqaren-as Tartulus, tahhamen Bulus ɣar Lwali. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2-3" />Ȓaɣan-d x Bulus, ibḏa Tartulus itaham-iṯ iqqar: "A si Lwali Filikes, neccin zi ssabab nnec netƹic ḏeg yijjen n ȓehna ḏ ameqqran, u s uƹḏeȓ nnec ṯṣeȓḥeḏ mliḥ ṯuḏarṯ nneɣ ḏi ṯmurṯ-a. Neccin nqebbeȓ manaya, ncekkar-icek aṭṭas ḏi kuȓ ȓweqṯ ḏ kuȓ amcan. <verse eid="ACT 24:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Walakin war xseɣ ca ac sƹeṭṭaȓeɣ aṭṭas, tettareɣ zzayek ƹlaḥsab ȓxaḍar nnec aɣarneɣ ṯesȓeḏ cwayt.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Aryaz-a wanita nufi-ṯ itxarwaḍ waha itegg lfitna jar marra israʼiliyen iy ǧan ḏi marra ddunect. Netta ḏ ijjen n arrayes n lbidƹa n nnaṣara. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Ƹaweḏ irezzu aḏ isexnez ḥetta ṯamziḏa ṯameqqrant. Neccin neṭṭef-iṯ {nexs axas neḥkem ƹlaḥsab ccariƹa nneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Walakin yusa-d arrayes n ȓƹaskar Lisyas ikkes-aneɣ-ṯ zeg ufus nneɣ s lquwwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Yumar yinni iteggen ttuhmaṯ bac aɣarek d asen.} Axmi ḏas ɣa ṯeggeḏ cek s yixef nnec lʼistijwab aḏ tessneḏ minxef ṯ ntaham neccin." <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Tafqen israʼiliyen x ttuhmaṯ nni, qqaren qa manayenni iggi-ṯ ḏ ṣṣaḥ.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itḏafaƹ x yixef nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Iceyyar-as Lwali i Bulus bac aḏ issiweȓ. Indeq-d Bulus inna-as: "Nec ssneɣ mecḥaȓ zeg wami cek ṯḥekkmeḏ x ṯmurṯ-a. X manaya farrḥeɣ bac aḏ ḏafƹeɣ x yixef inu. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ṯzemmareḏ aḏ tesseqsiḏ nec yallah ṯenƹacar yum zeg wami gaƹƹḏeɣ ɣar Lquds maci ktar, bac aḏ ƹebḏeɣ Arebbi. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />War ḏayi ufin ca tmenɣiɣ ak can ḥadd ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant niɣ tsamareɣ ȓɣaci ȓa ḏi ṯemziḏawin uȓa ḏi ṯendint. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />War ɣarsen bu ddalil x ttuhmaṯ-a iy xafi tqeddamen ȓexxu. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Walakin qqareɣ-ac nec taƹtarafeɣ zzaṯec ƹebbḏeɣ Arebbi n ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ ƹlaḥsab abriḏ-a iy ḥessben niṯni zaƹma ḏ lbidƹa. Tamneɣ s marra min itafaqen ak ccariƹa ḏ min d yurin ḏi Lkutub n lʼanbiya. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Ɣari lʼamal zi Arebbi mamc ɣarsen iǧa ɣar iryazen-a, iƹni aḏ d kkaren zi ȓmewṯ ṣṣaliḥin ḏ ḍḍalimin. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Falihaḏa teggeɣ marra jjheḏ inu bac aḏ ƹiceɣ s yijjen n ḍḍamir mertaḥ zzaṯ i Arebbi ḏ yiwḏan.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Menbaƹd i waṭṭas n iseggwusa ƹeqbeɣ-d <char style="it">ɣar ṯendint n Lquds</char> uwiɣ-d can n ṣṣaḏaqa i lʼumma inu, qeddmeɣ ca n dbiḥaṯ. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Wami ḏayi ufin ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant teggeɣ ȓuḍu. War ufin akiḏi bu ȓɣaci, war teggeɣ bu ssdaƹ. Walakin ḏinni can n israʼiliyen zi lʼiqlim n Asya, <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />itxeṣṣa niṯni aɣarek d asen s yixef nsen ḏanita bac aḏ inin ttuhmaṯ iy ɣarsen ḍed inu. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Niɣ aḏac inin yina iy ḏa ibedden man ljarima iy xafi ufin wami beddeɣ zzaṯ i Jmaƹeṯ n lḥukkam nsen. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Wac imken x wawaȓ nni iy nniɣ s uȓaɣi jarasen wami beddeɣ ḏinni? Nniɣ-asen aqa kenniw ṯḥakamem xafi nhara minzi tamneɣ belli iwḏan aḏ d kkaren zi ȓmewṯ ḏi Lqiyama."<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iqqim Arrasul Bulus ḏi ȓeḥbes n Qayṣariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Filikes netta issen mliḥ x ubriḏ-a <char style="it">n Ƹisa</char>, walakin iʼejjel lḥukem nnes inna-asen: "Ḥetta aḏ d yas arrayes n ȓƹaskar Lisyas ƹaḏ iy ɣa ḥekmeɣ x manaya." <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Yumar ijjen n umeqqran n ȓƹaskar inna-as: "Ƹess x Bulus ḏi ȓeḥbes." Inna-as: "Walakin uc-as cwayt n lḥurriya, ejj imeddukaȓ nnes aɣares d asen bac aḏayes thillan."<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ƹḏun can wussan, yusa-d Filikes akiḏes ṯamɣarṯ nnes Drusila, nettaṯ ḏ ṯaʼisraʼiliṯ. Iȓaɣa-d x Bulus iṣenneṭ-as wami issawaȓ x lʼiman zi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Wami issiweȓ Bulus x min iǧan nican, ḏ mammec ɣa iḥkem bnaḏem x yixef nnes, ḏ Yum Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab iy d ɣa yasen uca inexȓeƹ Filikes inna-as: "Ṣafi ȓexxu, ƹqeb. Xmi ɣari ɣa ṯiȓi lfurṣa axak d ȓaɣiɣ." <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Netta ƹaweḏ Filikes irezzu zi Bulus arrecweṯ. S manaya itȓaɣa-d xas aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin issawaȓ akiḏes. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Ƹḏun ṯnayen n iseggwusa, iḏweȓ-d Burkyus Fastus ḏeg umcan n Lwali Filikes. Walakin Filikes igga-asen ȓxaḍar i israʼiliyen, ijja Bulus ḏi ȓeḥbes.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itestanaf ddaƹweṯ nnes ɣar Lmalik Qayṣar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Fastus netta iḏweȓ ḏ Lwali ḏi lʼiqlim. Wami ṯeƹḏu ṯeȓtiyyam igaƹƹeḏ zi ṯendint nni n Qayṣariya ɣar ṯendint n Lquds. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2-3" />Arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil qeddmen-as ttuhmaṯ nsen ḍed i Bulus. Ḥeccmen-ṯ ttaren zzayes aḏasen igg ȓxaḍar nsen bac aṯiḏ yawi ɣar Lquds walakin niṯni wejjḏen-as i Bulus bac aṯ nɣen ḏeg ubriḏ nni. <verse eid="ACT 25:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Inna-asen Lwali qa Bulus aqaṯ ḏi ṯendint n Qayṣariya ḏ ameḥbus, ȓexxu nec aḏ ḏewȓeɣ ḏinni. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />U labud akiḏi raḥen zzaywem ȓebƹaḍ n imeqqranen nwem. Meȓa ixḍa uryaz nni ḏi can ȓḥajeṯ, qeddmem-ayi-d ttuhmaṯ iy ɣarwem ḍed nnes ḏinni.<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Iqqim Fastus ḏi Lquds ma ṯmeniyyam ma ƹecriyyam, menbƹad ihwa ɣar Qayṣariya. Ṯiwecca nnes, igga ljelsa ḏi lmaḥkama yumar aḏas d awin Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Wami d iḥḍar ḏinni, munen-d xas israʼiliyen nni iy d yusin zi Lquds. Tahamen-ṯ s waṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin iy wƹarent walakin war ɣarsen bu ddalil.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Ibḏa Bulus itḏafaƹ x yixef nnes inna: "Nec war xḍiɣ ca ḏi manayenni, niɣ ḏi Ccariƹa n Ayṯ-Israʼil niɣ ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant niɣ ḏi Lmalik Qayṣar."<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Walakin Lwali Fastus irezzu aḏ igg ȓxaḍar i Ayṯ-Israʼil uca inna-as i Bulus: "Ma ṯexseḏ aḏ tgaƹƹḏeḏ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds axak ḥekmeɣ ḏinni nec x ttuhmaṯ-a?"<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Inna-as Bulus: "Nec aqayi beddeɣ ḏi lmaḥkama-ya n Lmalik Qayṣar, itxeṣṣa ḏa iy ɣa twaḥakmeɣ. Qa Ayṯ-Israʼil war ḏaysen xḍiɣ ca, mammec ṯessneḏ cek. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Meȓa xḍiɣ iƹni ggiɣ can ȓḥajeṯ sḏaheǧeɣ xas ȓmewṯ war zemmareɣ azzayes arewȓeɣ. Walakin meȓa ttuhmaṯ-a iy xafi qeddmen war ǧint ca ḏ ṣṣaḥ, uȓa ḏ ijjen ma ɣares ȓḥaqq aḏayi isellem i niṯni. Nec testanafeɣ ddaƹweṯ inu ɣar Lmalik Qayṣar."<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Lwali Fastus issiweȓ ak imcawaren nnes uca inna-as i Bulus: "Meȓa cek ddaƹweṯ nnec ṯestanfeḏ-t ɣar Qayṣar, qa ɣar Qayṣar iy ɣar ɣa ṯraḥeḏ."<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fastus issawaȓ ak uzeǧiḏ Aɣribas x lqaḍiya n Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ƹḏun ȓebƹaḍ n wussan, yusa-d uzeǧiḏ Aɣribas akiḏes <char style="it">učmas</char> Brinka ɣar ṯendint n Qayṣariya bac aḏ seǧmen x Lwali Fastus. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Wami ḏinni iy qqimen aṭṭas n wussan, issiweȓ Fastus ak uzeǧiḏ x lqaḍiya n Bulus. Inna-as: "Ḏanita ijjen n uryaz ijji-ṯ Filikes ḏ ameḥbus. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Wami ruḥeɣ nec ɣar Lquds qeddmen-ayi-d ttuhmaṯ arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ttaren zzayi axas ḥekmeɣ x lmujrim. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Nniɣ-asen: Ƹlaḥsab lƹada n arrumanus war tsellimen ḥadd ḥetta aḏ imqabaȓ ak yinni iy xas iggin ttuhma, aɣares ṯiȓi lfurṣa aḏ iḏafeƹ x yixef nnes. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Iḏen, ṯiwecca nnes munen-d ḏanita qa ggiɣ ljelsa nnes ḏi lmaḥkama. Tuɣa war ƹeṭṭaȓeɣ ca, umareɣ bac aṯiḏ awin. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Kkaren ssiwȓen yinni xas iqeddmen ttuhmaṯ, ufiɣ ttuhmaṯ nni iy ggin ḍed i Bulus war ǧint ca ḏ can ljarimaṯ iy tuɣa xseɣ aḏ ssneɣ nec. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Lla, menɣen akiḏes x can ṯmesȓayin ḏi ddin nsen ḏ yijjen n uryaz qqaren-as Ƹisa, qa immuṯ walakin Bulus iqqar lla netta iddar! <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Wami weddareɣ nec war ufiɣ mammec ɣa beḥṯeɣ ḏi ṯmesȓayin-a, nniɣ-as i Bulus: Ma aḏ traḥeḏ ɣar Lquds axak ḥekmeɣ ḏinni x ttuhmaṯ-a? <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Bulus yugi, ikkar istanef ddaƹweṯ nnes ɣar Qayṣar. Umareɣ nec aḏ iqqim ḏ ameḥbus aȓ ṯ ɣa ssekkeɣ i Lmalik Qayṣar."<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Inna-as uzeǧiḏ Aɣribas i Fastus: "Nec s yixef inu xseɣ aḏas ṣennṭeɣ i uryaz-a."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Inna-as Fastus: "Ṯiwecca aḏas ṯṣennṭeḏ."<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus zzaṯ i uzeǧiḏ Aɣribas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ṯiwecca nnes, wami d yusa uzeǧiḏ Aɣribas ḏ Brinka s yijjen n ccan ḏ ameqqran, uḏfen ɣar uxxam ḏ ameqqran n uyraw akiḏes arruyas n ȓƹaskar n arrumanus ḏ imeqqranen n ṯendint. Ȓexddenni yumar Fastus uwin-d Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Inna Fastus: "A si azeǧiḏ Aɣribas ḏ iryazen iḥḍaren akiḏneɣ marra! Aqa twaȓam aryaz-a zzaṯwem xas iy ḏayi qeddmen ttuhmaṯ marra lʼumma n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi Lquds uȓa ḏanita <char style="it">ḏi Qayṣariya</char>. Snekkaren xas ṯɣuyyeṯ qqaren labud wanita war itɣimi ca ƹaḏ aḏ iddar! <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Nec war xas ufiɣ bu can ȓḥajeṯ isḏaheǧ xas ȓmewṯ. Wami istanef ddaƹweṯ nnes ɣar lmalik Qayṣar, xseɣ aɣares ṯ ssekkeɣ. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Walakin nec war xas ufiɣ bu can n ttuhma nican ḥima aḏas t ariɣ i si Lmalik Qayṣar. S manaya seḥḍareɣ-ṯ-iḏ zzaṯwem, xaṣṣatan cek a si azeǧiḏ Aɣribas, bac meȓa ṯeggim-as lʼistijwab aḏ ssneɣ min xas ɣa ariɣ. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Nec twaȓiɣ maci maƹqul aḏ ssekkeɣ can umeḥbus bȓa ma aḏ ariɣ ttuhmaṯ iy xas qeddmen."<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Bulus itḏafaƹ x yixef nnes zzaṯ i uzeǧiḏ Aɣribas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Inna-as uzeǧiḏ Aɣribas i Bulus: "Qa neccin nesmeḥ-ac aḏ tdafƹeḏ x yixef nnec."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:1">Iceyyar Bulus s ufus nnes ibḏa itḏafaƹ x yixef nnes inna-as: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />"A ssaƹḏ inu nec a si azeǧiḏ Aɣribas wami ḏayi ṯejjiḏ aḏ ḏafƹeɣ x yixef inu nhara zzaṯec cek x marra ttuhmaṯ iy zzayi tahamen Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Xaṣṣatan minzi cek ṯessneḏ marra lƹadaṯ n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ lxilafaṯ nsen. S manaya tettareɣ zzayek aḏ teṣbareḏ aḏayi ṯṣennṭeḏ.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Qa marra Ayṯ-Israʼil ssnen mammec tuɣa ṯeǧa ṯuḏarṯ inu zi ṯemẓi inu iy ƹiceɣ ḏi ṯmurṯ inu, ƹaweḏ uȓa ḏi ṯendint n Lquds. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Niṯni ssnen-ayi aṭṭas zeg wami. Meȓa xsen axafi cehḏen nec ƹiceɣ ḏ afarrisi, ȓḥizeb nni iqesḥen aṭṭas ḏi ddin nneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Cuf, mayemmi iy ǧiɣ nec nhara ḏi lmaḥkama-ya? Liʼanna ɣari lʼamal zi ȓƹaheḏ nni iy ḏaneɣ yuca Arebbi zi ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar ṯenƹac n ṯqebbaȓ n Ayṯ-Israʼil ƹebbḏen Arebbi minzi ɣarsen lʼamal ȓƹaheḏ nni aḏ yiȓi. Cuf, a si azeǧiḏ, lʼamal-a netta ḏ ttuhma iy xafi nnan Ayṯ-Israʼil! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Mayemmi ṯenwim qa Arebbi war itemkin ca aḏ d isnekkar yinni immuṯen zi ȓmewṯ?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Nec qenƹeɣ s yixef inu tuɣa ḍaruri aḏ ggeɣ marra min zemmareɣ bac aḏ ƹarrḍeɣ i yisem n Ƹisa zi Naṣira. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Amenni iy ggiɣ ḏi ṯendint n Lquds. S arruxṣa n arruyas n ȓfuqaha tḥebbaseɣ aṭṭas n ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin. Xmi xasen taḥkamen s ȓmewṯ, nec tafaqeɣ x manayenni. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Mecḥaȓ n ṯwaȓaṯin traḥeɣ zi ṯemziḏa ɣar ṯemziḏa tƹeddabeɣ-ṯen, rezzuɣ aḏ ssiwȓen s bezzez ȓƹib ḏi Arebbi. S uɣḍab nni inu traḥeɣ ḥetta ɣar ṯneddam ḏi lxarij bac aṯen ƹeddbeɣ ḏinni.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />S manaya iy ruḥeɣ <char style="it">ijjen n nhar</char> ɣar ṯendint n Dimaceq, ysiɣ-d arruxṣa n arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ ttesriḥ nsen. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />A si azeǧiḏ, wami ggureɣ ɣar uzyen n nhar ẓriɣ ijjen n nnur ḏeg ujenna ṯfawṯ nnes tseqsiq ktar zi ṯfuct, inneḍ-ayi-d itceƹciƹ xafi nec ḏ yinni iy kiḏi igguren. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Newḍa marra ɣar ṯmurṯ, sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja ṯessawaȓ s lluɣa lƹibriya ṯeqqar-ayi-d: A Cawul a Cawul, mayemmi ḏayi tƹeddabeḏ? Teggeḏ am wenni iy ḏi ṯeǧa ṯɣennant isuggur-iṯ Arebbi s ṯsennant.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ljumla-ya ṯeqqar ḥarfiya s ṯyunaniṯ: Iqseḥ xak aḏ tuwṯeḏ s iḍaren ṯicceṭ ukeccuḍ qa twacukkeḏ zzayes.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Nniɣ-as: Min ṯeƹniḏ cek a Siḏi? Inna-ayi qa Nec ḏ Ƹisa wenni iy tƹeddabeḏ. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Ȓexxu kkar, bedd x iḍaren nnec. Aqa nec meḍhareɣ-ac-d bac ac d ixḍareɣ aḏ tḏewȓeḏ ḏ axeddam inu aḏ tiȓiḏ ḏ ijjen n ccaheḏ x min zzayi teẓriḏ ḏ min ƹaḏ ḏac d ɣa sbeyyneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Ac snejmeɣ zi lʼumma nnec, ac snejmeɣ ƹaweḏ zeg yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. Ac ssekkeɣ ɣarsen <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />bac aḏasen ṯrezmeḏ ṯiṭṭawin nsen, aṯen ṯesbeƹƹḏeḏ zi ṯaǧest ɣar nnur, aṯen ṯesbeƹƹḏeḏ zi ssulṭa n Cciṭan ɣar Arebbi. Ammu aḏasen twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen aɣarsen yiȓi umcan ak ṣṣaliḥin iƹni s lʼiman iy ḏayi iy ggin.<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Nec a si azeǧiḏ Aɣribas, war ƹṣiɣ ca lwaḥi nni iy xafi d ihwan zeg ujenna. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Lla, tbeccareɣ ḏ amezwaru imezḏaɣ n tendint n Dimaceq, ƹaḏ ḏ imezḏaɣ n ṯendint n Lquds ḏ marra jwayeh n ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya, ḏ aneggaru marra yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. Tbeccareɣ-ṯen aḏ tuben aḏ ḏewȓen ɣar Arebbi, aḏ xeḏmen ȓexḏayem n ttuba iy iǧan n ṣṣaḥ. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />X manaya ṭṭfen-ayi Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant, xsen aḏayi nɣen. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Walakin Arebbi iƹawen-ayi-d zi qbeȓ ḥetta nhara. Ammu aqayi nec ḏanita beddeɣ, tbeccareɣ s umezyan ḏ umeqqran. Qqareɣ ɣir ṯimesȓayin nni iy nnan lʼanbiya ḏ Musa labud aḏ weqƹent. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Iƹni, Lmasiḥ wa labud aḏ itwaƹeddeb aḏ ibeccar lʼumma nneɣ s nnur ḏ marra yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil liʼanna ḏ netta iy d ɣa ikkaren ḏ amezwaru zi ȓmewṯ."<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Bulus netta aqaṯ ƹaḏ issawaȓ itḏafaƹ x yixef nnes, ikkar lwali Fastus inna-as s jjheḏ: "A Bulus, cek ma ṯeflippaḏ? Ṯɣuri nnec ṯemɣar qa ṯesbuheȓi-yic!"<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Inna-as Bulus: "A si lwali Fastus, lla nec war flippaɣ ca. Min qqareɣ ḏ ṣṣaḥ u s ȓaƹqeȓ. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Azeǧiḏ Aɣribas issen netta mliḥ x manaya, nec rezzuɣ akiḏes ssiwȓeɣ s ṣṣaraḥa marra. Nec mesteqneƹ war ṯeqqim uȓa ḏ ijjen n ȓḥajeṯ zi manaya war t issin ca, liʼanna war ṯewqiƹ ca ḏi can n ṯɣemmarṯ waha. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />A si azeǧiḏ Aɣribas, cek ma tamneḏ s lʼanbiya? Nec ssneɣ illa cek tamneḏ."<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Inna-as uzeǧiḏ Aɣribas: "Ma s cwayt n ȓweqṯ ṯa cek ṯenwiḏ aḏayi ṯarreḏ ḏ amasiḥi?"<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Inna-as Bulus: "S cwayt n ȓweqṯ ṯa niɣ s waṭṭas, nec tettareɣ zi Arebbi i cek ḏ yinni iy ḏayi itesȓan nhara aḏ tḏewȓem am nec walakin bȓa snaseȓ-a."<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Ikkar Uzeǧiḏ ḏ Lwali ḏ Brinka ḏ yinni kiḏsen iqqimen. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Fɣen, nnan i wayawya qa bnaḏem-a war itegg ca minxef isḏaheǧ ȓmewṯ niɣ ḏ ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Inna-as uzeǧiḏ Aɣribas i lwali Fastus: "Bnaḏem-a maƹlik war istanef ddaƹweṯ nnes ɣar Qayṣar ataf tuɣaṯ itwaḍȓeq."<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Itraḥ arrasul Bulus ɣar ṯendint n Ruma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Wami umaren aḏaneɣ ssekken ḏeg uɣarrabu ɣar ṯmurṯ n Iṭalya, sellmen Bulus ḏ ȓebƹaḍ n imeḥbas akiḏes ijjen n uƹaskari ḏ ameqqran n arrumanus qqaren-as Yulyus. Netta yusa-d zi ȓƹaskar nni umi qqaren &lt;Lfirqa n Qayṣar.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Ngaƹƹeḏ ḏeg yijjen n uɣarrabu itraḥen ḏi ȓweqṯ nni zi ȓmuwyi n Adramit ɣar ȓmuyawaṯ n lʼiqlim n Asya. Iruḥ akiḏneɣ Aristarxus, netta zi Ayṯ-Masidunya zi ṯendint n Salunik.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Ṯiwecca nnes, wami nuweḍ ɣar ṯendint n Ṣayda igga ȓxir Yulus ḏi Bulus ijji-ṯ aḏ iraḥ ɣar imeddukaȓ nnes bac aḏayes thillan. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Ssenni neffeɣ nruḥ ḏeg uɣarrabu ḏi jjiheṯ nni mani ihedden ȓebḥar n ṯeyzirṯ n Qubruṣ, minzi arriḥ iccaṯ-aneɣ-d ɣar uɣembub nneɣ. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Wami neƹḏu ȓebḥar nni iy iǧan zzaṯ i lʼiqlim n Kilikya ḏ lʼiqlim n Pamfilya, nuweḍ ɣar ṯendint n Mira ḏi lʼiqlim n Likya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Yufa ḏinni uƹaskari nni ameqqran ijjen n uɣarrabu yusa-d zi ṯendint n Iskandariya itraḥ ḏi ȓweqṯ nni ɣar ṯmurṯ n Iṭalya, isney-aneɣ ḏayes. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Aṭṭas n wussan neccin iggur zzayneɣ uɣarrabu walakin yuyur ɣir cwayt n ubriḏ waha, menbaƹd neƹḏu ṭṭarf i ṯendint n Kanidus. Wami arriḥ war ḏaneɣ ijji ca a nkemmeȓ x ubriḏ nni, neƹḏu swadday n ṯeyzirṯ n Krit jjiheṯ n Qabu n Salmun. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />S bezzez nuggur ṭṭarf ṭṭarf n ȓbarr menbaƹd nuweḍ ɣar yijjen n umcan qqaren-as &lt;Ȓmarsaṯ Ṯiṣebḥanin&gt; netta yuḏes i ubilaj n Lisya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9-10" />Ussan n Ȓƹiḏ ṣafi ƹḏun, tuɣa neƹḍeȓ aṭṭas n ȓweqṯ ḥetta wami iḏweȓ usafar nneɣ ḏi ȓebḥar ḏayes lxaṭar. Ikkar Bulus iƹȓem-asen inna-asen: "A siyaḏi, qa nec twaȓiɣ asafar nneɣ aḏ yiȓi ḏ ijjen n lmuṣiba ḏ ijjen n ṯxessarṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant, maci ɣir aɣarrabu ḏ sseȓƹaṯ waha, walakin ƹaweḏ uȓa ḏ ṯuḏarṯ nneɣ." <verse eid="ACT 27:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Walakin aƹaskari nni ameqqran war ḏas iggi ca array i Bulus, igga array i bab n uɣarrabu ḏ arrayes nnes. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Lʼianna ȓmarsa nni ḏ ṯaƹeffant bac aḏayes seƹḏun ȓmecta ḏinni. X manaya azyen ameqqran ggin aḏ uyuren ssenni ḏeg uɣarrabu, tmennan aḏ awḍen ɣar ubilaj n Finikes aḏayes seƹḏun ȓmecta. Nettaṯ ḏ ijjen n ȓmarsa ḏi ṯeyzirṯ n Krit teḍhur ɣar ljanub ḏ ccamal ḏi jjiheṯ n lɣarbi.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lƹaṣifa ḏi ȓebḥar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Wami d iṣuḍ ijjen n arriḥ ifsus zi ljanub, itɣir-asen ufin min rezzun. Sgaƹƹḏen-d aȓiyzim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aȓiyzim netta ḏ agerzim uɣarrabu. Aȓiyzim-a tceddan-ṯ s usɣun. Xmi ixes aḏ yuyur uɣarrabu sgaƹƹaḏen-ṯ-iḏ.</char></note> n uɣarrabu ruḥen ḏi ȓebḥar ṭṭarf i ȓbarr n ṯeyzirṯ nni n Krit. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Walakin menbaƹd cwayt ikkar-d ijjen n arriḥ ijheḏ ihwa-d zi ṯeyzirṯ nni, arriḥ nni qqaren-as &lt;Asmawi.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asmawi netta ḏ arriḥ, ȓebƹaḍ qqaren-as Aɣmi.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Lƹaṣifa nni ṯuwi aɣarrabu, wami war nzemmar ca a nuyur ɣar zzaṯ nejja aɣarrabu nni aṯ yawi arriḥ. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Nnuffar zi arriḥ wami neƹḏu swadday n yijjen n ṯeyzirṯ ḏ ṯamezyant qqaren-as Kawda. Izeyyar xaneɣ aṭṭas ȓḥaȓ walakin nrekken ṯaɣarrabut n lʼiɣaṯa, <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />nesgaƹƹeḏ-it-id ɣar uɣarrabu. Ixeddamen cedden aɣarrabu s iseɣwan swadday bac war itrezzi ca. Wami ggwḏen aɣarrabu aḏ yuyur aḏ innaɣ ḏeg yijḏi n ȓebḥar n Surt, sehwan-d ȓeqȓuƹ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ȓeqȓaƹ uɣarrabu netta ḏ ijjen n ȓbacc n ṯcuqqet itiȓi ɣar uɣarrabu itṣuḍ ḏayes arriḥ iggur.</char></note> uɣarrabu jjin arriḥ aṯ yawi. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Ṯarni lƹaṣifa nni, ṯiwecca nnes bḏan neṭṭaren sseȓƹaṯ ḏi ȓebḥar. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Nhar wis ṯeȓtiyyam nḍaren ȓqecc uɣarrabu ḏi ȓebḥar s ifassen nsen. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Ṯeqqim amenni lƹaṣifa nni, aṭṭas n wussan war neẓri ṯfuct uȓa ḏ yiṯran. Neccin ḏeg uneggaru nefqeḏ lʼamal belli a nenjem.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Wami kkin aṭṭas n ȓweqṯ war ccin ca aɣrum, ikkar Bulus inna-asen: "Ay iryazen, maƹlik ḏayi ṯeggim array war ṯeffiɣem ca zi ṯeyzirṯ n Krit, ataf qa war xawem ṯekki ca tamara-ya niɣ ḏ ṯxessarṯ-a. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ȓexxu tettareɣ zzaywem aḏ tiȓim ḏ iryazen aqa war itmetti ḥadd zzaywem, ɣir aɣarrabu-ya aḏ irez waha. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Cuf, ǧiȓeṯ-a ṯanita qa ṯmeḍhar-ayi-d ijjen n lmalaʼika n Arebbi, Arebbi wenni umi xeddmeɣ netta ḏ bab inu. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />Ṯenna-ayi lmalaʼika nni: A Bulus, war teggweḏ ca! Wa labud aḏ tbeddeḏ ɣar Lmalik Qayṣar. Xzar ƹaweḏ, yinni iy kiḏec itsafaren marra isenjem-iṯen Arebbi akiḏec." <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" /><char style="it">Inna-asen Bulus:</char> "Iwa iȓiṯ ḏ iryazen! Qa nec tamneɣ zi Arebbi min ḏayi inna aḏ yiȓi qa aḏ yiȓi. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Walakin labud aḏ innaɣ uɣarrabu-ya ɣar ṭṭarf n can ṯeyzirṯ."<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Ḏi ǧiȓeṯ nni wis arbeƹṭacar yum neccin ƹaḏ nuggur nweddar ḏi ȓebḥar n Wadriyatiki, ɣar uzyen n ǧiȓeṯ tɣir-asen i ixeddamen n uɣarrabu qa tqerraben ɣar ȓbarr. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ƹbaren ȓaǧeɣ n ȓebḥar ufin sebƹa u ṯȓaṯin mitru. Ṯeƹḏu cwayt n ȓweqṯ, ƹaweḏ ƹbaren ufin <char style="it">ɣir</char> sebƹa u ƹicrin mitru. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Ggwḏen aɣarrabu aḏ iȓqef izra, nḍaren zi puppa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Puppa qqaren-t i ḏeffar n uɣarrabu.</char></note> n uɣarrabu arbeƹa n iȓiyzam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iȓiyzam niṯni ḏ igerzam.</char></note> qqimen tẓaǧan bac aḏ iṣbeḥ ȓḥaȓ. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Ixeddamen n uɣarrabu wami rezzun aḏ arewȓen zzayes, sehwan ṯaɣarrabut n lʼiɣaṯa ɣar waman sneƹmiȓen axmi xsen aḏ nḍaren iȓiyzam zi pruba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pruba qqaren-t i zzaṯ uɣarrabu.</char></note> uɣarrabu. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Inna-as Bulus i uƹaskari nni ameqqran ḏ ȓƹaskar nni akiḏes: "Meȓa war qqimen ca ixeddamen-a ḏeg uɣarrabu, war ṯzemmarem ca aḏ tnejmem." <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Ȓexddenni ȓƹaskar qessen iseɣwan n ṯɣarrabut n lʼiɣaṯa jjin-teṯ axasen ṯbeƹƹeḏ.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Wami ibḏa aḏ iṣbeḥ ȓḥaȓ, ikkar Bulus ittar zzaysen marra aḏ ccen ca n ȓḥajeṯ inna-asen: "Ṯeƹḏu arbeƹṭacar yum trajam waha ṯeǧuzem, war ṯeccim walu. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Ȓexxu tettareɣ zzaywem aḏ teccem can ȓḥajeṯ bac aḏ teqqimem ṯeddarem, war iweṭṭi uȓa ḏ ijjen n uzuṭṭu zeg uzeǧif nwem." <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Wami inna awaȓ-a, ikkar iysi-d aɣrum icekkar Arebbi zzaṯsen marra, irez-iṯ ibḏa itett-iṯ. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Cejjƹen marra iḏsen ccin. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Neccin lƹadad nneɣ ḏeg uɣarrabu miyytayen u setta u sebƹin n yiwḏan. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Wami ccin jjiwnen, nḍaren irḏan ḏi ȓebḥar bac aḏ sfessen aɣarrabu.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Wami d iṣbeḥ ȓḥaȓ, twaȓan ca n ṯmurṯ niṯni war t ssinen ca. Ẓrin ijjen n lxalij ḏinni, cceṭṭ nnes ḏayes ijḏi. Ggin aɣares sqarrben aɣarrabu meȓa zemmaren-as. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Qeḍwen iȓiyzam jjin-ṯen ḏi ȓebḥar, serxun iseɣwan iy zi twarekknen dmamaṯ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dmamaṯ nni niṯni am ṯnayen n ȓemqaddef imɣaren tiȓin aȓ ḏeffar uɣarrabu. Ixeddamen sneqȓaben zzaysen lʼitijah uɣarrabu.</char></note> Sgaƹƹḏen ȓeqȓaƹ n zzaṯ i arriḥ itṣuḍen, wejjhen ɣar ȓbarr. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Walakin aɣarrabu ikka ḏeg yijjen n uyeddim n yijḏi ḏi ȓwesṭ n waman innuɣ ḏayes ḏinni. Pruba nnes ṯennuɣ mliḥ war tenhezzi ca. Puppa nnes ṯebḏa trezza ccaṯen-t ȓemwaj.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Ȓƹaskar nwan aḏ nɣen imeḥbas bac war zzaysen itƹummi ḥadd aḏ yarweȓ. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Walakin aƹaskari nni ameqqran ixes aḏ isenjem Bulus, isbedd-iṯen x min xsen aḏ ggen. Yumar yinni issnen aḏ ƹummen aḏ neḍwen ḏ imezwura ḥima aḏ ffɣen ɣar ȓbarr. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Inneɣni aṯen ḏfaren x ṯfeȓwin niɣ x ṯeȓwiḥin uɣarrabu. Amenni iy ggin bac aḏ ffɣen marra iḏsen ɣar ȓbarr aḏ nejmen.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus ḏi ṯeyzirṯ n Malṭa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Wami nenjem nuweḍ ɣar ȓbarr, nufa isem n ṯeyzirṯ nni qqaren-as Malṭa. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Ibarbariyen n ṯmurṯ nni ggin ḏayneɣ ȓxir aṭṭas. Reḥben zzayneɣ marra, ceƹƹȓen-aneɣ ṯimessi minzi tuɣa ṯesmeḍ ƹaweḏ iccaṯ unẓar. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Bulus ijmeƹ-d ikeccuḍen, wami ṯen isers ḏi ṯmessi iffeɣ-d ijjen n ufiɣer zi ȓeḥmu, iqqes-as iȓseq-as ḏeg ufus. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Wami ẓrin ibarbariyen fiɣer iȓseq ḏeg ufus n Bulus, nnan jarasen: Nican aryaz-a wanita inɣa can yijjen. Arebbi nneɣ umi qqaren &lt;Lʼirada&gt; war ṯ ijji ca aḏ iddar waxxa injem zi ȓebḥar. <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Walakin Bulus inḍar fiɣer nni ḏi ṯmessi war ḏas iwqiƹ walu. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Ibarbariyen nni trajan ma aḏ yuff wa ima ḏeɣya aḏ iwḍa aḏ immeṯ. Wami ṯ rajan aṭṭas twaȓan-ṯ war ḏas iwqiƹ walu, ibeddeȓ array nsen nnan wanita ḏ can yijjen zi arebbiṯen nneɣ!<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Ȓbarr-a wanita yuḏes ɣar ca n ṯmura n arrayes n ṯeyzirṯ nni, netta qqaren-as Publiyus. Irḥeb zzayneɣ, isnewjew-aneɣ ikarem-aneɣ ṯeȓtiyyam. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Babas n Publiyus itnezbar ḏi ṯassuṯ ihȓec s ṯmessi itazzeȓ-as uƹeddis. Iruḥ ɣares Bulus ɣar uxxam nnes iẓẓuǧ, isers xas ifassen nnes isgenfa-ṯ. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Iwqeƹ manayenni, senni usin-d ɣares imehȓac n ṯeyzirṯ nni marra isgenfa-ṯen Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Weqqaren-aneɣ ucin-aneɣ aṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin. Wami nekkar a neffeɣ ḏeg uɣarrabu, ḏebbaren-aneɣ-d ȓqecc nni iy neḥḏaj.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itaweḍ ɣar ṯendint n Ruma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Menbaƹd i ṯeȓt chur, ngaƹƹeḏ ḏeg yijjen n uɣarrabu zi Iskandariya tuɣa iseƹḏu ȓmecta ḏi ṯeyzirṯ nni. Aɣarrabu nni x uɣembub nnes ḏayes lʼaṣnam semman-ṯen &lt;Icniwen n Arebbi.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Nuweḍ ɣar ṯendint n Saraqusa neqqim ḏayes ṯeȓtiyyam. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Ssenni nruḥ ḏeg uɣarrabu ɣar ṯendint n Riǧew. Ṯiwecca nnes ikkar-d ijjen n arriḥ zi ljanub, nhar wis ṯeȓtiyyam nuweḍ ɣar ȓmuyi n Butisuli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Nufa ḏinni ȓebƹaḍ n ayṯmaṯneɣ, ƹarḍen-aneɣ a neqqim akiḏsen sebƹiyyam. Amenni iy nuweḍ ɣar ṯendint n Ruma.<verse eid="ACT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Ɣarsen ȓexbar ɣar ayṯmaṯneɣ ḏi Ruma nusa-d, ffɣen-d aḏaneɣ d ȓqan ḥetta ɣar Ssuq n Wabyan u ḥetta ɣar Ṯraṯa n Ṯuḏrin n imsafaren. Wami ṯen iẓra Bulus, icekkar Arebbi itwacejjeƹ. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Nuḏef ṯandint n Ruma, ismeḥ-as ȓmexzen i Bulus aḏ izḏeɣ waḥḏes akiḏes iqqim ijjen n uƹaskari axas iƹesses.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itbeccar ḏi ṯendint n Ruma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ṯeƹḏu ṯeȓtiyyam, iȓaɣa-d Bulus x imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil. Wami d munen inna-asen: "Ay ayṯma, nec war ggiɣ walu ḍed i ccaƹb nneɣ niɣ ḍed i lƹadaṯ n ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ. Waxxa amenni ṭṭfen-ayi ḏi Lquds sellmen-ayi i ifassen n arrumanus. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Niṯni ggin-ayi lʼistijwab, xsen aḏayi ḍeȓqen minzi war xafi ufin bu can ttuhma iy xef sḏaheǧeɣ ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Wami Ayṯ-Israʼil ƹarrḍen qa war ufiɣ illa aḏ stanfeɣ ddaƹweṯ inu ɣar Lmalik Qayṣar. Walakin nec war ggiɣ bu can ttuhma x lʼumma inu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Iḏen x manaya ttareɣ-kenniw akenniw ẓreɣ akiḏwem ssiwȓeɣ. Aqa ƹlaḥsab lʼamal n Ayṯ-Israʼil iy twaceddeɣ s ssensȓeṯ-a."<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Nnan-as: "War ḏaneɣ d ṯuwiḍ xak uȓa ḏ ijjen n ṯebrat zi jwayeh n Yahuḏiya. Zeg yinni iy d yusin zi ayṯmaṯneɣ ssenni war ḏaneɣ issiweȓ ḥadd xac, war xak inni ḥadd ȓƹib. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Walakin nexs aḏac nṣennet lʼafkar nnec minzi nessen aṭṭas n yiwḏan ḏi mkuȓ amcan tƹarraḍen i ȓḥizeb-a wanita."<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Ttafqen aḏ meȓqen ijjen n nhar, tmarnin-d inneɣni usin-d ɣares aṭṭas iḏsen ɣar ṯeddarṯ mani iqqim Bulus. Ibḏa itḥeddaṯ-iṯen zi ṣbaḥ aȓ wami d yuweḍ uƹecci netta icehheḏ s ȓmulk n Arebbi, ixes aṯen iseqneƹ s Ccariƹa n Musa ḏ Lkutub n lʼanbiya x Ƹisa. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen qtanƹen s min inna, ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen war uminen ca. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Niṯni war mesfhimen ca ak wayawya. Qbeȓ ma aḏ ffɣen ssenni, inna-asen Bulus awaȓ-a ḏ aneggaru: "Arruḥ iqeddsen inna ȓḥaqq i ȓejḏuḏ nwem s yiȓes n nnabi Icaƹya, inna:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />&lt;Ruḥ ɣar ccaƹb-a ini-yasen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Cḥaȓ ma tesȓam war ṯfehhmem, cḥaȓ ma ṯxezzarem war twiȓim.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Ȓaḥeqqac ccaƹb-a, uȓawen nsen ḏewȓen am uzru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">ƹȓayen war tesȓin walu, qqnen ṯiṭṭawin nsen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Ḥima war twiȓin s ṯiṭṭawin nsen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">war tesȓin s imejjan nsen, war fehhmen s wuȓawen nsen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">aɣari d ḏewȓen aṯen sgenfiɣ.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Iwa itxeṣṣa aḏ tessnem uȓa ḏ yinni war iǧin ca ḏ israʼiliyen Arebbi aṯen isenjem, niṯni aḏas sȓen." <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />{Wami inna awaȓ-a, ffɣen Ayṯ-Israʼil zzayes temnaqaren s jjheḏ jarasen.} <verse eid="ACT 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Iqqim Bulus ƹamayen ḏi ṯeddarṯ nni itxeǧas ȓekra netta s yixef nnes. Itreḥḥab s yinni iy ɣares d igguren marra. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Itḥeddaṯ-iṯen s ȓmulk n Arebbi, iseȓmaḏ x Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ s yijjen n zƹameṯ ḏ lḥurriya.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>